Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:56.73,*ENG,2,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, it's just too hot today, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:01.23,*ENG,3,0,0,0,,And it's going to get even worse. Temperatures up in the mid- 30s Celsius...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:05.10,*ENG,4,0,0,0,,...that's the mid- 90s Fahrenheit, tomorrow, maybe even hitting 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:07.94,*ENG,5,0,0,0,,So, please, remember to cover up and stay cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.11,0:01:10.95,*ENG,6,0,0,0,,...with the hottest hits on your FM dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.85,*ENG,7,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:16.71,*ENG,8,0,0,0,,Come on, love, off you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:22.13,*ENG,9,0,0,0,,- Do we have to? - Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:25.66,*ENG,10,0,0,0,,I'll make you your favorite dinner to compensate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:28.69,*ENG,11,0,0,0,,He squealed like a pig, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:32.39,*ENG,12,0,0,0,,Yeah, brilliant punch, Big D. Did you see his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:34.40,*ENG,13,0,0,0,,Hey, Big D.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.31,0:01:36.93,*ENG,14,0,0,0,,Beat up another 10- year-old?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:39.60,*ENG,15,0,0,0,,- This one deserved it. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:44.41,*ENG,16,0,0,0,,- Five against one, very brave. - Well, you're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:49.85,*ENG,17,0,0,0,,Moaning in your sleep every night? At least I'm not afraid of my pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.86,*ENG,18,0,0,0,,"Don't kill Cedric."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:01:56.95,*ENG,19,0,0,0,,Who's Cedric, your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:02.25,*ENG,20,0,0,0,,- Shut up. - "He's going to kill me, Mum."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:04.93,*ENG,21,0,0,0,,Where is your mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:08.40,*ENG,22,0,0,0,,Where is your mum, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.64,*ENG,23,0,0,0,,She dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:13.44,*ENG,24,0,0,0,,Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.31,*ENG,25,0,0,0,,Is she a dead Pott...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.32,*ENG,26,0,0,0,,- Dudley. - Dudley, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:36.06,*ENG,27,0,0,0,,- What's going on? - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:39.20,*ENG,28,0,0,0,,- I'm not doing anything. - We're getting out of here, Dudley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:40.89,*ENG,29,0,0,0,,Come on, Dudley, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:33.19,*ENG,30,0,0,0,,Dudley, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:10.26,*ENG,31,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:41.89,*ENG,32,0,0,0,,Mrs. Figg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.86,*ENG,33,0,0,0,,Don't put away your wand, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:50.53,*ENG,34,0,0,0,,They might come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:54.77,*ENG,35,0,0,0,,Dementors in Little Whinging, whatever next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.90,*ENG,36,0,0,0,,- Whole world's gone topsy-turvy. - I don't understand. How do you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:01.27,*ENG,37,0,0,0,,Dumbledore asked me to keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:04.85,*ENG,38,0,0,0,,Dumbledore asked you? You know Dumbledore?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:08.85,*ENG,39,0,0,0,,After You- Know- Who killed that poor Diggory boy last year...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:11.68,*ENG,40,0,0,0,,...did you expect him to let you go wandering on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.52,*ENG,41,0,0,0,,Good Lord, boy. They told me you were intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.69,0:05:17.82,*ENG,42,0,0,0,,Now, get inside and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:22.66,*ENG,43,0,0,0,,Expect someone will be in touch soon. Whatever happens, don't leave the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:34.44,*ENG,44,0,0,0,,It is hot. That's right, hot everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:36.74,*ENG,45,0,0,0,,There's sweat. There's stifling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.81,*ENG,46,0,0,0,,Diddykins?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.17,*ENG,47,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:47.52,*ENG,48,0,0,0,,Duddy. Vernon, come quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.73,*ENG,49,0,0,0,,We're going to have to take him to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:53.02,*ENG,50,0,0,0,,Who did this to you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:05:59.20,*ENG,51,0,0,0,,Happy, are we, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:03.20,*ENG,52,0,0,0,,You've finally done it. You've finally driven him loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:06.17,*ENG,53,0,0,0,,Vernon, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:10.71,*ENG,54,0,0,0,,Well, just look at him, Petunia. Our boy has gone yumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.04,*ENG,55,0,0,0,,I've reached my limit, do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:17.05,*ENG,56,0,0,0,,This is the last I'm gonna take of you and your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:33.06,*ENG,57,0,0,0,,- Dear Mr. Potter. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:38.47,*ENG,58,0,0,0,,The Ministry has received intelligence that at 6:23 this evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:43.38,*ENG,59,0,0,0,,...you performed the Patronus Charm in the presence of a Muggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:45.64,*ENG,60,0,0,0,,As a clear violation...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:49.88,*ENG,61,0,0,0,,...of the Decree for the Reasonable Restriction of Underage Sorcery...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:52.18,*ENG,62,0,0,0,,...you are hereby expelled...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:56.08,*ENG,63,0,0,0,,...from Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:07:01.20,*ENG,64,0,0,0,,Hoping you are well, Mafalda Hopkirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.67,*ENG,65,0,0,0,,Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.11,*ENG,66,0,0,0,,He's not very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:36.43,*ENG,67,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:45.43,*ENG,68,0,0,0,,Very clean, these Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:48.67,*ENG,69,0,0,0,,- Tonks, for God's sake. - Unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.20,*ENG,70,0,0,0,,Professor Moody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:57.67,*ENG,71,0,0,0,,- What are you doing here? - Rescuing you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:03.28,*ENG,72,0,0,0,,But where are we going? The letter said I've been expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:05.89,*ENG,73,0,0,0,,You haven't been. Not yet. Kingsley, you take point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:07.05,*ENG,74,0,0,0,,But the letter said...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:10.25,*ENG,75,0,0,0,,Dumbledore persuaded the minister to suspend your expulsion...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:12.59,*ENG,76,0,0,0,,- ...pending a formal hearing. - A hearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:16.13,*ENG,77,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We'll explain everything when we get back to headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.60,*ENG,78,0,0,0,,Not here, Nymphadora.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:22.60,*ENG,79,0,0,0,,Don't call me Nymphadora.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:32.07,*ENG,80,0,0,0,,Stay in formation, everyone. Don't break ranks if one of us is killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.89,*ENG,81,0,0,0,,Come on, you, around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:27.40,*ENG,82,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:08.61,*ENG,83,0,0,0,,In you go, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.64,*ENG,84,0,0,0,,There've been no sightings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:13.54,*ENG,85,0,0,0,,No deaths. No proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:16.58,*ENG,86,0,0,0,,He almost killed Harry. If that isn't proof enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:20.69,*ENG,87,0,0,0,,Yes, but guarding you- know- what is the most important...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:25.39,*ENG,88,0,0,0,,We must trust Dumbledore on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:29.97,*ENG,89,0,0,0,,Was he able to protect Harry last year? Well, tonight I say it's time to take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:33.33,*ENG,90,0,0,0,,Cornelius Fudge is a politician first and a wizard second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:36.67,*ENG,91,0,0,0,,- His instinct would be to ignore it... - Keep your voices down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:41.28,*ENG,92,0,0,0,,He's getting stronger and stronger by the minute. We have to act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.55,*ENG,93,0,0,0,,- Harry. - Mrs. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.19,0:11:52.68,*ENG,94,0,0,0,,Heavens, you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:59.92,*ENG,95,0,0,0,,Bit peaky, but I'm afraid dinner will wait until after the meeting's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:05.23,*ENG,96,0,0,0,,Nope. No time to explain. Straight upstairs, first door on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.04,*ENG,97,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:14.50,*ENG,98,0,0,0,,Mudblood, werewolves, traitors, thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:19.55,*ENG,99,0,0,0,,If my poor mistress knew the scum they let into her house...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:22.01,*ENG,100,0,0,0,,...what would she say to old Kreacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:26.04,*ENG,101,0,0,0,,Oh, the shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:41.16,*ENG,102,0,0,0,,- Freaks. - There, there, mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:44.74,*ENG,103,0,0,0,,Scum of the earth. Not like it was in the days of my fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.94,0:12:47.54,*ENG,104,0,0,0,,Kreacher is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:53.05,*ENG,105,0,0,0,,Oh, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:59.69,*ENG,106,0,0,0,,Are you all right? We overheard them talking about the Dementor attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:02.69,*ENG,107,0,0,0,,- You must tell us everything. - Let the man breathe, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:07.06,*ENG,108,0,0,0,,And this hearing at the Ministry. It's just outrageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:09.39,*ENG,109,0,0,0,,I've looked it up. They simply can't expel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:12.26,*ENG,110,0,0,0,,- It's completely unfair. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:15.40,*ENG,111,0,0,0,,There's a lot of that going round at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.31,0:13:19.24,*ENG,112,0,0,0,,So, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.41,0:13:22.11,*ENG,113,0,0,0,,- It's headquarters. - Of the Order of the Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:24.40,*ENG,114,0,0,0,,It's a secret society.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:27.14,*ENG,115,0,0,0,,Dumbledore formed it back when they fought You- Know- Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:29.88,*ENG,116,0,0,0,,Couldn't have put any of this in a letter, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:32.75,*ENG,117,0,0,0,,I've gone all summer without a scrap of news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:36.95,*ENG,118,0,0,0,,We wanted to write, mate. Really, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:38.18,*ENG,119,0,0,0,,- Only... - Only what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:41.56,*ENG,120,0,0,0,,Only Dumbledore made us swear not to tell you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:45.06,*ENG,121,0,0,0,,Dumbledore said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.87,0:13:49.60,*ENG,122,0,0,0,,But why would he keep me in the dark? Maybe I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.74,*ENG,123,0,0,0,,I'm the one who saw Voldemort return...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:54.74,*ENG,124,0,0,0,,...the one who fought him, who saw Cedric Diggory get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:57.11,*ENG,125,0,0,0,,- Harry. - Thought we heard your dulcet tones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:14:01.34,*ENG,126,0,0,0,,- Don't bottle it up, though, mate. Let it out. - Lf you're all done shouting...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:04.01,*ENG,127,0,0,0,,Do you wanna hear something a little more interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:08.65,*ENG,128,0,0,0,,If anyone has a right to know, it's Harry. If it wasn't for Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:10.88,*ENG,129,0,0,0,,...we wouldn't even know voldemort was back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:12.62,*ENG,130,0,0,0,,He's not a child, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.16,*ENG,131,0,0,0,,But he's not an adult either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:18.40,*ENG,132,0,0,0,,- He's not James, Sirius. - Well, he's not your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:20.73,*ENG,133,0,0,0,,He's as good as.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:22.80,*ENG,134,0,0,0,,- Who else has he got? - Hey, Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:25.41,*ENG,135,0,0,0,,- He's got me. - How touchingly paternal, Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:28.67,*ENG,136,0,0,0,,Perhaps Potter will grow up to be a felon, just like his godfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:30.61,*ENG,137,0,0,0,,Now, you stay out of this, Snivellus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.84,*ENG,138,0,0,0,,- Snape's part of the Order? - Git.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:34.88,*ENG,139,0,0,0,,About your supposed reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:37.78,*ENG,140,0,0,0,,- I know better. - So why don't you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.65,*ENG,141,0,0,0,,- Get off it. - Ouick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:41.45,*ENG,142,0,0,0,,- Get it up. - Crookshanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.02,*ENG,143,0,0,0,,- Stop it. - Get off, you bloody cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:46.46,*ENG,144,0,0,0,,- Crookshanks. Leave it alone. - Get it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:52.09,*ENG,145,0,0,0,,- Hermione, I hate your cat. - Bad Crookshanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:56.00,*ENG,146,0,0,0,,Well, we'll be eating down in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.27,*ENG,147,0,0,0,,Just because you're allowed to use magic now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:02.47,*ENG,148,0,0,0,,...does not mean you have to whip your wands out for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.24,*ENG,149,0,0,0,,Hi, Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:06.94,*ENG,150,0,0,0,,You hungry, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:09.74,*ENG,151,0,0,0,,You sure you're all right, Harry? Gave us quite a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.08,*ENG,152,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:16.09,*ENG,153,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:24.10,*ENG,154,0,0,0,,This is very, very peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:27.93,*ENG,155,0,0,0,,It seems your hearing in the Ministry is to be before the entire Wizengamot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:31.54,*ENG,156,0,0,0,,I don't understand. What has the Ministry of Magic got against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:35.88,*ENG,157,0,0,0,,Show him. He'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:46.25,*ENG,158,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:49.28,*ENG,159,0,0,0,,He's been attacking Dumbledore as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:51.08,*ENG,160,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:56.12,*ENG,161,0,0,0,,Fudge is using all his power, including his influence at the Daily Prophet...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:59.42,*ENG,162,0,0,0,,...to smear anyone who claims the Dark Lord has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:00.90,*ENG,163,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:03.04,*ENG,164,0,0,0,,He thinks Dumbledore's after his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.33,*ENG,165,0,0,0,,No one in their right mind could believe that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:08.38,*ENG,166,0,0,0,,Exactly the point. Fudge isn't in his right mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:11.07,*ENG,167,0,0,0,,It's been twisted and warped by fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:15.18,*ENG,168,0,0,0,,Now, fear makes people do terrible things, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.79,*ENG,169,0,0,0,,The last time Voldemort gained power...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:21.29,*ENG,170,0,0,0,,...he almost destroyed everything we hold most dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:25.39,*ENG,171,0,0,0,,Now he's returned, and I'm afraid the minister will do almost anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:28.50,*ENG,172,0,0,0,,...to avoid facing that terrifying truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.77,0:16:34.43,*ENG,173,0,0,0,,We think Voldemort wants to build up his army again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:38.23,*ENG,174,0,0,0,,Fourteen years ago, he had huge numbers at his command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:42.97,*ENG,175,0,0,0,,And not just witches and wizards, but all manner of dark creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:47.61,*ENG,176,0,0,0,,He's been recruiting heavily, and we've been attempting to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:52.32,*ENG,177,0,0,0,,But gathering followers isn't the only thing he's interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:57.09,*ENG,178,0,0,0,,We believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.03,*ENG,179,0,0,0,,...Voldemort may be after something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:01.29,*ENG,180,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.80,*ENG,181,0,0,0,,Something he didn't have last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:11.30,*ENG,182,0,0,0,,You mean like a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:15.54,*ENG,183,0,0,0,,No. That's enough. He's just a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:18.51,*ENG,184,0,0,0,,You say more and you might as well induct him into the Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:22.48,*ENG,185,0,0,0,,Good. I want to join. If Voldemort's raising an army, then I want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:36.83,*ENG,186,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:39.26,*ENG,187,0,0,0,,You are hereby expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:42.23,*ENG,188,0,0,0,,Before the entire Wizengamot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.34,*ENG,189,0,0,0,,Trains. Underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:55.81,*ENG,190,0,0,0,,Ingenious, these Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.83,*ENG,191,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:21.10,*ENG,192,0,0,0,,I've never used the visitors' entrance before. Should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:26.15,*ENG,193,0,0,0,,Right. Good. I'll just get my Muggle money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:09.06,*ENG,194,0,0,0,,Terrible. Lost a lot of Galleons trading on the potions market.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:12.52,*ENG,195,0,0,0,,Daily Prophet, ladies and gentlemen. Anybody for Daily Prophet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:15.69,*ENG,196,0,0,0,,Dumbledore. Is he daft, or is he dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.45,*ENG,197,0,0,0,,- Morning, Arthur. - Morning, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:44.65,*ENG,198,0,0,0,,Interdepartmental memos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:48.79,*ENG,199,0,0,0,,We used to use owls. Mess was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:57.37,*ENG,200,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard. Thank you, Kingsley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:20:00.91,*ENG,201,0,0,0,,- They've changed the time of your hearing. - When is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:03.18,*ENG,202,0,0,0,,In five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:14.08,*ENG,203,0,0,0,,Department of Mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:20.76,*ENG,204,0,0,0,,And I'm confident, minister, that you will do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:23.02,*ENG,205,0,0,0,,Yes, but we must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:33.61,*ENG,206,0,0,0,,Remember, during the hearing, speak only when you're spoken to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:37.30,*ENG,207,0,0,0,,Keep calm. You've done nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:40.88,*ENG,208,0,0,0,,As the Muggles say, truth will out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:42.75,*ENG,209,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:46.22,*ENG,210,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed in, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.62,*ENG,211,0,0,0,,Good luck, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:56.09,*ENG,212,0,0,0,,Disciplinary hearing of the 12th of August...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:59.20,*ENG,213,0,0,0,,...into offenses committed by Harry James Potter...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:03.00,*ENG,214,0,0,0,,...resident at Number 4 Privet Drive, Little Whinging, Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:06.27,*ENG,215,0,0,0,,Interrogators: Cornelius Oswald Fudge, Minister of Mag...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:08.27,*ENG,216,0,0,0,,Witness for the defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:15.35,*ENG,217,0,0,0,,Albus Percival Wulfric...Brian Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:18.92,*ENG,218,0,0,0,,You got our message that the time and place of the hearing...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:21.65,*ENG,219,0,0,0,,- ...had been changed, did you? - I must have missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:25.76,*ENG,220,0,0,0,,But by a happy mistake, I arrived at the Ministry three hours early.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:29.93,*ENG,221,0,0,0,,The charges?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.62,*ENG,222,0,0,0,,The charges against the accused are as follows:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:34.43,*ENG,223,0,0,0,,"That he did knowingly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:38.16,*ENG,224,0,0,0,,...and in full awareness of the illegality of his actions...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:41.33,*ENG,225,0,0,0,,...produce a Patronus Charm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.51,0:21:44.74,*ENG,226,0,0,0,,...in the presence of a Muggle."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:48.21,*ENG,227,0,0,0,,- Do you deny producing said Patronus? - No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:51.84,*ENG,228,0,0,0,,And you were aware that you were forbidden to use magic outside school...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.02,0:21:54.89,*ENG,229,0,0,0,,- ...while under the age of 17? - Yes, I was, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:58.42,*ENG,230,0,0,0,,Witches and wizards of the Wizengamot...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:00.82,*ENG,231,0,0,0,,I was only doing it because of the Dementors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.57,0:22:05.19,*ENG,232,0,0,0,,Dementors?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.50,*ENG,233,0,0,0,,In Little Whinging?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.67,0:22:10.00,*ENG,234,0,0,0,,That's quite clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.17,0:22:13.30,*ENG,235,0,0,0,,Muggles can't see Dementors, can they, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:15.70,*ENG,236,0,0,0,,- Highly convenient. - I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:18.44,*ENG,237,0,0,0,,- There were two of them, and if I hadn't... - Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.61,0:22:22.81,*ENG,238,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to interrupt what I'm sure would have been a very well- rehearsed story...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.99,0:22:27.48,*ENG,239,0,0,0,,...but since you can produce no witnesses of the event...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:32.25,*ENG,240,0,0,0,,Pardon me, minister, but as it happens, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:38.69,*ENG,241,0,0,0,,Please describe the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.47,0:22:43.27,*ENG,242,0,0,0,,What did they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:49.28,*ENG,243,0,0,0,,Well, one of them was very large and the other rather skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:53.18,*ENG,244,0,0,0,,Not the boys. The Dementors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:57.01,*ENG,245,0,0,0,,Oh, right, right. Well, big.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.22,0:23:02.82,*ENG,246,0,0,0,,Cloaked. Then everything went cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:06.86,*ENG,247,0,0,0,,...as though all the happiness had gone from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.03,0:23:12.13,*ENG,248,0,0,0,,Now, look here. Dementors don't just wander into a Muggle suburb...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:15.93,*ENG,249,0,0,0,,...and happen across a wizard. The odds are astronomical.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:17.83,*ENG,250,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone would believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.01,0:23:21.03,*ENG,251,0,0,0,,...the Dementors were there by coincidence, minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.58,0:23:26.45,*ENG,252,0,0,0,,I'm sure I must have misunderstood you, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.62,0:23:32.11,*ENG,253,0,0,0,,Dementors are, after all, under the control of the Ministry of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.29,0:23:36.49,*ENG,254,0,0,0,,And it's so silly of me, but it sounded for a moment as though...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:40.65,*ENG,255,0,0,0,,...you were suggesting that the Ministry had ordered the attack on this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:43.63,*ENG,256,0,0,0,,That would be disturbing indeed, Madam Undersecretary...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:47.96,*ENG,257,0,0,0,,...which is why I'm sure the Ministry will be mounting a full- scale inquiry...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.14,0:23:51.50,*ENG,258,0,0,0,,...into why the two Dementors were so very far from Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.67,0:23:55.04,*ENG,259,0,0,0,,...and why they mounted an attack without authorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.91,0:23:58.14,*ENG,260,0,0,0,,Of course, there is someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.48,0:24:01.08,*ENG,261,0,0,0,,...who might be behind the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.09,0:24:08.72,*ENG,262,0,0,0,,Cornelius, I implore you to see reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.89,0:24:13.45,*ENG,263,0,0,0,,The evidence that the Dark Lord has returned is incontrovertible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.63,0:24:16.39,*ENG,264,0,0,0,,He is not back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.30,0:24:24.50,*ENG,265,0,0,0,,In the matter of Harry Potter...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.07,0:24:27.51,*ENG,266,0,0,0,,...the law clearly states...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:32.15,*ENG,267,0,0,0,,...that magic may be used before Muggles in life- threatening situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.31,0:24:35.22,*ENG,268,0,0,0,,Laws can be changed if necessary, Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.38,0:24:38.55,*ENG,269,0,0,0,,Clearly. Has it become practice to hold a full criminal trial...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:41.59,*ENG,270,0,0,0,,...to deal with a simple matter of underage magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:53.56,*ENG,271,0,0,0,,Those in favor of conviction?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.38,0:25:07.32,*ENG,272,0,0,0,,Those in favor of clearing the accused of all charges?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.43,0:25:23.69,*ENG,273,0,0,0,,Cleared of all charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.74,0:25:28.46,*ENG,274,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.42,0:25:44.48,*ENG,275,0,0,0,,Padfoot. Are you barking mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.65,0:25:47.02,*ENG,276,0,0,0,,You'll blow the entire operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.43,0:25:58.06,*ENG,277,0,0,0,,Sirius, what are you doing here? If somebody sees you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.23,0:26:00.83,*ENG,278,0,0,0,,I had to see you off, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.64,0:26:05.13,*ENG,279,0,0,0,,What's life without a little risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:07.67,*ENG,280,0,0,0,,I don't wanna see you get chucked back in Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:09.31,*ENG,281,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.75,0:26:14.74,*ENG,282,0,0,0,,Anyway, I wanted you to have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:23.15,*ENG,283,0,0,0,,Original Order of the Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.69,0:26:25.42,*ENG,284,0,0,0,,Marlene McKinnon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.59,0:26:28.15,*ENG,285,0,0,0,,She was killed two weeks after this was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.53,0:26:31.69,*ENG,286,0,0,0,,Voldemort wiped out her entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.13,0:26:33.93,*ENG,287,0,0,0,,Frank and Alice Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.10,0:26:35.59,*ENG,288,0,0,0,,Neville's parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.77,0:26:39.43,*ENG,289,0,0,0,,They suffered a fate worse than death, you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.38,0:26:43.85,*ENG,290,0,0,0,,It's been 14 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.68,0:26:48.88,*ENG,291,0,0,0,,And still a day doesn't go by I don't miss your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.56,0:26:56.22,*ENG,292,0,0,0,,Do you really think there's going to be a war, Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.89,0:27:01.92,*ENG,293,0,0,0,,It feels like it did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.17,0:27:07.97,*ENG,294,0,0,0,,You keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.44,0:27:12.84,*ENG,295,0,0,0,,Anyway, I suppose you're the young ones now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.04,0:27:16.88,*ENG,296,0,0,0,,I'll see you at the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.05,0:27:19.07,*ENG,297,0,0,0,,Bye- bye, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.98,0:27:21.45,*ENG,298,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:24.21,*ENG,299,0,0,0,,Hold my hand, lovey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.49,0:27:26.75,*ENG,300,0,0,0,,There they are. They're in the far carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.92,0:27:28.22,*ENG,301,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.43,0:28:13.37,*ENG,302,0,0,0,,I'm surprised the Ministry's still letting you walk around free.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:15.00,*ENG,303,0,0,0,,Better enjoy it while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.17,0:28:18.47,*ENG,304,0,0,0,,I expect there's a cell in Azkaban with your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.08,0:28:25.04,*ENG,305,0,0,0,,- What'd I tell you? Complete nutter. - Just stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.25,0:28:28.08,*ENG,306,0,0,0,,It's only Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.92,0:28:30.75,*ENG,307,0,0,0,,What'd you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.74,0:28:51.90,*ENG,308,0,0,0,,Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.07,0:28:53.74,*ENG,309,0,0,0,,- Hey, Neville. - Hey there, Neville.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.79,0:29:08.31,*ENG,310,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.49,0:29:13.76,*ENG,311,0,0,0,,- What's what? - That. Pulling the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:16.89,*ENG,312,0,0,0,,Nothing's pulling the carriage, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.53,0:29:19.76,*ENG,313,0,0,0,,It's pulling itself, like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.38,0:29:35.61,*ENG,314,0,0,0,,You're not going mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.19,0:29:40.42,*ENG,315,0,0,0,,I can see them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.69,0:29:44.28,*ENG,316,0,0,0,,You're just as sane as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.10,0:29:51.16,*ENG,317,0,0,0,,Everyone, this is Loony Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.97,0:29:55.87,*ENG,318,0,0,0,,Luna Lovegood.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:02.14,*ENG,319,0,0,0,,What an interesting necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.68,0:30:04.84,*ENG,320,0,0,0,,It's a charm, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.22,0:30:07.81,*ENG,321,0,0,0,,Keeps away the Nargles.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.59,0:30:13.08,*ENG,322,0,0,0,,Hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:15.72,*ENG,323,0,0,0,,I hope there's pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.73,0:30:20.32,*ENG,324,0,0,0,,- What's a Nargle? - No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.04,0:30:34.63,*ENG,325,0,0,0,,Good evening, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.94,0:30:38.67,*ENG,326,0,0,0,,Now, we have two changes in staffing this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.85,0:30:41.87,*ENG,327,0,0,0,,We're pleased to welcome back Professor Grubbly- Plank...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.05,0:30:44.61,*ENG,328,0,0,0,,...who'll be taking Care of Magical Creatures...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.79,0:30:48.24,*ENG,329,0,0,0,,...while Professor Hagrid is on temporary leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.09,0:30:53.08,*ENG,330,0,0,0,,We also wish to welcome our new Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.26,0:30:56.43,*ENG,331,0,0,0,,...Professor Dolores Umbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.73,0:31:00.46,*ENG,332,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you'll all join me in wishing the professor good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.27,0:31:06.26,*ENG,333,0,0,0,,Now, as usual, our caretaker, Mr. Filch, has asked me to remind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.35,0:31:20.08,*ENG,334,0,0,0,,She was at my hearing. She works for Fudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.26,0:31:25.96,*ENG,335,0,0,0,,Thank you, headmaster, for those kind words of welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.33,0:31:30.99,*ENG,336,0,0,0,,And how lovely to see all your bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.17,0:31:34.00,*ENG,337,0,0,0,,...happy faces smiling up at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.37,0:31:39.57,*ENG,338,0,0,0,,I'm sure we're all going to be very good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.74,0:31:41.97,*ENG,339,0,0,0,,- That's likely. - That's likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.81,0:31:47.78,*ENG,340,0,0,0,,The Ministry of Magic has always considered...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.95,0:31:53.55,*ENG,341,0,0,0,,...the education of young witches and wizards to be of vital importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.92,0:31:56.19,*ENG,342,0,0,0,,Although each headmaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:32:01.19,*ENG,343,0,0,0,,...has brought something new to this historic school...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.76,0:32:08.90,*ENG,344,0,0,0,,...progress for the sake of progress must be discouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.64,0:32:13.47,*ENG,345,0,0,0,,Let us preserve what must be preserved...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.64,0:32:17.13,*ENG,346,0,0,0,,...perfect what can be perfected...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.31,0:32:23.91,*ENG,347,0,0,0,,...and prune practices that ought to be prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.99,0:32:35.09,*ENG,348,0,0,0,,Thank you, Professor Umbridge. That really was most illuminating.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.26,0:32:39.63,*ENG,349,0,0,0,,- Illuminating? What a load of waffle. - What's it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.37,0:32:42.53,*ENG,350,0,0,0,,Magic is forbidden in the corridors...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:46.27,*ENG,351,0,0,0,,It means the Ministry's interfering at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.06,0:33:07.79,*ENG,352,0,0,0,,Dean, Seamus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.10,0:33:10.22,*ENG,353,0,0,0,,- Good holiday? - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.60,0:33:12.83,*ENG,354,0,0,0,,Better than Seamus', anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.14,0:33:16.47,*ENG,355,0,0,0,,Me mum didn't want me to come back this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.64,0:33:19.94,*ENG,356,0,0,0,,- Why not? - Let me see. Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.38,0:33:23.74,*ENG,357,0,0,0,,The Daily Prophet's been saying a lot of things about you and Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.91,0:33:25.24,*ENG,358,0,0,0,,What, your mum believes them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.41,0:33:27.31,*ENG,359,0,0,0,,Nobody was there the night Cedric died.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.48,0:33:30.58,*ENG,360,0,0,0,,I guess you should read the Prophet, then, like your stupid mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.75,0:33:34.24,*ENG,361,0,0,0,,- Don't talk about my mother. - I'll have a go at anyone that calls me a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.42,0:33:36.91,*ENG,362,0,0,0,,- What's going on? - He's mad, is what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.09,0:33:40.19,*ENG,363,0,0,0,,Do you believe the rubbish he's come out with about You- Know- Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:41.99,*ENG,364,0,0,0,,Yeah. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.03,0:33:44.97,*ENG,365,0,0,0,,Has anyone else got a problem with Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.41,0:33:56.81,*ENG,366,0,0,0,,- You all right? - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.98,0:33:59.78,*ENG,367,0,0,0,,Seamus was bang out of order, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.35,0:34:04.11,*ENG,368,0,0,0,,- But he'll come through, you'll see. - I said, I'm fine, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:12.19,*ENG,369,0,0,0,,Right. I'll just leave you to your thoughts, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.66,0:34:41.64,*ENG,370,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.11,0:34:59.27,*ENG,371,0,0,0,,Bring it over here. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:03.04,*ENG,372,0,0,0,,Oh, go on, Seamus. Go on, get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.69,0:35:20.09,*ENG,373,0,0,0,,Good morning, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.13,0:35:27.26,*ENG,374,0,0,0,,Ordinary Wizarding Level examinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.44,0:35:30.03,*ENG,375,0,0,0,,O- W- Ls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.21,0:35:34.77,*ENG,376,0,0,0,,More commonly known as OWLs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.94,0:35:38.07,*ENG,377,0,0,0,,Study hard and you will be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.41,0:35:43.68,*ENG,378,0,0,0,,Fail to do so, and the consequences may be severe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.26,0:35:54.32,*ENG,379,0,0,0,,Your previous instruction in this subject has been disturbingly uneven.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.50,0:35:56.62,*ENG,380,0,0,0,,But you'll be pleased to know, from now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:36:00.29,*ENG,381,0,0,0,,...you will be following a carefully structured, Ministry- approved...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.47,0:36:03.16,*ENG,382,0,0,0,,...course of defensive magic. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.51,0:36:07.10,*ENG,383,0,0,0,,There's nothing in here about using defensive spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.28,0:36:08.80,*ENG,384,0,0,0,,Using spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.98,0:36:12.44,*ENG,385,0,0,0,,Well, I can't imagine why you would need to use spells in my classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.15,0:36:15.74,*ENG,386,0,0,0,,We're not gonna use magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.92,0:36:20.91,*ENG,387,0,0,0,,You'll be learning about defensive spells in a secure, risk- free way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.09,0:36:23.85,*ENG,388,0,0,0,,What use is that? If we're attacked, it won't be risk- free.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.03,0:36:26.96,*ENG,389,0,0,0,,Students will raise their hands when they speak in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.60,0:36:33.00,*ENG,390,0,0,0,,It is the view of the Ministry...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.17,0:36:35.93,*ENG,391,0,0,0,,...that a theoretical knowledge will be sufficient...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.10,0:36:38.07,*ENG,392,0,0,0,,...to get you through your examinations...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.24,0:36:40.67,*ENG,393,0,0,0,,...which, after all, is what school is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.84,0:36:43.64,*ENG,394,0,0,0,,And how's theory supposed to prepare us for what's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.81,0:36:45.84,*ENG,395,0,0,0,,There is nothing out there, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.01,0:36:49.04,*ENG,396,0,0,0,,Who do you imagine wants to attack children like yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.22,0:36:52.48,*ENG,397,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know. Maybe Lord Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.16,0:37:07.66,*ENG,398,0,0,0,,Now, let me make this quite plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.20,0:37:09.67,*ENG,399,0,0,0,,You have been told...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.84,0:37:15.21,*ENG,400,0,0,0,,...that a certain dark wizard is at large once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.38,0:37:20.51,*ENG,401,0,0,0,,- This is a lie. - It's not a lie. I saw him. I fought him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.68,0:37:22.31,*ENG,402,0,0,0,,Detention, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.48,0:37:24.65,*ENG,403,0,0,0,,Cedric Diggory dropped dead of his own accord?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.82,0:37:27.25,*ENG,404,0,0,0,,Cedric Diggory's death was a tragic accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.42,0:37:29.58,*ENG,405,0,0,0,,It was murder. Voldemort killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.76,0:37:31.23,*ENG,406,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.89,0:37:33.59,*ENG,407,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.76,0:37:38.06,*ENG,408,0,0,0,,See me later, Mr. Potter. My office.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.82,0:38:04.02,*ENG,409,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.26,0:38:11.20,*ENG,410,0,0,0,,Good evening, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.83,0:38:13.10,*ENG,411,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.81,0:38:24.71,*ENG,412,0,0,0,,You're going to be doing some lines for me today, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.88,0:38:26.74,*ENG,413,0,0,0,,No, not with your quill.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.98,0:38:30.18,*ENG,414,0,0,0,,Going to be using a rather special one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.32,0:38:36.72,*ENG,415,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.69,0:38:43.56,*ENG,416,0,0,0,,...I want you to write, "I must not tell lies."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.63,0:38:47.53,*ENG,417,0,0,0,,How many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.97,0:38:52.63,*ENG,418,0,0,0,,Well, let's say for as long as it takes for the message to sink in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.64,0:38:56.30,*ENG,419,0,0,0,,You haven't given me any ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.48,0:38:57.97,*ENG,420,0,0,0,,Oh, you won't need any ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.23,0:39:50.72,*ENG,421,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.04,0:40:01.44,*ENG,422,0,0,0,,- Nothing. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.34,0:40:06.30,*ENG,423,0,0,0,,Because you know, deep down...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.48,0:40:08.54,*ENG,424,0,0,0,,...you deserve to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.72,0:40:11.88,*ENG,425,0,0,0,,Don't you, Mr. Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.12,0:40:17.72,*ENG,426,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.77,0:40:29.03,*ENG,427,0,0,0,,- Skiving Snackboxes. - Sweets that make you ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.20,0:40:30.83,*ENG,428,0,0,0,,Get out of class whenever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.01,0:40:34.77,*ENG,429,0,0,0,,Obtain hours of pleasure from unprofitable boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.78,0:40:37.11,*ENG,430,0,0,0,,Care for another?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.28,0:40:39.80,*ENG,431,0,0,0,,- I'm not asking you to write all of it for me. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.98,0:40:42.95,*ENG,432,0,0,0,,I've been busy studying for these stupid OWL exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.42,0:40:45.22,*ENG,433,0,0,0,,I'll do the introduction. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.39,0:40:49.15,*ENG,434,0,0,0,,Hermione, you're honestly the most wonderful person I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:53.56,*ENG,435,0,0,0,,- And if I'm ever rude to you again... - I'll know you've gone back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.60,0:41:00.69,*ENG,436,0,0,0,,What's wrong with your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.24,0:41:02.70,*ENG,437,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.97,0:41:05.87,*ENG,438,0,0,0,,The other hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.38,0:41:10.21,*ENG,439,0,0,0,,- You've got to tell Dumbledore. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.38,0:41:12.57,*ENG,440,0,0,0,,Dumbledore's got enough on his mind right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.75,0:41:14.87,*ENG,441,0,0,0,,I don't want to give Umbridge the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.05,0:41:17.48,*ENG,442,0,0,0,,Bloody hell, Harry. The woman's torturing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.65,0:41:21.59,*ENG,443,0,0,0,,- Lf the parents knew about this... - I haven't got any of those, have I, Ron?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.39,0:41:26.86,*ENG,444,0,0,0,,Harry, you've got to report this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.03,0:41:30.56,*ENG,445,0,0,0,,- It's perfectly simple. You're being... - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.73,0:41:33.57,*ENG,446,0,0,0,,Hermione, whatever this is, it's not simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.60,0:41:36.63,*ENG,447,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.24,0:41:41.17,*ENG,448,0,0,0,,Then help us to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.89,0:41:57.76,*ENG,449,0,0,0,,Dear Padfoot...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.29,0:42:00.02,*ENG,450,0,0,0,,...I hope you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:04.79,*ENG,451,0,0,0,,It's starting to get colder here. Winter is definitely on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.44,0:42:12.17,*ENG,452,0,0,0,,In spite of being back at Hogwarts, I feel more alone than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.04,0:42:16.34,*ENG,453,0,0,0,,I know you, of all people, will understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.33,0:42:52.52,*ENG,454,0,0,0,,Hello, Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.16,0:42:59.79,*ENG,455,0,0,0,,- Your feet. Aren't they cold? - Bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.70,0:43:04.73,*ENG,456,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, all my shoes have mysteriously disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.31,0:43:08.37,*ENG,457,0,0,0,,I suspect Nargles are behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.72,0:43:18.35,*ENG,458,0,0,0,,- What are they? - They're called Thestrals.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.02,0:43:24.08,*ENG,459,0,0,0,,They're quite gentle, really, but people avoid them because they're a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.03,0:43:28.66,*ENG,460,0,0,0,,Different.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.77,0:43:34.13,*ENG,461,0,0,0,,But why can't the others see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.30,0:43:37.83,*ENG,462,0,0,0,,They can only be seen by people who've seen death.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.94,0:43:42.57,*ENG,463,0,0,0,,So you've known someone who's died, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.74,0:43:44.37,*ENG,464,0,0,0,,My mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.91,0:43:49.82,*ENG,465,0,0,0,,She was quite an extraordinary witch, but she did like to experiment...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.98,0:43:53.28,*ENG,466,0,0,0,,...and one day, one of her spells went badly wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.45,0:43:55.85,*ENG,467,0,0,0,,- I was 9. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.42,0:43:58.62,*ENG,468,0,0,0,,Yes, it was rather horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.79,0:44:04.13,*ENG,469,0,0,0,,I do feel very sad about it sometimes, but I've got Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.37,0:44:09.00,*ENG,470,0,0,0,,We both believe you, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.07,0:44:15.07,*ENG,471,0,0,0,,That He- Who- Must- Not- Be- Named is back, and you fought him...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.24,0:44:18.34,*ENG,472,0,0,0,,...and the Ministry and the Prophet are conspiring against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.51,0:44:22.88,*ENG,473,0,0,0,,Thanks. It seems you're about the only ones that do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.05,0:44:24.38,*ENG,474,0,0,0,,I don't think that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.75,0:44:29.88,*ENG,475,0,0,0,,But I suppose that's how he wants you to feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.06,0:44:31.82,*ENG,476,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.46,0:44:34.33,*ENG,477,0,0,0,,Well, if I were You- Know- Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.80,0:44:38.36,*ENG,478,0,0,0,,...l'd want you to feel cut off from everyone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.53,0:44:41.26,*ENG,479,0,0,0,,...because if it's just you alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.10,0:44:44.44,*ENG,480,0,0,0,,...you're not as much of a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.09,0:45:06.82,*ENG,481,0,0,0,,- Do you ever stop eating? - What? I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.20,0:45:11.26,*ENG,482,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.10,0:45:14.33,*ENG,483,0,0,0,,Can I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.24,0:45:19.37,*ENG,484,0,0,0,,Pardon me, professor, but what exactly are you insinuating?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.54,0:45:22.30,*ENG,485,0,0,0,,I am merely requesting that when it comes to my students...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.48,0:45:26.74,*ENG,486,0,0,0,,...you conform to the prescribed disciplinary practices.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.91,0:45:28.58,*ENG,487,0,0,0,,So silly of me, but it sounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.75,0:45:32.88,*ENG,488,0,0,0,,...as if you're questioning my authority in my own classroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.05,0:45:34.39,*ENG,489,0,0,0,,...Minerva.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.56,0:45:39.02,*ENG,490,0,0,0,,Not at all, Dolores, merely your medieval methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.29,0:45:41.76,*ENG,491,0,0,0,,I am sorry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.93,0:45:45.26,*ENG,492,0,0,0,,But to question my practices is to question the Ministry...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:48.56,*ENG,493,0,0,0,,...and by extension, the minister himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.74,0:45:50.33,*ENG,494,0,0,0,,I am a tolerant woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.51,0:45:55.57,*ENG,495,0,0,0,,...but the one thing I will not stand for is disloyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.35,0:45:59.11,*ENG,496,0,0,0,,Disloyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.85,0:46:04.81,*ENG,497,0,0,0,,Things at Hogwarts are far worse than I feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.99,0:46:08.44,*ENG,498,0,0,0,,Cornelius will want to take immediate action.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.99,0:46:17.44,*ENG,499,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.87,0:46:21.77,*ENG,500,0,0,0,,What's happened to Dumbledore?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.94,0:46:24.50,*ENG,501,0,0,0,,Having already revolutionized...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.67,0:46:27.33,*ENG,502,0,0,0,,...the teaching of Defense Against the Dark Arts...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.01,0:46:32.47,*ENG,503,0,0,0,,...Dolores Umbridge will, as high inquisitor, have powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.98,0:46:39.15,*ENG,504,0,0,0,,...to address the seriously falling standards at Hogwarts School.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.93,0:46:49.09,*ENG,505,0,0,0,,Just one question, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.26,0:46:53.46,*ENG,506,0,0,0,,You've been in this post how long, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.27,0:47:05.37,*ENG,507,0,0,0,,You applied first for the Defense Against the Dark Arts post, is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.55,0:47:07.54,*ENG,508,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.95,0:47:10.58,*ENG,509,0,0,0,,But you were unsuccessful?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.79,0:47:14.22,*ENG,510,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.99,0:47:39.72,*ENG,511,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.55,0:47:49.99,*ENG,512,0,0,0,,Could you please predict something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.73,0:47:52.92,*ENG,513,0,0,0,,I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.17,0:48:00.36,*ENG,514,0,0,0,,Move those mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.51,0:48:09.60,*ENG,515,0,0,0,,One teensy little prophecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.48,0:48:16.92,*ENG,516,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.49,0:48:19.89,*ENG,517,0,0,0,,No, wait. Wait, no. I think I do see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.05,0:48:22.25,*ENG,518,0,0,0,,Yes, I do. Something dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.52,0:48:27.05,*ENG,519,0,0,0,,You are in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.53,0:48:30.26,*ENG,520,0,0,0,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.44,0:48:42.60,*ENG,521,0,0,0,,Cho. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.78,0:48:45.11,*ENG,522,0,0,0,,It's Professor Trelawney.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.94,0:49:18.43,*ENG,523,0,0,0,,Sixteen years I've lived and taught here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.61,0:49:21.55,*ENG,524,0,0,0,,Hogwarts is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.45,0:49:25.35,*ENG,525,0,0,0,,You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.79,0:49:29.05,*ENG,526,0,0,0,,Actually, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.93,0:49:39.30,*ENG,527,0,0,0,,Something you'd like to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.47,0:49:42.13,*ENG,528,0,0,0,,Oh, there are several things I would like to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.70,0:49:44.26,*ENG,529,0,0,0,,There...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.19,0:50:02.85,*ENG,530,0,0,0,,Professor McGonagall, might I ask you to escort Sybil back inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.16,0:50:06.63,*ENG,531,0,0,0,,Sybil, dear. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.79,0:50:08.28,*ENG,532,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.46,0:50:13.49,*ENG,533,0,0,0,,Dumbledore, may I remind you that under the terms...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.67,0:50:16.93,*ENG,534,0,0,0,,...of Educational Decree Number 23, as enacted by the minister...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.10,0:50:20.27,*ENG,535,0,0,0,,You have the right to dismiss my teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.44,0:50:24.00,*ENG,536,0,0,0,,You do not, however, have the authority to banish them from the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.18,0:50:27.20,*ENG,537,0,0,0,,That power remains with the headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.22,0:50:30.48,*ENG,538,0,0,0,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.92,0:50:38.92,*ENG,539,0,0,0,,Don't you all have studying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.09,0:50:40.25,*ENG,540,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:43.19,*ENG,541,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.66,0:50:46.46,*ENG,542,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore. Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.63,0:50:48.76,*ENG,543,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.45,0:51:01.54,*ENG,544,0,0,0,,That foul, evil, old gargoyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.08,0:51:07.11,*ENG,545,0,0,0,,We're not learning how to defend ourselves. We're not learning how to pass our OWLs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.49,0:51:09.51,*ENG,546,0,0,0,,She's taking over the entire school.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.69,0:51:14.35,*ENG,547,0,0,0,,Security has been and will remain the Ministry's top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.53,0:51:17.36,*ENG,548,0,0,0,,Furthermore, we have convincing evidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.53,0:51:20.40,*ENG,549,0,0,0,,...that these disappearances are the work...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.57,0:51:23.97,*ENG,550,0,0,0,,...of notorious mass murderer Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.71,0:51:26.26,*ENG,551,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.51,0:51:28.20,*ENG,552,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.94,0:51:31.64,*ENG,553,0,0,0,,- What are you doing here? - Answering your letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.81,0:51:34.71,*ENG,554,0,0,0,,You said you were worried about Umbridge. What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.88,0:51:36.82,*ENG,555,0,0,0,,Training you to kill half- breeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.98,0:51:39.95,*ENG,556,0,0,0,,- She's not letting us use magic at all. - Well, I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.32,0:51:44.38,*ENG,557,0,0,0,,The latest intelligence is that Fudge doesn't want you trained in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.56,0:51:45.55,*ENG,558,0,0,0,,Combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.06,0:51:48.96,*ENG,559,0,0,0,,What does he think, we're forming some sort of wizard army?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.13,0:51:50.53,*ENG,560,0,0,0,,That's exactly what he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.70,0:51:54.63,*ENG,561,0,0,0,,That Dumbledore is assembling his own forces to take on the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.17,0:51:58.47,*ENG,562,0,0,0,,He's becoming more paranoid by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.84,0:52:02.30,*ENG,563,0,0,0,,The others wouldn't want me telling you this, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.84,0:52:05.68,*ENG,564,0,0,0,,...but things aren't going at all well with the Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.85,0:52:08.47,*ENG,565,0,0,0,,Fudge is blocking the truth at every turn...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.65,0:52:12.64,*ENG,566,0,0,0,,...and these disappearances are just how it started before.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.45,0:52:16.79,*ENG,567,0,0,0,,Voldemort is on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.19,0:52:18.59,*ENG,568,0,0,0,,Well, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.19,0:52:20.63,*ENG,569,0,0,0,,Someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.80,0:52:22.99,*ENG,570,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I can't be of more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.16,0:52:28.16,*ENG,571,0,0,0,,But for now, at least, it looks like you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.71,0:52:42.05,*ENG,572,0,0,0,,He really is out there, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.88,0:52:46.55,*ENG,573,0,0,0,,We've got to be able to defend ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.12,0:52:50.89,*ENG,574,0,0,0,,And if Umbridge refuses to teach us how, we need someone who will.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:10.07,*ENG,575,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.65,0:53:22.02,*ENG,576,0,0,0,,This is mad. Who'd wanna be taught by me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.19,0:53:23.42,*ENG,577,0,0,0,,I'm a nutter, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.59,0:53:28.09,*ENG,578,0,0,0,,Look on the bright side: You can't be any worse than old toad face.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.33,0:53:31.79,*ENG,579,0,0,0,,- Thanks, Ron. - I'm here for you, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.30,0:53:34.63,*ENG,580,0,0,0,,Who's supposed to be meeting us, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.80,0:53:36.93,*ENG,581,0,0,0,,Just a couple of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.94,0:53:43.38,*ENG,582,0,0,0,,Lovely spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.08,0:53:49.21,*ENG,583,0,0,0,,Thought it would be safer off the beaten track.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.38,0:53:51.54,*ENG,584,0,0,0,,Matey, come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.99,0:54:01.15,*ENG,585,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.56,0:54:04.46,*ENG,586,0,0,0,,So you all know why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.63,0:54:05.86,*ENG,587,0,0,0,,We need a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.57,0:54:09.73,*ENG,588,0,0,0,,A proper teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.04,0:54:13.20,*ENG,589,0,0,0,,One who's had experience defending themselves against the Dark Arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.37,0:54:15.14,*ENG,590,0,0,0,,- Why? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.31,0:54:17.37,*ENG,591,0,0,0,,Because You- Know- Who's back, you tosspot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.55,0:54:19.10,*ENG,592,0,0,0,,- So he says. - So Dumbledore says.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.28,0:54:21.41,*ENG,593,0,0,0,,So Dumbledore says because he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.58,0:54:23.98,*ENG,594,0,0,0,,The point is, where's the proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.35,0:54:28.38,*ENG,595,0,0,0,,If Potter could tell us more about how Diggory got killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.49,0:54:35.26,*ENG,596,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna talk about Cedric, so if that's why you're here, clear out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.43,0:54:38.87,*ENG,597,0,0,0,,Come on, Hermione. They're here because they think I'm some sort of freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.03,0:54:41.66,*ENG,598,0,0,0,,Is it true you can produce a Patronus Charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.97,0:54:46.41,*ENG,599,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.88,0:54:49.31,*ENG,600,0,0,0,,I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.48,0:54:51.60,*ENG,601,0,0,0,,Blimey, Harry. I didn't know you could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.28,0:54:56.41,*ENG,602,0,0,0,,And he killed a basilisk, with the sword in Dumbledore's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.58,0:54:57.81,*ENG,603,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.99,0:55:00.75,*ENG,604,0,0,0,,Third year, he fought off about a hundred Dementors at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.06,0:55:04.85,*ENG,605,0,0,0,,Last year, he really did fight off You- Know- Who in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.03,0:55:06.32,*ENG,606,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.03,0:55:11.56,*ENG,607,0,0,0,,Look, it all sounds great when you say it like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.73,0:55:15.29,*ENG,608,0,0,0,,...but the truth is, most of that was just luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.57,0:55:19.30,*ENG,609,0,0,0,,I didn't know what I was doing half the time. I nearly always had help.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.47,0:55:22.97,*ENG,610,0,0,0,,- He's just being modest. - No, Hermione, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.55,0:55:30.21,*ENG,611,0,0,0,,Facing this stuff in real life is not like school.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.25,0:55:34.69,*ENG,612,0,0,0,,In school, if you make a mistake, you can just try again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.86,0:55:36.35,*ENG,613,0,0,0,,But out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.96,0:55:40.26,*ENG,614,0,0,0,,...when you're a second away from being murdered...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.43,0:55:44.12,*ENG,615,0,0,0,,...or watching a friend die right before your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.90,0:55:48.70,*ENG,616,0,0,0,,You don't know what that's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.48,0:56:00.38,*ENG,617,0,0,0,,You're right, Harry, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.15,0:56:03.24,*ENG,618,0,0,0,,That's why we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.42,0:56:06.32,*ENG,619,0,0,0,,Because if we're going to have any chance at beating...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.52,0:56:09.68,*ENG,620,0,0,0,,...Voldemort...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.13,0:56:14.86,*ENG,621,0,0,0,,He's really back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.18,0:56:38.97,*ENG,622,0,0,0,,Right. First we need to find a place to practice...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.02,0:56:40.42,*ENG,623,0,0,0,,...where Umbridge won't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.59,0:56:42.75,*ENG,624,0,0,0,,- The Shrieking Shack. - It's too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.92,0:56:45.89,*ENG,625,0,0,0,,- Forbidden Forest? - Not bloody likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.06,0:56:48.15,*ENG,626,0,0,0,,Harry, what happens if Umbridge does find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.33,0:56:49.49,*ENG,627,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:54.97,*ENG,628,0,0,0,,I mean, it's sort of exciting, isn't it, breaking the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.14,0:56:57.40,*ENG,629,0,0,0,,Who are you and what have you done with Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.11,0:57:01.77,*ENG,630,0,0,0,,Anyway, at least we know one positive thing that came from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.94,0:57:03.24,*ENG,631,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.98,0:57:07.64,*ENG,632,0,0,0,,Cho couldn't take her eyes off you, could she?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.38,0:57:13.44,*ENG,633,0,0,0,,Right. Over the next few days, we should each come up...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.62,0:57:16.45,*ENG,634,0,0,0,,...with a couple of possibilities of places we can practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.62,0:57:20.46,*ENG,635,0,0,0,,We've got to make sure, wherever it is, there's no chance she can find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.63,0:57:22.46,*ENG,636,0,0,0,,Will do, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.21,0:57:35.34,*ENG,637,0,0,0,,All student organizations are henceforth disbanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.51,0:57:39.10,*ENG,638,0,0,0,,Any student in noncompliance will be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.31,0:57:41.78,*ENG,639,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going, Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.48,0:58:21.75,*ENG,640,0,0,0,,You've done it, Neville. You found the Room of Requirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.92,0:58:23.05,*ENG,641,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.22,0:58:25.62,*ENG,642,0,0,0,,It's also known as the Come and Go Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.79,0:58:29.23,*ENG,643,0,0,0,,The Room of Requirement only appears when a person has real need of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.40,0:58:32.06,*ENG,644,0,0,0,,And it's always equipped for the seeker's needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.23,0:58:35.96,*ENG,645,0,0,0,,So say you really needed the toilet...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.14,0:58:41.97,*ENG,646,0,0,0,,Charming, Ronald. But, yes, that is the general idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.14,0:58:47.01,*ENG,647,0,0,0,,It's brilliant. It's like Hogwarts wants us to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.06,0:58:59.55,*ENG,648,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.70,0:59:06.10,*ENG,649,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.27,0:59:10.03,*ENG,650,0,0,0,,You're just flourishing your wand too much. Try it like this. Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.41,0:59:17.43,*ENG,651,0,0,0,,You will please copy the approved text four times...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.61,0:59:20.60,*ENG,652,0,0,0,,...to ensure maximum retention.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.98,0:59:24.68,*ENG,653,0,0,0,,- There will be no need to talk. - No need to think's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.85,0:59:26.88,*ENG,654,0,0,0,,- Expelliarmus. - Wands away.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.83,0:59:42.89,*ENG,655,0,0,0,,Stunning is one of the most useful spells in your arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.07,0:59:45.30,*ENG,656,0,0,0,,It's a wizard's bread and butter, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.47,0:59:49.03,*ENG,657,0,0,0,,So come on, then, Nigel. Give it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.55,0:59:56.95,*ENG,658,0,0,0,,Stupefy!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.86,1:00:06.29,*ENG,659,0,0,0,,Good. Not bad at all, Nigel. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.67,1:00:13.76,*ENG,660,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll go easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.13,1:00:16.13,*ENG,661,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ronald.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.81,1:00:21.00,*ENG,662,0,0,0,,- Come on, Ron. - Come on, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.18,1:00:24.04,*ENG,663,0,0,0,,- You can do it. - Come on, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.58,1:00:26.60,*ENG,664,0,0,0,,- One Sickle. - You're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.65,1:00:35.02,*ENG,665,0,0,0,,Stupefy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.69,1:00:42.66,*ENG,666,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.06,1:00:47.66,*ENG,667,0,0,0,,I let her do that. It's good manners, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.90,1:00:52.43,*ENG,668,0,0,0,,It was completely intentional.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.70,1:01:16.83,*ENG,669,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.07,1:01:21.00,*ENG,670,0,0,0,,Up you come. Would you like a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.30,1:01:27.26,*ENG,671,0,0,0,,Now, focus on a fixed point and try again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.84,1:01:29.81,*ENG,672,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.38,1:01:33.94,*ENG,673,0,0,0,,Very good. Keep your concentration.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.05,1:01:37.54,*ENG,674,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.82,1:01:40.41,*ENG,675,0,0,0,,A little higher.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.90,1:01:51.73,*ENG,676,0,0,0,,I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.75,1:02:12.38,*ENG,677,0,0,0,,- Stupefy. - Stupefy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.95,1:02:17.32,*ENG,678,0,0,0,,Those wishing to join the Inquisitorial Squad for extra credit...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.49,1:02:20.36,*ENG,679,0,0,0,,...may sign up in the high inquisitor's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.53,1:02:22.15,*ENG,680,0,0,0,,Diminuendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.07,1:02:32.37,*ENG,681,0,0,0,,Working hard is important, but there's something that matters even more:
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.54,1:02:34.73,*ENG,682,0,0,0,,Believing in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.91,1:02:37.04,*ENG,683,0,0,0,,- Expelliarmus. - Levicorpus. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.21,1:02:38.77,*ENG,684,0,0,0,,Think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.95,1:02:42.94,*ENG,685,0,0,0,,Every great wizard in history has started out...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.28,1:02:47.19,*ENG,686,0,0,0,,...as nothing more than what we are now: Students.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.35,1:02:50.29,*ENG,687,0,0,0,,If they can do it, why not us?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.43,1:03:02.23,*ENG,688,0,0,0,,- Stupefy. - Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.40,1:03:05.77,*ENG,689,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.48,1:03:09.97,*ENG,690,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.52,1:03:16.81,*ENG,691,0,0,0,,Reducto.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.33,1:03:33.32,*ENG,692,0,0,0,,- Expelliarmus. - Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.50,1:03:35.87,*ENG,693,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.77,1:03:41.83,*ENG,694,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.68,1:03:49.08,*ENG,695,0,0,0,,Fantastic, Neville. Well done, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.72,1:03:52.84,*ENG,696,0,0,0,,So that's it for this lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.02,1:03:56.42,*ENG,697,0,0,0,,Now, we're not gonna be meeting again until after the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.82,1:03:59.85,*ENG,698,0,0,0,,So just keep practicing on your own as best you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.03,1:04:03.39,*ENG,699,0,0,0,,And well done, everyone. Great, great work.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.20,1:04:09.63,*ENG,700,0,0,0,,Well done, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.80,1:04:11.24,*ENG,701,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.91,1:04:19.28,*ENG,702,0,0,0,,See you after Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.72,1:04:30.78,*ENG,703,0,0,0,,See you in the Common Room, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.19,1:04:34.89,*ENG,704,0,0,0,,- Thanks a lot, Harry. - No worries.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.66,1:04:39.03,*ENG,705,0,0,0,,- Thank you so much. - Not at all. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.50,1:04:41.87,*ENG,706,0,0,0,,- Thank you, Harry. - Thank you. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.04,1:04:43.90,*ENG,707,0,0,0,,- Merry Christmas. - Have a good Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.07,1:04:46.66,*ENG,708,0,0,0,,- Have a great Christmas, Luna. - We've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.84,1:04:49.24,*ENG,709,0,0,0,,We could always slip Umbridge some Puking Pastilles.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.41,1:04:52.07,*ENG,710,0,0,0,,Or Fever Fudge. They give you massive, pus- filled boils...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.25,1:04:54.77,*ENG,711,0,0,0,,Sounds great, guys. Would you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.73,1:05:10.46,*ENG,712,0,0,0,,Are you all right? I heard Umbridge gave you a rough time the other day.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.63,1:05:13.00,*ENG,713,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.70,1:05:16.50,*ENG,714,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.84,1:05:25.01,*ENG,715,0,0,0,,It's just, learning all this...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.81,1:05:29.25,*ENG,716,0,0,0,,...makes me wonder whether, if he'd known it...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:32.15,*ENG,717,0,0,0,,Cedric did know this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.72,1:05:35.12,*ENG,718,0,0,0,,He was really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.76,1:05:38.49,*ENG,719,0,0,0,,It's just, Voldemort was better.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.03,1:05:44.83,*ENG,720,0,0,0,,You're a really good teacher, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.10,1:05:49.00,*ENG,721,0,0,0,,I've never been able to stun anything before.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.14,1:05:59.81,*ENG,722,0,0,0,,Mistletoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.32,1:06:05.25,*ENG,723,0,0,0,,Probably full of Nargles, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.32,1:06:08.01,*ENG,724,0,0,0,,What are Nargles?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.72,1:06:10.45,*ENG,725,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.48,1:06:34.67,*ENG,726,0,0,0,,Well, how was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.45,1:06:37.21,*ENG,727,0,0,0,,Wet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.62,1:06:39.38,*ENG,728,0,0,0,,I mean, she was sort of crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.75,1:06:41.72,*ENG,729,0,0,0,,That bad at it, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.89,1:06:44.62,*ENG,730,0,0,0,,I'm sure Harry's kissing was more than satisfactory.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.46,1:06:49.62,*ENG,731,0,0,0,,Cho spends half her time crying these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.80,1:06:52.06,*ENG,732,0,0,0,,You'd think a bit of snogging would cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.53,1:06:56.40,*ENG,733,0,0,0,,Don't you understand how she must be feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.81,1:07:04.27,*ENG,734,0,0,0,,Well, obviously she's feeling sad about Cedric...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.44,1:07:07.50,*ENG,735,0,0,0,,...and confused about liking Harry and guilty about kissing him...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.68,1:07:10.91,*ENG,736,0,0,0,,...conflicted because Umbridge might sack her mum from the Ministry...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.08,1:07:14.82,*ENG,737,0,0,0,,...and frightened of failing her OWLs because she's worrying about everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.76,1:07:20.32,*ENG,738,0,0,0,,One person couldn't feel all that. They'd explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.49,1:07:23.72,*ENG,739,0,0,0,,Just because you've got the emotional range of a teaspoon...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.58,1:07:41.20,*ENG,740,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.99,1:07:53.05,*ENG,741,0,0,0,,Voldemort may be after something.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.73,1:07:56.72,*ENG,742,0,0,0,,Something he didn't have last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.56,1:07:58.82,*ENG,743,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.47,1:08:01.73,*ENG,744,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.83,1:08:36.23,*ENG,745,0,0,0,,In the dream, were you standing next to the victim...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.40,1:08:37.89,*ENG,746,0,0,0,,...or looking down at the scene?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.37,1:08:41.34,*ENG,747,0,0,0,,Neither. It was like I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.91,1:08:44.00,*ENG,748,0,0,0,,Will you please just tell me what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.18,1:08:46.51,*ENG,749,0,0,0,,Everard, Arthur's on guard duty tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.68,1:08:49.08,*ENG,750,0,0,0,,Make sure he's found by the right people.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.25,1:08:50.81,*ENG,751,0,0,0,,- Sir. - Phineas.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.98,1:08:53.28,*ENG,752,0,0,0,,You must go to your portrait at Grimmauld Place.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.45,1:08:56.08,*ENG,753,0,0,0,,Tell them that Arthur Weasley is gravely injured...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.25,1:09:00.42,*ENG,754,0,0,0,,...and his children will be arriving there soon by Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.59,1:09:03.65,*ENG,755,0,0,0,,They've got him, Albus. It was close, but they think he'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.83,1:09:06.35,*ENG,756,0,0,0,,What's more, the Dark Lord failed to acquire it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.53,1:09:08.43,*ENG,757,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness. Next we need to...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.60,1:09:09.79,*ENG,758,0,0,0,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.31,1:09:18.54,*ENG,759,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.42,1:09:28.28,*ENG,760,0,0,0,,You wished to see me, headmaster?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.45,1:09:33.36,*ENG,761,0,0,0,,Oh, Severus. I'm afraid we can't wait. Not even till the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.76,1:09:36.66,*ENG,762,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'll all be vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.43,1:09:43.03,*ENG,763,0,0,0,,It appears there's a connection...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.20,1:09:45.53,*ENG,764,0,0,0,,...between the Dark Lord's mind and your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.70,1:09:49.87,*ENG,765,0,0,0,,Whether he is, as yet, aware of this connection is, for the moment, unclear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.24,1:09:53.27,*ENG,766,0,0,0,,Pray he remains ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.45,1:09:56.71,*ENG,767,0,0,0,,You mean, if he knows about it, then...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.18,1:10:01.59,*ENG,768,0,0,0,,- ...he'll be able to read my mind? - Read it, control it...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.75,1:10:03.62,*ENG,769,0,0,0,,...unhinge it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.79,1:10:07.16,*ENG,770,0,0,0,,In the past, it was often the Dark Lord's pleasure...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.33,1:10:09.56,*ENG,771,0,0,0,,...to invade the minds of his victims...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.73,1:10:13.32,*ENG,772,0,0,0,,...creating visions designed to torture them into madness.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.47,1:10:19.27,*ENG,773,0,0,0,,Only after extracting the last exquisite ounce of agony...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.44,1:10:23.70,*ENG,774,0,0,0,,...only when he had them literally begging for death, would he finally...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.88,1:10:25.10,*ENG,775,0,0,0,,...kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.08,1:10:28.51,*ENG,776,0,0,0,,Used properly, the power of Occlumency...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.68,1:10:32.17,*ENG,777,0,0,0,,...will help shield you from access or influence.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.35,1:10:37.12,*ENG,778,0,0,0,,In these lessons, I will attempt to penetrate your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.69,1:10:40.78,*ENG,779,0,0,0,,You will attempt to resist.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.06,1:10:42.53,*ENG,780,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.26,1:10:46.49,*ENG,781,0,0,0,,Legilimens.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.61,1:10:58.20,*ENG,782,0,0,0,,Concentrate, Potter. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.10,1:11:25.73,*ENG,783,0,0,0,,Ho, ho, ho. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.94,1:11:29.60,*ENG,784,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.77,1:11:31.94,*ENG,785,0,0,0,,Daddy's back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.11,1:11:38.74,*ENG,786,0,0,0,,Sit down, everybody, sit down. That's it. Now, presents.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.92,1:11:43.29,*ENG,787,0,0,0,,- And a nice big box for Ron. - Big box for you. And...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.09,1:11:48.29,*ENG,788,0,0,0,,Fred and George. Come on, open up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.46,1:11:50.76,*ENG,789,0,0,0,,- I want to see your faces. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.93,1:11:53.33,*ENG,790,0,0,0,,- Try it on. - Thanks, Mum. It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.50,1:11:57.80,*ENG,791,0,0,0,,- Just what he wanted, actually. - Yeah. Right. Thanks, Mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.97,1:12:00.84,*ENG,792,0,0,0,,Come on, then, everybody. Let's clear this away.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.01,1:12:03.03,*ENG,793,0,0,0,,Oh, Harry, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.21,1:12:05.11,*ENG,794,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.11,1:12:07.94,*ENG,795,0,0,0,,- Happy Christmas. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.51,1:12:10.38,*ENG,796,0,0,0,,- Lovely to have you with us. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.55,1:12:12.52,*ENG,797,0,0,0,,Now, Daddy. Pass that to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.68,1:12:14.41,*ENG,798,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Has everybody got?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.59,1:12:15.95,*ENG,799,0,0,0,,Fred? George?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.12,1:12:18.65,*ENG,800,0,0,0,,- Hermione. - A Christmas toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.82,1:12:20.69,*ENG,801,0,0,0,,To Mr. Harry Potter...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.73,1:12:24.56,*ENG,802,0,0,0,,...without whom I would not be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.13,1:12:30.46,*ENG,803,0,0,0,,- Harry. - Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.64,1:12:31.86,*ENG,804,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.87,1:12:35.46,*ENG,805,0,0,0,,That is delicious. I shall be needing some more of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.64,1:12:38.01,*ENG,806,0,0,0,,Daddy, don't forget last Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.94,1:12:41.67,*ENG,807,0,0,0,,I can't understand why you don't want to wear it, Ronald.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.15,1:12:44.98,*ENG,808,0,0,0,,I look like a bloody idiot, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.15,1:12:46.98,*ENG,809,0,0,0,,No more than usual, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.19,1:12:49.02,*ENG,810,0,0,0,,I don't know why...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.03,1:12:59.62,*ENG,811,0,0,0,,Nasty brat, standing there as bold as brass.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.80,1:13:04.53,*ENG,812,0,0,0,,Harry Potter, the boy who stopped the Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.70,1:13:07.69,*ENG,813,0,0,0,,Friend of Mudbloods and blood- traitors alike.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.14,1:13:10.73,*ENG,814,0,0,0,,- Lf my poor mistress only knew... - Kreacher!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.91,1:13:13.74,*ENG,815,0,0,0,,That's enough of your bile. Away with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.91,1:13:15.90,*ENG,816,0,0,0,,Of course, master.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.08,1:13:20.78,*ENG,817,0,0,0,,Kreacher lives to serve the noble house of Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.09,1:13:24.99,*ENG,818,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.56,1:13:29.22,*ENG,819,0,0,0,,He never was very pleasant, even when I was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.56,1:13:31.65,*ENG,820,0,0,0,,Not to me, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.50,1:13:34.43,*ENG,821,0,0,0,,What, you grew up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.60,1:13:36.86,*ENG,822,0,0,0,,This is my parents' house.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.20,1:13:41.04,*ENG,823,0,0,0,,I offered it to Dumbledore as headquarters for the Order.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.17,1:13:45.44,*ENG,824,0,0,0,,About the only useful thing I've been able to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.84,1:13:49.21,*ENG,825,0,0,0,,This is the Black family tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.11,1:13:52.24,*ENG,826,0,0,0,,My deranged cousin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.42,1:13:55.15,*ENG,827,0,0,0,,I hated the lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.32,1:14:00.02,*ENG,828,0,0,0,,My parents with their pure- blood mania.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.23,1:14:07.03,*ENG,829,0,0,0,,My mother did that after I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.37,1:14:11.23,*ENG,830,0,0,0,,Charming woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.50,1:14:14.13,*ENG,831,0,0,0,,I was 16.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.97,1:14:16.41,*ENG,832,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.48,1:14:19.74,*ENG,833,0,0,0,,Round your dad's.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.25,1:14:23.77,*ENG,834,0,0,0,,I was always welcome at the Potters'.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.68,1:14:27.41,*ENG,835,0,0,0,,I see him so much in you, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.05,1:14:30.25,*ENG,836,0,0,0,,You are so very much alike.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.19,1:14:33.16,*ENG,837,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.23,1:14:35.66,*ENG,838,0,0,0,,Sirius, when I was...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.50,1:14:43.02,*ENG,839,0,0,0,,When I saw Mr. Weasley attacked, I wasn't just watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.17,1:14:45.69,*ENG,840,0,0,0,,I was the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.54,1:14:49.47,*ENG,841,0,0,0,,And afterwards, in Dumbledore's office...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.64,1:14:53.84,*ENG,842,0,0,0,,...there was a moment when I wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.98,1:15:01.85,*ENG,843,0,0,0,,This connection between me and Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.52,1:15:06.12,*ENG,844,0,0,0,,What if the reason for it is that I am becoming more like him?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.46,1:15:12.36,*ENG,845,0,0,0,,I just feel so angry all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.53,1:15:17.09,*ENG,846,0,0,0,,And what if, after everything that I've been through...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.27,1:15:20.83,*ENG,847,0,0,0,,...something's gone wrong inside me? What if I'm becoming bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.47,1:15:26.71,*ENG,848,0,0,0,,I want you to listen to me very carefully, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.91,1:15:30.88,*ENG,849,0,0,0,,You're not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.72,1:15:36.09,*ENG,850,0,0,0,,You're a very good person who bad things have happened to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.69,1:15:37.81,*ENG,851,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.92,1:15:44.95,*ENG,852,0,0,0,,Besides, the world isn't split into good people and Death Eaters.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.13,1:15:49.59,*ENG,853,0,0,0,,We've all got both light and dark inside of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.33,1:15:53.60,*ENG,854,0,0,0,,What matters is the part we choose to act on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.54,1:15:57.84,*ENG,855,0,0,0,,That's who we really are.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.58,1:16:03.34,*ENG,856,0,0,0,,Harry, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.12,1:16:09.38,*ENG,857,0,0,0,,When all this is over, we'll be a proper family.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.55,1:16:11.15,*ENG,858,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.29,1:16:13.66,*ENG,859,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.10,1:16:52.26,*ENG,860,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.43,1:16:55.06,*ENG,861,0,0,0,,Harry. Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.23,1:16:57.17,*ENG,862,0,0,0,,Hagrid's back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.10,1:17:01.94,*ENG,863,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.15,1:17:19.32,*ENG,864,0,0,0,,I will say this one last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.62,1:17:21.99,*ENG,865,0,0,0,,I'm ordering you to tell me where you've been.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.16,1:17:25.19,*ENG,866,0,0,0,,I told you. I've been away for me health.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.53,1:17:29.69,*ENG,867,0,0,0,,- Your health? - Yeah. Bit of fresh air, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.87,1:17:34.70,*ENG,868,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. As gamekeeper, fresh air must be difficult to come by.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.74,1:17:39.23,*ENG,869,0,0,0,,If I were you, I shouldn't get too used to being back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.41,1:17:42.68,*ENG,870,0,0,0,,In fact, I mightn't bother unpacking at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.63,1:18:04.73,*ENG,871,0,0,0,,This is top- secret, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.64,1:18:08.00,*ENG,872,0,0,0,,Dumbledore sent me to parley with the giants.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.17,1:18:09.66,*ENG,873,0,0,0,,Giants?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.91,1:18:11.90,*ENG,874,0,0,0,,You found them?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.08,1:18:15.98,*ENG,875,0,0,0,,Well, they're not that hard to find, to be perfectly honest. They're so big, see?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.85,1:18:19.87,*ENG,876,0,0,0,,I tried to convince them to join the cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.05,1:18:22.75,*ENG,877,0,0,0,,But I wasn't the only one that was trying to win them over.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.45,1:18:25.35,*ENG,878,0,0,0,,- Death Eaters? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.82,1:18:29.16,*ENG,879,0,0,0,,Trying to persuade them to join You- Know- Who.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.66,1:18:32.03,*ENG,880,0,0,0,,- Did they? - I gave them Dumbledore's message.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.20,1:18:36.29,*ENG,881,0,0,0,,Suppose some of them remember he was friendly to them. I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.90,1:18:41.20,*ENG,882,0,0,0,,And they did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.91,1:18:43.67,*ENG,883,0,0,0,,Not exactly, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.18,1:18:48.08,*ENG,884,0,0,0,,Oh, go on, you have it, then, you dozy dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.06,1:19:04.19,*ENG,885,0,0,0,,It's changing out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.63,1:19:06.19,*ENG,886,0,0,0,,Just like last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.67,1:19:09.29,*ENG,887,0,0,0,,There's a storm coming, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.03,1:19:13.09,*ENG,888,0,0,0,,We'd all best be ready when she does.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.11,1:19:53.13,*ENG,889,0,0,0,,We have confirmed that 10 high- security prisoners...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.31,1:19:56.14,*ENG,890,0,0,0,,...in the early hours of yesterday evening did escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.31,1:19:59.98,*ENG,891,0,0,0,,And of course, the Muggle prime minister has been alerted to the danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.15,1:20:02.24,*ENG,892,0,0,0,,We strongly suspect...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.09,1:20:05.08,*ENG,893,0,0,0,,...that the breakout was engineered...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.26,1:20:09.45,*ENG,894,0,0,0,,...by a man with personal experience in escaping from Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.63,1:20:13.86,*ENG,895,0,0,0,,...notorious mass murderer Sirius Black...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.30,1:20:19.67,*ENG,896,0,0,0,,...cousin of escapee Bellatrix Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.98,1:20:32.28,*ENG,897,0,0,0,,Dumbledore warned Fudge this could happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.45,1:20:35.61,*ENG,898,0,0,0,,He's gonna get us all killed just because he can't face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.79,1:20:36.91,*ENG,899,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.62,1:20:42.62,*ENG,900,0,0,0,,I wanted to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.23,1:20:47.39,*ENG,901,0,0,0,,Now even me mum says the Prophet's version of things don't add up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.57,1:20:53.47,*ENG,902,0,0,0,,So, what I'm really trying to say is that I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.41,1:21:02.00,*ENG,903,0,0,0,,Neville?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.59,1:21:16.72,*ENG,904,0,0,0,,Fourteen years ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.89,1:21:21.16,*ENG,905,0,0,0,,...a Death Eater named Bellatrix Lestrange...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.33,1:21:24.53,*ENG,906,0,0,0,,...used a Cruciatus Curse on my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.10,1:21:29.06,*ENG,907,0,0,0,,She tortured them for information...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.24,1:21:31.40,*ENG,908,0,0,0,,...but they never gave in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.08,1:21:35.57,*ENG,909,0,0,0,,I'm quite proud to be their son.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.55,1:21:40.42,*ENG,910,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure I'm ready for everyone to know just yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.36,1:21:50.49,*ENG,911,0,0,0,,We're gonna make them proud, Neville. That's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.73,1:21:58.43,*ENG,912,0,0,0,,Make it a powerful memory, the happiest you can remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.60,1:22:02.04,*ENG,913,0,0,0,,Allow it to fill you up. Keep trying, Seamus.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.21,1:22:03.61,*ENG,914,0,0,0,,George, your turn now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.98,1:22:07.27,*ENG,915,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.21,1:22:11.65,*ENG,916,0,0,0,,A full- bodied Patronus is the most difficult to produce...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.82,1:22:15.65,*ENG,917,0,0,0,,...but shield forms can also be equally useful against a variety of opponents.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.82,1:22:17.05,*ENG,918,0,0,0,,Wow, that was really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.76,1:22:19.31,*ENG,919,0,0,0,,Fantastic, Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.49,1:22:23.52,*ENG,920,0,0,0,,Just remember, your Patronus can only protect you for as long as you stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.69,1:22:25.99,*ENG,921,0,0,0,,So focus, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.70,1:22:31.40,*ENG,922,0,0,0,,Think of the happiest thing you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.57,1:22:33.54,*ENG,923,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.70,1:22:36.57,*ENG,924,0,0,0,,- I'm trying. - I know. It's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.74,1:22:41.01,*ENG,925,0,0,0,,This is really advanced stuff, guys. You're doing so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.75,1:22:44.15,*ENG,926,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.99,1:23:28.52,*ENG,927,0,0,0,,I'll make short work of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.86,1:23:31.85,*ENG,928,0,0,0,,Bombarda Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.15,1:23:51.51,*ENG,929,0,0,0,,Get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.95,1:23:53.42,*ENG,930,0,0,0,,Been watching them for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.58,1:23:55.52,*ENG,931,0,0,0,,And see, "Dumbledore's Army"...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.95,1:23:59.65,*ENG,932,0,0,0,,...proof of what I've been telling you right from the beginning, Cornelius.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.03,1:24:03.08,*ENG,933,0,0,0,,All your fear- mongering about You- Know- Who...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.26,1:24:04.78,*ENG,934,0,0,0,,...never fooled us for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.96,1:24:07.02,*ENG,935,0,0,0,,We saw your lies for what they were:
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.20,1:24:11.03,*ENG,936,0,0,0,,A smokescreen for your bid to seize control of the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.20,1:24:12.19,*ENG,937,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.37,1:24:14.89,*ENG,938,0,0,0,,No, professor. He had nothing to do with it. It was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.07,1:24:18.74,*ENG,939,0,0,0,,Most noble of you, Harry, to shield me, but as has been pointed out...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.91,1:24:23.74,*ENG,940,0,0,0,,...the parchment clearly says "Dumbledore's Army," not "Potter's."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.91,1:24:26.54,*ENG,941,0,0,0,,I instructed Harry to form this organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.72,1:24:30.18,*ENG,942,0,0,0,,And I, and I alone, am responsible for its activities.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.35,1:24:32.19,*ENG,943,0,0,0,,Dispatch an owl to the Daily Prophet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.36,1:24:34.88,*ENG,944,0,0,0,,If we hurry, we should still make the morning edition.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.06,1:24:39.86,*ENG,945,0,0,0,,Dawlish, Shacklebolt, you will escort Dumbledore...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.03,1:24:41.46,*ENG,946,0,0,0,,...to Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.70,1:24:47.87,*ENG,947,0,0,0,,...to await trial for conspiracy and sedition.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.04,1:24:50.97,*ENG,948,0,0,0,,I thought we might hit this little snag.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.14,1:24:55.58,*ENG,949,0,0,0,,You seem to be laboring under the delusion that I'm going to...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.15,1:24:57.58,*ENG,950,0,0,0,,What was the phrase?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.75,1:24:59.34,*ENG,951,0,0,0,,Come quietly.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.52,1:25:01.21,*ENG,952,0,0,0,,Well, I can tell you this:
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.65,1:25:03.95,*ENG,953,0,0,0,,I have no intention of going to Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.12,1:25:05.38,*ENG,954,0,0,0,,Enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.89,1:25:06.98,*ENG,955,0,0,0,,Take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.84,1:25:24.21,*ENG,956,0,0,0,,Well, you may not like him, minister...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.38,1:25:26.50,*ENG,957,0,0,0,,...but you can't deny...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.04,1:25:29.77,*ENG,958,0,0,0,,...Dumbledore has got style.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.34,1:25:52.77,*ENG,959,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.87,1:25:58.50,*ENG,960,0,0,0,,Boys and girls are not permitted to be within eight inches of each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.68,1:26:02.11,*ENG,961,0,0,0,,Those wishing to join the Inquisitorial Squad for extra credit...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.28,1:26:07.31,*ENG,962,0,0,0,,Students will be submitted to questioning about suspected illicit activities.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.48,1:26:11.78,*ENG,963,0,0,0,,Any student in noncompliance will be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.20,1:27:24.79,*ENG,964,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.74,1:27:35.14,*ENG,965,0,0,0,,You did everything you could. No one could win against that old hag.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.31,1:27:37.68,*ENG,966,0,0,0,,Even Dumbledore didn't see this coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.58,1:27:40.74,*ENG,967,0,0,0,,Harry, if it's anyone's fault, it's ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.92,1:27:43.01,*ENG,968,0,0,0,,Yeah, we talked you into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.19,1:27:45.16,*ENG,969,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.72,1:27:49.85,*ENG,970,0,0,0,,I tried so hard to help, and all it's done is make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.90,1:27:54.33,*ENG,971,0,0,0,,Anyway, that doesn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.40,1:27:59.60,*ENG,972,0,0,0,,Because I don't want to play anymore. All it does is make you care too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.77,1:28:02.43,*ENG,973,0,0,0,,And the more you care, the more you have to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.61,1:28:05.77,*ENG,974,0,0,0,,- So maybe it's just better to... - To what?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.01,1:28:09.95,*ENG,975,0,0,0,,To go it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.29,1:28:17.95,*ENG,976,0,0,0,,Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.69,1:28:24.13,*ENG,977,0,0,0,,Any idea where he's taking us?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.29,1:28:27.35,*ENG,978,0,0,0,,Hagrid, why can't you just tell us?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.67,1:28:38.33,*ENG,979,0,0,0,,I've never seen the centaurs so riled.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.51,1:28:41.07,*ENG,980,0,0,0,,And they're dangerous at the best of times.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.01,1:28:44.34,*ENG,981,0,0,0,,The Ministry restricts their territory much more...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.52,1:28:46.71,*ENG,982,0,0,0,,...they'll have a full uprising on their hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.88,1:28:48.55,*ENG,983,0,0,0,,Hagrid, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.72,1:28:50.95,*ENG,984,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to be so mysterious, you three.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.12,1:28:56.08,*ENG,985,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be bothering you at all with it, but with Dumbledore gone...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.73,1:28:59.89,*ENG,986,0,0,0,,...l'll likely be getting the sack any day now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.06,1:29:03.56,*ENG,987,0,0,0,,And I just couldn't leave without telling someone about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.77,1:29:09.40,*ENG,988,0,0,0,,Grawpy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.81,1:29:13.90,*ENG,989,0,0,0,,Down here, you great buffoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.25,1:29:21.95,*ENG,990,0,0,0,,Grawpy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.72,1:29:24.41,*ENG,991,0,0,0,,Brought you some company.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.77,1:29:39.03,*ENG,992,0,0,0,,I couldn't just leave him, because...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.20,1:29:40.93,*ENG,993,0,0,0,,Because he's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.10,1:29:42.23,*ENG,994,0,0,0,,Blimey.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.41,1:29:44.43,*ENG,995,0,0,0,,Well, half brother, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.61,1:29:49.88,*ENG,996,0,0,0,,He's completely harmless, just like I said. Little high- spirited, is all.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.02,1:29:54.35,*ENG,997,0,0,0,,- Grawpy, that is not polite. - Hagrid, do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.52,1:29:56.92,*ENG,998,0,0,0,,We talked about this. You do not grab, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.09,1:29:59.35,*ENG,999,0,0,0,,That's your new friend, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.52,1:30:00.82,*ENG,1000,0,0,0,,Grawpy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.13,1:30:06.32,*ENG,1001,0,0,0,,Grawp.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.37,1:30:11.43,*ENG,1002,0,0,0,,Put me down.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.11,1:30:16.66,*ENG,1003,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.82,1:30:29.91,*ENG,1004,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.22,1:30:32.88,*ENG,1005,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.29,1:30:35.59,*ENG,1006,0,0,0,,Just needs a firm hand, is all.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.76,1:30:38.16,*ENG,1007,0,0,0,,I think you've got an admirer.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.66,1:30:42.83,*ENG,1008,0,0,0,,You just stay away from her, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.96,1:31:15.69,*ENG,1009,0,0,0,,He gets his own food and all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.97,1:31:20.03,*ENG,1010,0,0,0,,It's company he'll be needing when I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.37,1:31:23.60,*ENG,1011,0,0,0,,You will look after him, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.11,1:31:26.80,*ENG,1012,0,0,0,,I'm the only family he's got.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.39,1:31:42.26,*ENG,1013,0,0,0,,Feeling sentimental?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.53,1:31:49.36,*ENG,1014,0,0,0,,- That's private. - Not to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.67,1:31:53.16,*ENG,1015,0,0,0,,And not to the Dark Lord, if you don't improve.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.61,1:31:58.77,*ENG,1016,0,0,0,,Every memory he has access to is a weapon he can use against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.94,1:32:03.07,*ENG,1017,0,0,0,,You won't last two seconds if he invades your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.25,1:32:06.51,*ENG,1018,0,0,0,,You're just like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.68,1:32:08.48,*ENG,1019,0,0,0,,Lazy, arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.65,1:32:10.88,*ENG,1020,0,0,0,,- Don't say a word against my father. - Weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.05,1:32:13.22,*ENG,1021,0,0,0,,- I'm not weak. - Then prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.86,1:32:15.79,*ENG,1022,0,0,0,,Control your emotions.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.96,1:32:18.89,*ENG,1023,0,0,0,,Discipline your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.73,1:32:22.93,*ENG,1024,0,0,0,,Legilimens.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.14,1:32:31.23,*ENG,1025,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.41,1:32:33.14,*ENG,1026,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.81,1:32:35.14,*ENG,1027,0,0,0,,I may vomit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.45,1:32:36.47,*ENG,1028,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.61,1:32:39.91,*ENG,1029,0,0,0,,Is this what you call control?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.42,1:32:43.48,*ENG,1030,0,0,0,,We've been at it for hours. If I could just rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.65,1:32:47.05,*ENG,1031,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord isn't resting.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.69,1:32:50.59,*ENG,1032,0,0,0,,You and Black, you're two of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.76,1:32:54.72,*ENG,1033,0,0,0,,Sentimental children forever whining about how bitterly unfair your lives have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.90,1:32:58.27,*ENG,1034,0,0,0,,Well, it may have escaped your notice, but life isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.44,1:33:02.39,*ENG,1035,0,0,0,,Your blessed father knew that. In fact, he frequently saw to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.57,1:33:05.60,*ENG,1036,0,0,0,,- My father was a great man. - Your father was a swine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.64,1:33:08.13,*ENG,1037,0,0,0,,- Legilimens. - Protego.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.72,1:33:15.24,*ENG,1038,0,0,0,,Come on, Moony, Padfoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.42,1:33:17.48,*ENG,1039,0,0,0,,Snape. Expelliarmus.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.65,1:33:19.49,*ENG,1040,0,0,0,,Nice one, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.86,1:33:22.15,*ENG,1041,0,0,0,,- Dad. - Impedimenta.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.33,1:33:24.32,*ENG,1042,0,0,0,,Snivellus Greasy. Snivellus Greasy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.49,1:33:27.16,*ENG,1043,0,0,0,,Right. Who wants to see me take off Snivelly's trousers?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.33,1:33:29.59,*ENG,1044,0,0,0,,Snivellus Greasy. Snivellus Greasy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.77,1:33:30.96,*ENG,1045,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.94,1:33:34.53,*ENG,1046,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.05,1:33:45.64,*ENG,1047,0,0,0,,Your lessons are at an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.82,1:33:46.94,*ENG,1048,0,0,0,,L...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.12,1:33:50.38,*ENG,1049,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.60,1:34:09.77,*ENG,1050,0,0,0,,- What's your name? - Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.94,1:34:11.84,*ENG,1051,0,0,0,,Your hand's gonna be fine, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.01,1:34:15.03,*ENG,1052,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's not as bad as it seems. See?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.21,1:34:17.24,*ENG,1053,0,0,0,,It's fading already.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.41,1:34:22.15,*ENG,1054,0,0,0,,You can hardly see ours anymore, and the pain stops after a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.53,1:34:32.26,*ENG,1055,0,0,0,,As I told you once before, Mr. Potter...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.43,1:34:36.20,*ENG,1056,0,0,0,,...naughty children deserve to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.27,1:34:40.60,*ENG,1057,0,0,0,,You know, George...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.77,1:34:44.43,*ENG,1058,0,0,0,,...l've always felt our futures lay outside the world of academic achievement.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.61,1:34:49.17,*ENG,1059,0,0,0,,Fred, I've been thinking exactly the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.61,1:34:54.17,*ENG,1060,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.12,1:36:02.78,*ENG,1061,0,0,0,,All right, professor!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.56,1:36:13.32,*ENG,1062,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.29,1:36:40.12,*ENG,1063,0,0,0,,Ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.88,1:38:09.14,*ENG,1064,0,0,0,,I need that prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.31,1:38:11.11,*ENG,1065,0,0,0,,You'll have to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.98,1:38:16.54,*ENG,1066,0,0,0,,Oh, I will. But first, you will fetch it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.72,1:38:18.42,*ENG,1067,0,0,0,,Crucio.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.96,1:38:22.72,*ENG,1068,0,0,0,,Crucio.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.10,1:38:35.57,*ENG,1069,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.74,1:38:36.73,*ENG,1070,0,0,0,,Harry, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.91,1:38:39.37,*ENG,1071,0,0,0,,I saw it. It's just like with Mr. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.54,1:38:41.41,*ENG,1072,0,0,0,,It's the door I've been dreaming about.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.58,1:38:43.64,*ENG,1073,0,0,0,,I couldn't remember where I'd seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.81,1:38:45.75,*ENG,1074,0,0,0,,Sirius said Voldemort was after something.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.92,1:38:49.21,*ENG,1075,0,0,0,,Something he didn't have the last time, in the Department of Mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.39,1:38:51.32,*ENG,1076,0,0,0,,Harry, please, just listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.82,1:38:54.81,*ENG,1077,0,0,0,,What if Voldemort meant for you to see this?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.13,1:38:59.25,*ENG,1078,0,0,0,,What if he's only hurting Sirius because he's trying to get to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.43,1:39:02.92,*ENG,1079,0,0,0,,What if he is? I'm supposed to just let him die?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.10,1:39:06.59,*ENG,1080,0,0,0,,Hermione, he's the only family I've got left.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.21,1:39:10.19,*ENG,1081,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.61,1:39:13.24,*ENG,1082,0,0,0,,We'll have to use the Floo Network.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.41,1:39:15.47,*ENG,1083,0,0,0,,Umbridge has the chimneys under surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.65,1:39:17.20,*ENG,1084,0,0,0,,Not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.02,1:39:21.35,*ENG,1085,0,0,0,,Alohomora.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.60,1:39:34.29,*ENG,1086,0,0,0,,Alert the Order if you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.46,1:39:38.03,*ENG,1087,0,0,0,,- Are you mental? We're going with you. - It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.20,1:39:41.83,*ENG,1088,0,0,0,,When are you going to get it into your head? We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.01,1:39:45.24,*ENG,1089,0,0,0,,That you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.41,1:39:48.28,*ENG,1090,0,0,0,,Caught this one trying to help the Weasley girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.28,1:39:55.38,*ENG,1091,0,0,0,,You were going to Dumbledore, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.55,1:39:57.58,*ENG,1092,0,0,0,,- No. - Liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.75,1:40:00.59,*ENG,1093,0,0,0,,- You sent for me, headmistress? - Snape, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.76,1:40:04.22,*ENG,1094,0,0,0,,The time has come for answers, whether he wants to give them to me or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.66,1:40:06.19,*ENG,1095,0,0,0,,Have you brought the Veritaserum?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.36,1:40:09.26,*ENG,1096,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you've used up all my stores interrogating students.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.43,1:40:12.56,*ENG,1097,0,0,0,,The last of it on Miss Chang.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.64,1:40:18.11,*ENG,1098,0,0,0,,Unless you wish to poison him...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.27,1:40:22.71,*ENG,1099,0,0,0,,And I assure you, I would have the greatest sympathy if you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.31,1:40:25.25,*ENG,1100,0,0,0,,I cannot help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.68,1:40:29.38,*ENG,1101,0,0,0,,He's got Padfoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.42,1:40:33.91,*ENG,1102,0,0,0,,He's got Padfoot at the place where it's hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.39,1:40:36.52,*ENG,1103,0,0,0,,Padfoot? What is Padfoot? Where what is hidden?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.69,1:40:38.22,*ENG,1104,0,0,0,,What is he talking about, Snape?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.90,1:40:46.89,*ENG,1105,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.41,1:40:52.97,*ENG,1106,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.98,1:40:56.31,*ENG,1107,0,0,0,,You give me no choice, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.68,1:40:59.65,*ENG,1108,0,0,0,,As this is an issue of Ministry security...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.82,1:41:01.88,*ENG,1109,0,0,0,,...you leave me with...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.62,1:41:04.59,*ENG,1110,0,0,0,,...no alternative.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.39,1:41:07.58,*ENG,1111,0,0,0,,The Cruciatus Curse ought to loosen your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.76,1:41:08.75,*ENG,1112,0,0,0,,That's illegal.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.93,1:41:12.29,*ENG,1113,0,0,0,,What Cornelius doesn't know won't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.80,1:41:21.33,*ENG,1114,0,0,0,,Tell her, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.84,1:41:24.27,*ENG,1115,0,0,0,,Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.48,1:41:27.47,*ENG,1116,0,0,0,,Well, if you won't tell her where it is...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.14,1:41:29.91,*ENG,1117,0,0,0,,...I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.55,1:41:33.35,*ENG,1118,0,0,0,,Where what is?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.55,1:41:36.85,*ENG,1119,0,0,0,,Dumbledore's secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.86,1:41:43.38,*ENG,1120,0,0,0,,How much further?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.56,1:41:45.22,*ENG,1121,0,0,0,,Not far.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.23,1:41:50.93,*ENG,1122,0,0,0,,It had to be somewhere students wouldn't find it accidentally.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.27,1:41:56.74,*ENG,1123,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.91,1:41:58.70,*ENG,1124,0,0,0,,Lmprovising.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.22,1:42:08.81,*ENG,1125,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.12,1:42:12.25,*ENG,1126,0,0,0,,Where is this weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.16,1:42:19.42,*ENG,1127,0,0,0,,There isn't one, is there?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.20,1:42:24.36,*ENG,1128,0,0,0,,You were trying to trick me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.57,1:42:30.13,*ENG,1129,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.54,1:42:33.57,*ENG,1130,0,0,0,,...I really hate children.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.16,1:42:53.60,*ENG,1131,0,0,0,,You have no business here, centaur. This is a Ministry matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.27,1:42:57.93,*ENG,1132,0,0,0,,Lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.10,1:43:03.63,*ENG,1133,0,0,0,,I warn you, under the law, as creatures of near- human intelligence...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.81,1:43:05.03,*ENG,1134,0,0,0,,Protego.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.31,1:43:06.43,*ENG,1135,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.08,1:43:08.60,*ENG,1136,0,0,0,,Filthy half- breed.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.38,1:43:10.37,*ENG,1137,0,0,0,,Incarcerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.59,1:43:26.19,*ENG,1138,0,0,0,,Please. Please stop it. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.36,1:43:31.03,*ENG,1139,0,0,0,,Now, enough. I will have order.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.88,1:43:42.44,*ENG,1140,0,0,0,,You filthy animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.61,1:43:45.58,*ENG,1141,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.75,1:43:48.58,*ENG,1142,0,0,0,,Leave him alone. It's not his fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.75,1:43:50.62,*ENG,1143,0,0,0,,No, he doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.29,1:44:01.75,*ENG,1144,0,0,0,,Potter, do something. Tell them I mean no harm.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.93,1:44:03.87,*ENG,1145,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.03,1:44:05.83,*ENG,1146,0,0,0,,But I must not tell lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.00,1:44:06.99,*ENG,1147,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.17,1:44:11.00,*ENG,1148,0,0,0,,I am Senior Undersecretary Dolores Jane Umbridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.47,1:44:13.67,*ENG,1149,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.35,1:44:18.14,*ENG,1150,0,0,0,,Thank you, Grawp.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.31,1:44:21.81,*ENG,1151,0,0,0,,Hermione. Hermione, Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.09,1:44:33.65,*ENG,1152,0,0,0,,- How'd you get away? - Puking Pastilles. It wasn't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.83,1:44:35.95,*ENG,1153,0,0,0,,Told them I was hungry, wanted some sweets.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.13,1:44:38.69,*ENG,1154,0,0,0,,They told me to bugger off and ate the lot themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.53,1:44:41.02,*ENG,1155,0,0,0,,That was clever, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.87,1:44:44.36,*ENG,1156,0,0,0,,- Has been known to happen. - It was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.54,1:44:46.34,*ENG,1157,0,0,0,,So how are we getting to London?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.71,1:44:51.23,*ENG,1158,0,0,0,,Look, it's not that I don't appreciate everything you've done, all of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.08,1:44:54.77,*ENG,1159,0,0,0,,...but I've got you into enough trouble as it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.95,1:44:57.92,*ENG,1160,0,0,0,,Dumbledore's Army's supposed to be about doing something real.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.25,1:45:00.38,*ENG,1161,0,0,0,,Or was that all just words to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.26,1:45:05.45,*ENG,1162,0,0,0,,Maybe you don't have to do this all by yourself, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.36,1:45:12.52,*ENG,1163,0,0,0,,So how are we going to get to London?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.93,1:45:16.16,*ENG,1164,0,0,0,,We fly, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.22,1:46:09.38,*ENG,1165,0,0,0,,Department of Mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.23,1:46:19.93,*ENG,1166,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.92,1:47:15.25,*ENG,1167,0,0,0,,92, 93
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.96,1:47:18.32,*ENG,1168,0,0,0,,94
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.59,1:47:20.62,*ENG,1169,0,0,0,,95
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.17,1:47:35.94,*ENG,1170,0,0,0,,- He should be here. - Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.65,1:47:39.94,*ENG,1171,0,0,0,,It's got your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.14,1:48:09.51,*ENG,1172,0,0,0,,The one with the power to vanquish the Dark Lord approaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.34,1:48:12.78,*ENG,1173,0,0,0,,And the Dark Lord shall mark him as his equal...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.95,1:48:15.74,*ENG,1174,0,0,0,,...but he shall have power the Dark Lord knows not.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.39,1:48:26.76,*ENG,1175,0,0,0,,For neither can live while the other survives.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.26,1:48:30.35,*ENG,1176,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.84,1:48:42.33,*ENG,1177,0,0,0,,Where's Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.51,1:48:47.61,*ENG,1178,0,0,0,,You know, you really should learn to tell the difference between dreams...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.52,1:48:52.68,*ENG,1179,0,0,0,,...and reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.95,1:48:58.89,*ENG,1180,0,0,0,,You saw only what the Dark Lord wanted you to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.59,1:49:01.08,*ENG,1181,0,0,0,,Now, hand me the prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.26,1:49:03.35,*ENG,1182,0,0,0,,If you do anything to us, I'll break it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.13,1:49:08.69,*ENG,1183,0,0,0,,He knows how to play.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.87,1:49:12.67,*ENG,1184,0,0,0,,Itty, bitty baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.84,1:49:14.07,*ENG,1185,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.61,1:49:16.51,*ENG,1186,0,0,0,,Bellatrix Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.68,1:49:19.61,*ENG,1187,0,0,0,,Neville Longbottom, is it? How's Mum and Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.78,1:49:21.64,*ENG,1188,0,0,0,,Better, now they're about to be avenged.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.48,1:49:29.29,*ENG,1189,0,0,0,,Now, let's everybody just calm down...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.76,1:49:31.25,*ENG,1190,0,0,0,,...shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.42,1:49:33.89,*ENG,1191,0,0,0,,All we want is that prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.06,1:49:36.26,*ENG,1192,0,0,0,,Why did Voldemort need me to come and get this?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.43,1:49:38.06,*ENG,1193,0,0,0,,You dare speak his name?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.60,1:49:41.19,*ENG,1194,0,0,0,,You filthy half- blood!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.37,1:49:43.96,*ENG,1195,0,0,0,,It's all right. He's just a curious lad, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.91,1:49:51.37,*ENG,1196,0,0,0,,Prophecies can only be retrieved by those about whom they are made.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.54,1:49:54.27,*ENG,1197,0,0,0,,Which is lucky for you, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.05,1:49:59.99,*ENG,1198,0,0,0,,Haven't you always wondered...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.49,1:50:05.69,*ENG,1199,0,0,0,,...what was the reason for the connection between you and the Dark Lord?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.43,1:50:08.92,*ENG,1200,0,0,0,,Why he was unable to kill you...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.10,1:50:11.62,*ENG,1201,0,0,0,,...when you were just an infant?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.00,1:50:17.80,*ENG,1202,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know the secret of your scar?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.74,1:50:23.14,*ENG,1203,0,0,0,,All the answers are there, Potter, in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.34,1:50:26.34,*ENG,1204,0,0,0,,All you have to do...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.91,1:50:28.85,*ENG,1205,0,0,0,,...is give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.15,1:50:32.45,*ENG,1206,0,0,0,,Then I can show you everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.19,1:50:42.99,*ENG,1207,0,0,0,,I've waited 14 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.60,1:50:44.89,*ENG,1208,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.20,1:50:49.13,*ENG,1209,0,0,0,,I guess I can wait a little longer. Now. Stupefy.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.30,1:50:50.74,*ENG,1210,0,0,0,,Stupefy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.89,1:51:07.88,*ENG,1211,0,0,0,,Levicorpus.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.43,1:51:16.45,*ENG,1212,0,0,0,,Petrificus Totalus.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.63,1:51:18.43,*ENG,1213,0,0,0,,Well done, Neville.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.87,1:51:28.43,*ENG,1214,0,0,0,,Stupefy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.18,1:51:31.40,*ENG,1215,0,0,0,,- Stupefy. - Stupefy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.56,1:51:44.46,*ENG,1216,0,0,0,,Stupefy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.00,1:51:54.30,*ENG,1217,0,0,0,,Reducto.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.32,1:52:12.41,*ENG,1218,0,0,0,,Get back to the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.72,1:52:52.21,*ENG,1219,0,0,0,,Department of Mysteries. They got that bit right, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.43,1:52:59.33,*ENG,1220,0,0,0,,The voices.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.90,1:53:01.92,*ENG,1221,0,0,0,,Can you tell what they're saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.60,1:53:05.76,*ENG,1222,0,0,0,,There aren't any voices, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.51,1:53:08.27,*ENG,1223,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.44,1:53:10.03,*ENG,1224,0,0,0,,I hear them too.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.15,1:53:15.77,*ENG,1225,0,0,0,,Harry, it's just an empty archway.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.55,1:53:19.95,*ENG,1226,0,0,0,,Please, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.72,1:53:22.59,*ENG,1227,0,0,0,,Get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.14,1:54:11.83,*ENG,1228,0,0,0,,Did you actually believe...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.00,1:54:16.60,*ENG,1229,0,0,0,,...or were you truly naive enough to think...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.21,1:54:22.34,*ENG,1230,0,0,0,,...that children stood a chance against us?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.85,1:54:29.58,*ENG,1231,0,0,0,,I'll make this simple for you, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.29,1:54:36.63,*ENG,1232,0,0,0,,Give me the prophecy now...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.80,1:54:40.79,*ENG,1233,0,0,0,,...or watch your friends die.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.71,1:54:55.11,*ENG,1234,0,0,0,,Don't give it to him, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.41,1:55:24.17,*ENG,1235,0,0,0,,Get away from my godson.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.27,1:55:56.87,*ENG,1236,0,0,0,,Now, listen to me. Take the others and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.21,1:55:59.04,*ENG,1237,0,0,0,,What? No, I'm staying with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.21,1:56:02.05,*ENG,1238,0,0,0,,You've done beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.68,1:56:04.34,*ENG,1239,0,0,0,,Now, let me take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.52,1:56:05.51,*ENG,1240,0,0,0,,Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.68,1:56:34.01,*ENG,1241,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.18,1:56:35.51,*ENG,1242,0,0,0,,Nice one, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.76,1:56:44.22,*ENG,1243,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.44,1:57:06.74,*ENG,1244,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.70,1:57:33.37,*ENG,1245,0,0,0,,I killed Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.34,1:57:36.31,*ENG,1246,0,0,0,,- You coming to get me? - Crucio.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.65,1:57:51.78,*ENG,1247,0,0,0,,You've got to mean it, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.96,1:57:55.72,*ENG,1248,0,0,0,,She killed him. She deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.57,1:58:02.76,*ENG,1249,0,0,0,,You know the spell, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.31,1:58:15.94,*ENG,1250,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.62,1:58:26.59,*ENG,1251,0,0,0,,So weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.37,1:58:36.56,*ENG,1252,0,0,0,,It was foolish of you to come here tonight, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.74,1:58:38.47,*ENG,1253,0,0,0,,The Aurors are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.64,1:58:42.84,*ENG,1254,0,0,0,,By which time I shall be gone, and you...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.38,1:58:46.47,*ENG,1255,0,0,0,,...shall be dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.78,2:01:02.68,*ENG,1256,0,0,0,,You've lost, old man.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.84,2:01:23.82,*ENG,1257,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.97,2:01:29.46,*ENG,1258,0,0,0,,So weak.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.98,2:01:32.21,*ENG,1259,0,0,0,,So vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.52,2:01:37.50,*ENG,1260,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.05,2:01:44.28,*ENG,1261,0,0,0,,Harry, it isn't how you are alike.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.46,2:01:46.95,*ENG,1262,0,0,0,,It's how you are not.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.90,2:01:53.39,*ENG,1263,0,0,0,,Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.80,2:02:27.27,*ENG,1264,0,0,0,,You're the weak one...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.87,2:02:32.00,*ENG,1265,0,0,0,,...and you'll never know love or friendship.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.41,2:02:38.31,*ENG,1266,0,0,0,,And I feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.37,2:03:04.83,*ENG,1267,0,0,0,,You're a fool, Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.77,2:03:10.90,*ENG,1268,0,0,0,,And you will lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.86,2:03:27.52,*ENG,1269,0,0,0,,He's back.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.46,2:03:40.42,*ENG,1270,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.46,2:03:42.42,*ENG,1271,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.46,2:03:49.46,*ENG,1272,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.46,2:03:54.46,*ENG,1273,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.46,2:03:58.46,*ENG,1274,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.26,2:04:36.92,*ENG,1275,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.10,2:04:38.69,*ENG,1276,0,0,0,,No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.34,2:04:45.74,*ENG,1277,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.90,2:04:49.17,*ENG,1278,0,0,0,,No, the fault is mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.18,2:04:51.94,*ENG,1279,0,0,0,,I knew it was only a matter of time...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.11,2:04:55.17,*ENG,1280,0,0,0,,...before Voldemort made the connection between you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.98,2:05:00.25,*ENG,1281,0,0,0,,I thought by distancing myself from you, as I have done all year...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.42,2:05:05.65,*ENG,1282,0,0,0,,...he'd be less tempted, and therefore you might be more protected.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.46,2:05:11.79,*ENG,1283,0,0,0,,The prophecy said:
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.40,2:05:16.36,*ENG,1284,0,0,0,,"Neither one can live while the other one survives."
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.70,2:05:23.77,*ENG,1285,0,0,0,,It means one of us is gonna have to kill the other, in the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.78,2:05:27.34,*ENG,1286,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.81,2:05:29.37,*ENG,1287,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.55,2:05:33.14,*ENG,1288,0,0,0,,For the same reason you tried to save Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.32,2:05:35.75,*ENG,1289,0,0,0,,The same reason your friends saved you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.59,2:05:40.12,*ENG,1290,0,0,0,,After all these years, after all you've suffered...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.29,2:05:43.19,*ENG,1291,0,0,0,,...I didn't want to cause you any more pain.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.66,2:05:46.79,*ENG,1292,0,0,0,,I cared too much about you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.66,2:06:13.96,*ENG,1293,0,0,0,,How come you're not at the feast?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.13,2:06:18.69,*ENG,1294,0,0,0,,Lost all my possessions. Apparently people have been hiding them.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.86,2:06:19.85,*ENG,1295,0,0,0,,That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.03,2:06:21.93,*ENG,1296,0,0,0,,Oh, it's all good fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.10,2:06:25.56,*ENG,1297,0,0,0,,But as it's the last night, I really do need them back.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.74,2:06:28.10,*ENG,1298,0,0,0,,Do you want any help finding them?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.01,2:06:34.21,*ENG,1299,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about your godfather, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.25,2:06:43.31,*ENG,1300,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want any help looking?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.49,2:06:45.15,*ENG,1301,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.32,2:06:47.49,*ENG,1302,0,0,0,,Anyway, my mum always said...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.66,2:06:51.53,*ENG,1303,0,0,0,,...the things we lose have a way of coming back to us in the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.77,2:06:58.03,*ENG,1304,0,0,0,,If not always in the way we expect.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.54,2:07:02.23,*ENG,1305,0,0,0,,Think I'll just go have some pudding.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.91,2:07:40.81,*ENG,1306,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about something Dumbledore said to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.98,2:07:42.67,*ENG,1307,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.28,2:07:46.05,*ENG,1308,0,0,0,,That even though we've got a fight ahead of us...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.22,2:07:49.31,*ENG,1309,0,0,0,,...we've got one thing that Voldemort doesn't have.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.49,2:07:50.98,*ENG,1310,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.89,2:07:55.26,*ENG,1311,0,0,0,,Something worth fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.46,2:08:12.33,*ENG,1312,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.53,0:00:36.73,*CHS,1,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与凤凰社》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:56.73,*CHS,2,0,0,0,,不知道你怎么看 不过今天确实太热了，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:01.23,*CHS,3,0,0,0,,而且还有更热的趋势 未来几天气温将达到摄氏30度以上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:05.10,*CHS,4,0,0,0,,也就是华氏90度以上 明天甚至可能达到华氏100度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:07.94,*CHS,5,0,0,0,,所以，请记得找个凉快的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.11,0:01:10.95,*CHS,6,0,0,0,,收听FM调频广播的最热门评论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.85,*CHS,7,0,0,0,,来吧，孩子，该回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:16.71,*CHS,8,0,0,0,,快，亲爱的，快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:22.13,*CHS,9,0,0,0,,- 一定要吗？ - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:25.66,*CHS,10,0,0,0,,我会准备你最爱吃的晚餐来补偿的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:28.69,*CHS,11,0,0,0,,他叫起来就像头猪，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:32.39,*CHS,12,0,0,0,,是啊，打得太有形了，大迪 你看到他的脸了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:34.40,*CHS,13,0,0,0,,喂！大迪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.31,0:01:36.93,*CHS,14,0,0,0,,又在欺负10岁小孩了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:39.60,*CHS,15,0,0,0,,- 他活该 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:44.41,*CHS,16,0,0,0,,- 五对一，你可真勇敢 - 这话轮不到你说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:49.85,*CHS,17,0,0,0,,每晚睡着了还在嘀咕 起码我不会被自己的枕头吓倒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.86,*CHS,18,0,0,0,,“别杀塞德里克”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:01:56.95,*CHS,19,0,0,0,,塞德里克是谁？你男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:02.25,*CHS,20,0,0,0,,- 住口 - “他要杀我，妈妈！”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:04.93,*CHS,21,0,0,0,,你妈呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:08.40,*CHS,22,0,0,0,,你妈在哪里啊，波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.64,*CHS,23,0,0,0,,死了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:13.44,*CHS,24,0,0,0,,死了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.31,*CHS,25,0,0,0,,是死了吧，波...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.32,*CHS,26,0,0,0,,- 达力 - 达力，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:36.06,*CHS,27,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了？ - 你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:39.20,*CHS,28,0,0,0,,- 我什么也没做 - 我们走吧，达力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:40.89,*CHS,29,0,0,0,,来吧，达力，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:33.19,*CHS,30,0,0,0,,达力，快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:10.26,*CHS,31,0,0,0,,呼神护卫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:41.89,*CHS,32,0,0,0,,费格太太
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.86,*CHS,33,0,0,0,,别把魔杖收起来，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:50.53,*CHS,34,0,0,0,,他们可能还会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:54.77,*CHS,35,0,0,0,,摄魂怪出现在小文金镇 接下来会是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.90,*CHS,36,0,0,0,,- 整个世界都乱七八糟的 - 我不明白，你怎么知道?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:01.27,*CHS,37,0,0,0,,邓布利多叫我看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:04.85,*CHS,38,0,0,0,,邓布利多？ 你认识邓布利多？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:08.85,*CHS,39,0,0,0,,去年可怜的迪戈里被神秘人杀死后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:11.68,*CHS,40,0,0,0,,你以为他还会让你一个人到处晃？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.52,*CHS,41,0,0,0,,天啊，哈利 他们告诉我你很聪明的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.69,0:05:17.82,*CHS,42,0,0,0,,从现在起，到里面去 呆在那！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:22.66,*CHS,43,0,0,0,,很快就会有人联系你的 不管发生什么事，别出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:34.44,*CHS,44,0,0,0,,是很热，没错，到处都很热
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:36.74,*CHS,45,0,0,0,,简直就是汗流浃背，太闷了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.81,*CHS,46,0,0,0,,小达？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.17,*CHS,47,0,0,0,,是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:47.52,*CHS,48,0,0,0,,达力！弗农，快过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.73,*CHS,49,0,0,0,,我们得带他去医院
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:53.02,*CHS,50,0,0,0,,是谁做的，孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:05:59.20,*CHS,51,0,0,0,,你现在高兴了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:03.20,*CHS,52,0,0,0,,你总算如愿以偿了 你总算是把他给弄傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:06.17,*CHS,53,0,0,0,,弗农，别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:10.71,*CHS,54,0,0,0,,你看看这孩子，佩妮 我们的孩子傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.04,*CHS,55,0,0,0,,我已经忍无可忍了，听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:17.05,*CHS,56,0,0,0,,这是我最后一次容忍你这种行为
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:33.06,*CHS,57,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的波特先生 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:38.47,*CHS,58,0,0,0,,魔法部得到消息 在今晚的6点23分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:43.38,*CHS,59,0,0,0,,你曾在一位麻瓜面前 使用了守护神魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:45.64,*CHS,60,0,0,0,,此行为违反了...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:49.88,*CHS,61,0,0,0,,禁止未成年巫师使用魔法条例
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:52.18,*CHS,62,0,0,0,,因此，你已被驱逐出...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:56.08,*CHS,63,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨魔法学院
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:07:01.20,*CHS,64,0,0,0,,愿一切安好，马法尔达·霍普柯克
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.67,*CHS,65,0,0,0,,天理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.11,*CHS,66,0,0,0,,他有些不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:36.43,*CHS,67,0,0,0,,对不起，海德薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:45.43,*CHS,68,0,0,0,,这些人还真爱干净
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:48.67,*CHS,69,0,0,0,,- 唐克斯，拜托 - 太不自然了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.20,*CHS,70,0,0,0,,穆迪教授
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:57.67,*CHS,71,0,0,0,,- 你来这里做什么？ - 当然是来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:03.28,*CHS,72,0,0,0,,我们能去哪儿？ 那封信说我已经被退学了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:05.89,*CHS,73,0,0,0,,不，目前还没有 金斯莱，你挑点重点说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:07.05,*CHS,74,0,0,0,,但信上说...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:10.25,*CHS,75,0,0,0,,邓布利多说服了魔法部的人 等开个正式的听证会后...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:12.59,*CHS,76,0,0,0,,- 才决定是否让你退学 - 听证会？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:16.13,*CHS,77,0,0,0,,别担心，我们到了总部再解释给你听
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.60,*CHS,78,0,0,0,,别在这里说，尼法朵拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:22.60,*CHS,79,0,0,0,,不要叫我尼法朵拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:32.07,*CHS,80,0,0,0,,大家一定得保持队形 即使有人被杀了也别掉队
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.89,*CHS,81,0,0,0,,快点，你，在拐角的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:27.40,*CHS,82,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:08.61,*CHS,83,0,0,0,,进去，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.64,*CHS,84,0,0,0,,那里没有任何证人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:13.54,*CHS,85,0,0,0,,没有死亡，没有证据
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:16.58,*CHS,86,0,0,0,,他差点儿就杀了哈利 如果证据不够充分...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:20.69,*CHS,87,0,0,0,,是的，但是保护那个最重要的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:25.39,*CHS,88,0,0,0,,我们得相信邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:29.97,*CHS,89,0,0,0,,他去年保护哈利了吗？ 嗯，我认为今晚就该采取行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:33.33,*CHS,90,0,0,0,,康奈利·福吉首先是个政治家 其次才能算个巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:36.67,*CHS,91,0,0,0,,- 他的本能会忽略掉... - 拜托，声音小点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:41.28,*CHS,92,0,0,0,,他变得越来越强大了 我们得赶快行动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.55,*CHS,93,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 韦斯莱太太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.19,0:11:52.68,*CHS,94,0,0,0,,谢天谢地，你没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:59.92,*CHS,95,0,0,0,,瘦了点 但晚餐恐怕得等开完会才能吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:05.23,*CHS,96,0,0,0,,不，现在没时间解释 到楼上去，左边第一扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.04,*CHS,97,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:14.50,*CHS,98,0,0,0,,泥巴种，狼人，叛徒，小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:19.55,*CHS,99,0,0,0,,我可怜的女主人 他们都带了什么垃圾到她家里来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:22.01,*CHS,100,0,0,0,,她会对克利切怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:26.04,*CHS,101,0,0,0,,哦，真是可耻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:41.16,*CHS,102,0,0,0,,- 都是些畸形人 - 到处都是，女主人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:44.74,*CHS,103,0,0,0,,地球上的垃圾 再也不像父亲他们那段时光了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.94,0:12:47.54,*CHS,104,0,0,0,,克利切在这
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:53.05,*CHS,105,0,0,0,,哦，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:59.69,*CHS,106,0,0,0,,你没事吧？ 听他们说你被摄魂怪攻击了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:02.69,*CHS,107,0,0,0,,- 你得把一切都告诉我们 - 先让他喘口气吧，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:07.06,*CHS,108,0,0,0,,还有魔法部的听证会 太不可理喻了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:09.39,*CHS,109,0,0,0,,我查过资料 他们根本不能让你退学
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:12.26,*CHS,110,0,0,0,,- 这太不公平 - 就是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:15.40,*CHS,111,0,0,0,,现在不公平的事可多着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.31,0:13:19.24,*CHS,112,0,0,0,,这是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.41,0:13:22.11,*CHS,113,0,0,0,,- 是总部 - 凤凰社的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:24.40,*CHS,114,0,0,0,,是个秘密组织
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:27.14,*CHS,115,0,0,0,,是邓布利多在上次反抗神秘人时创立的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:29.88,*CHS,116,0,0,0,,我猜这些在信里都不能提，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:32.75,*CHS,117,0,0,0,,我整个夏天就没得到一点消息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:36.95,*CHS,118,0,0,0,,我们想写的，伙计，是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:38.18,*CHS,119,0,0,0,,- 只是... - 只是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:41.56,*CHS,120,0,0,0,,只不过邓布利多要我们发誓 不会告诉你任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:45.06,*CHS,121,0,0,0,,邓布利多说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.87,0:13:49.60,*CHS,122,0,0,0,,他为什么要瞒着我？ 也许我还能帮上点忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.74,*CHS,123,0,0,0,,是我看着伏地魔回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:54.74,*CHS,124,0,0,0,,跟他决斗的人是我 看着塞德里克·迪戈里被杀的人也是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:57.11,*CHS,125,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 果然是你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:14:01.34,*CHS,126,0,0,0,,- 有什么事别放在心里，伙计，说出来 - 如果你已经发泄完了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:04.01,*CHS,127,0,0,0,,你想不想听点有趣的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:08.65,*CHS,128,0,0,0,,如果有谁有权利知道这件事情，就是哈利 如果不是他...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:10.88,*CHS,129,0,0,0,,我们根本不知道伏地魔又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:12.62,*CHS,130,0,0,0,,他已经不是个孩子了，莫丽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.16,*CHS,131,0,0,0,,但他也还不是个大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:18.40,*CHS,132,0,0,0,,- 他不是詹姆，小天狼星 - 嗯，他不是你的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:20.73,*CHS,133,0,0,0,,跟我儿子没两样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:22.80,*CHS,134,0,0,0,,- 除了我以外，他还有谁？ - 嗨，金妮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:25.41,*CHS,135,0,0,0,,- 他还有我 - 真是感人的父爱啊，布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:28.67,*CHS,136,0,0,0,,可能波特到时候会跟他教父一样邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:30.61,*CHS,137,0,0,0,,这里没你的事，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.84,*CHS,138,0,0,0,,- 斯内普也是社员之一？ - 饭桶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:34.88,*CHS,139,0,0,0,,关于你想像的改革
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:37.78,*CHS,140,0,0,0,,- 我的想像更好 - 那为什么不跟他说？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.65,*CHS,141,0,0,0,,- 放手 - 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:41.45,*CHS,142,0,0,0,,- 把它放下 - 克鲁克山
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.02,*CHS,143,0,0,0,,- 住手 - 放手，你这爱偷腥的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:46.46,*CHS,144,0,0,0,,- 克鲁克山，别碰它 - 把它放下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:52.09,*CHS,145,0,0,0,,- 赫敏，我讨厌你的猫 - 坏克鲁克山
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:56.00,*CHS,146,0,0,0,,我们会在厨房吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.27,*CHS,147,0,0,0,,虽然说你们现在可以用魔法了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:02.47,*CHS,148,0,0,0,,但这不表示每件事 都得拿魔杖出来到处耍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.24,*CHS,149,0,0,0,,嗨，妈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:06.94,*CHS,150,0,0,0,,饿了吗，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:09.74,*CHS,151,0,0,0,,确定没事吧，哈利？ 你把我们吓了一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.08,*CHS,152,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:16.09,*CHS,153,0,0,0,,小天狼星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:24.10,*CHS,154,0,0,0,,这真是，真是太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:27.93,*CHS,155,0,0,0,,似乎你的听证会将在 整个威森加摩面前举行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:31.54,*CHS,156,0,0,0,,我不懂，魔法部为什么这么仇视我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:35.88,*CHS,157,0,0,0,,给他看吧，他很快就会发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:46.25,*CHS,158,0,0,0,,(预言家日报 撒谎的男孩？)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:49.28,*CHS,159,0,0,0,,另外他还在攻击邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:51.08,*CHS,160,0,0,0,,(福吉: 万事皆顺)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:56.12,*CHS,161,0,0,0,,福吉利用了他一切的权力 包括他对预言家日报的影响力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:59.42,*CHS,162,0,0,0,,攻击每一个号称神秘人已回来的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:00.90,*CHS,163,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:03.04,*CHS,164,0,0,0,,他以为邓布利多想抢他饭碗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.33,*CHS,165,0,0,0,,这太不可理喻了 正常人都不会认为邓布利多...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:08.38,*CHS,166,0,0,0,,就是这个意思 福吉现在不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:11.07,*CHS,167,0,0,0,,他的思想被恐惧控制了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:15.18,*CHS,168,0,0,0,,恐惧是会让人做出很恐怖的事的，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.79,*CHS,169,0,0,0,,伏地魔在上次得到力量时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:21.29,*CHS,170,0,0,0,,他几乎毁灭了一切我们所珍惜的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:25.39,*CHS,171,0,0,0,,现在他回来了 恐怕魔法部长正在尽一切所能...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:28.50,*CHS,172,0,0,0,,否认这个恐怖的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.77,0:16:34.43,*CHS,173,0,0,0,,我们猜想 伏地魔可能在制造自己的军团
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:38.23,*CHS,174,0,0,0,,十四年前，有一大堆的人听命于他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:42.97,*CHS,175,0,0,0,,不只是巫师和女巫 还包括所有黑暗生物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:47.61,*CHS,176,0,0,0,,他正在大肆招兵买马 而我们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:52.32,*CHS,177,0,0,0,,但寻找随从并不是他唯一的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:57.09,*CHS,178,0,0,0,,我们相信...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.03,*CHS,179,0,0,0,,伏地魔可能在寻找某样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:01.29,*CHS,180,0,0,0,,小天狼星
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.80,*CHS,181,0,0,0,,一样他以前没得到的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:11.30,*CHS,182,0,0,0,,你是说某种武器？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:15.54,*CHS,183,0,0,0,,不是，够了，他还只是个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:18.51,*CHS,184,0,0,0,,再多告诉他一点的话 你倒不如直接邀请他加入社团
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:22.48,*CHS,185,0,0,0,,很好啊，我很想加入 如果伏地魔在制造军团，那我也想战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:36.83,*CHS,186,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:39.26,*CHS,187,0,0,0,,在整个威森加摩面前
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:42.23,*CHS,188,0,0,0,,你已被驱逐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.34,*CHS,189,0,0,0,,是火车，而且在地下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:55.81,*CHS,190,0,0,0,,太聪明了，这些麻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.83,*CHS,191,0,0,0,,我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:21.10,*CHS,192,0,0,0,,我从来没用过客用入口 应该蛮有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:26.15,*CHS,193,0,0,0,,是的，很好 我只要拿些麻瓜的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:09.06,*CHS,194,0,0,0,,太可怕了 在药剂市场使用的大量加隆丢失
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:12.52,*CHS,195,0,0,0,,女士们，先生们，预言家日报 有谁要预言家日报的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:15.69,*CHS,196,0,0,0,,邓布利多 是愚蠢还是危险？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.45,*CHS,197,0,0,0,,- 你好，亚瑟 - 你好，鲍勃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:44.65,*CHS,198,0,0,0,,部门间的备忘录
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:48.79,*CHS,199,0,0,0,,以前我们使用的是猫头鹰 那种混乱程度是无法想象的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:57.37,*CHS,200,0,0,0,,天啊，谢谢，金斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:20:00.91,*CHS,201,0,0,0,,- 他们更改了你的听证会时间 - 什么时候开始？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:03.18,*CHS,202,0,0,0,,五分钟后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:14.08,*CHS,203,0,0,0,,神秘事务司
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:20.76,*CHS,204,0,0,0,,我确信，部长 你们该做出正确的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:23.02,*CHS,205,0,0,0,,是的，但我们一定...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:33.61,*CHS,206,0,0,0,,记住，在听证会上，不要私自开口
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:37.30,*CHS,207,0,0,0,,别紧张，你没做错事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:40.88,*CHS,208,0,0,0,,就像那些麻瓜所说的 真相一定会水落石出的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:42.75,*CHS,209,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:46.22,*CHS,210,0,0,0,,恐怕我不能陪你进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.62,*CHS,211,0,0,0,,祝你好运，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:56.09,*CHS,212,0,0,0,,八月十二日的纪律听证会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:59.20,*CHS,213,0,0,0,,犯罪方，哈利·詹姆·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:03.00,*CHS,214,0,0,0,,家住萨里郡小文金镇贞女路四号
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:06.27,*CHS,215,0,0,0,,质问者，康奈利·奥斯瓦尔德·福吉 魔法部
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:08.27,*CHS,216,0,0,0,,辩方证人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:15.35,*CHS,217,0,0,0,,阿不思·珀西瓦尔· 伍尔弗里克·布赖恩·邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:18.92,*CHS,218,0,0,0,,你收到我们的通知...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:21.65,*CHS,219,0,0,0,,- 说审判改时间地点了？ - 我可能没留意到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:25.76,*CHS,220,0,0,0,,但幸运的是 我不小心提早了3小时到达魔法部
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:29.93,*CHS,221,0,0,0,,控诉是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.62,*CHS,222,0,0,0,,被告将面临以下控诉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:34.43,*CHS,223,0,0,0,,他在清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:38.16,*CHS,224,0,0,0,,以及知道自己违法行为的前提下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:41.33,*CHS,225,0,0,0,,使用了守护神魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.51,0:21:44.74,*CHS,226,0,0,0,,并且是在一位麻瓜面前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:48.21,*CHS,227,0,0,0,,- 你否认曾使用此魔咒吗？ - 不，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:51.84,*CHS,228,0,0,0,,你是否了解17岁以下的巫师在校园范围外
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.02,0:21:54.89,*CHS,229,0,0,0,,- 是禁止使用魔法的？ - 是的，我知道，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:58.42,*CHS,230,0,0,0,,威森加摩的众女巫巫师们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:00.82,*CHS,231,0,0,0,,我是为了驱赶摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.57,0:22:05.19,*CHS,232,0,0,0,,摄魂怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.50,*CHS,233,0,0,0,,在小文金镇？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.67,0:22:10.00,*CHS,234,0,0,0,,很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.17,0:22:13.30,*CHS,235,0,0,0,,麻瓜是看不到摄魂怪的 对吗，孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:15.70,*CHS,236,0,0,0,,- 真是便捷啊 - 我没说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:18.44,*CHS,237,0,0,0,,- 那天有两个，如果我... - 够了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.61,0:22:22.81,*CHS,238,0,0,0,,抱歉打断你的话 这确实是个很好的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.99,0:22:27.48,*CHS,239,0,0,0,,但既然你无法找到证人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:32.25,*CHS,240,0,0,0,,对不起，部长 就如同事情发生了一样，我们有证人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:38.69,*CHS,241,0,0,0,,请描述一下当时的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.47,0:22:43.27,*CHS,242,0,0,0,,他们长什么样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:49.28,*CHS,243,0,0,0,,一个块头很大，还有一个很瘦小
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:53.18,*CHS,244,0,0,0,,不是那两个孩子，是摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:57.01,*CHS,245,0,0,0,,哦，是的，是的，嗯，很大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.22,0:23:02.82,*CHS,246,0,0,0,,穿着披风，一切都变得很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:06.86,*CHS,247,0,0,0,,就像一切的欢乐都离这个世界远去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.03,0:23:12.13,*CHS,248,0,0,0,,听着，摄魂怪不可能迷路进入麻瓜的区域
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:15.93,*CHS,249,0,0,0,,而且还刚巧遇见了一个巫师 这个可能性太微小了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:17.83,*CHS,250,0,0,0,,我想没人相信
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.01,0:23:21.03,*CHS,251,0,0,0,,那些摄魂怪是碰巧在那里的，部长
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.58,0:23:26.45,*CHS,252,0,0,0,,我可能误解你了，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.62,0:23:32.11,*CHS,253,0,0,0,,不管怎么说，摄魂怪是听命于魔法部的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.29,0:23:36.49,*CHS,254,0,0,0,,可能是我太笨了 这听起来有一点像是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:40.65,*CHS,255,0,0,0,,你认为是魔法部指示这次攻击行动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:43.63,*CHS,256,0,0,0,,这确实很让人担忧，副部长女士
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:47.96,*CHS,257,0,0,0,,所以我相信魔法部一定会彻底调查
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.14,0:23:51.50,*CHS,258,0,0,0,,为什么那两只摄魂怪会在离阿兹卡班 那么远的地方出现
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.67,0:23:55.04,*CHS,259,0,0,0,,并且在未被授权的情况下进行攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.91,0:23:58.14,*CHS,260,0,0,0,,当然，有一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.48,0:24:01.08,*CHS,261,0,0,0,,极有可能是这件事的主谋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.09,0:24:08.72,*CHS,262,0,0,0,,康奈利，求求你看清是非黑白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.89,0:24:13.45,*CHS,263,0,0,0,,总总迹象表明，神秘人已经回来了 这是无法否认的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.63,0:24:16.39,*CHS,264,0,0,0,,他没有回来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.30,0:24:24.50,*CHS,265,0,0,0,,有关哈利·波特一事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.07,0:24:27.51,*CHS,266,0,0,0,,法律上明显指出
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:32.15,*CHS,267,0,0,0,,在生命受到威胁时 可以破例在麻瓜面前使用魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.31,0:24:35.22,*CHS,268,0,0,0,,有必要时法律是可以更改的 邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.38,0:24:38.55,*CHS,269,0,0,0,,这很显然，现在连未成年巫师 违例使用魔法这种小事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:41.59,*CHS,270,0,0,0,,也值得进行刑事审判了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:53.56,*CHS,271,0,0,0,,认为被告该受到处罚的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.38,0:25:07.32,*CHS,272,0,0,0,,认为该撤除一切控诉的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.43,0:25:23.69,*CHS,273,0,0,0,,撤除一切控诉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.74,0:25:28.46,*CHS,274,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.42,0:25:44.48,*CHS,275,0,0,0,,大脚板，你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.65,0:25:47.02,*CHS,276,0,0,0,,你会破坏整个行动的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.43,0:25:58.06,*CHS,277,0,0,0,,小天狼星，你为什么来这里？ 如果被人看到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.23,0:26:00.83,*CHS,278,0,0,0,,我得为你送行啊，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.64,0:26:05.13,*CHS,279,0,0,0,,而且，活着不冒点险怎么行？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:07.67,*CHS,280,0,0,0,,我不想看到你又被抓回阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:09.31,*CHS,281,0,0,0,,别担心我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.75,0:26:14.74,*CHS,282,0,0,0,,话说回来，我想给你这个
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:23.15,*CHS,283,0,0,0,,凤凰社的前任成员
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.69,0:26:25.42,*CHS,284,0,0,0,,马琳·麦金农
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.59,0:26:28.15,*CHS,285,0,0,0,,她在拍这张照片后的两个星期被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.53,0:26:31.69,*CHS,286,0,0,0,,伏地魔杀了她全家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.13,0:26:33.93,*CHS,287,0,0,0,,弗兰克和艾丽斯·隆巴顿
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.10,0:26:35.59,*CHS,288,0,0,0,,纳威的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.77,0:26:39.43,*CHS,289,0,0,0,,对我而言，他们的遭遇比死更惨
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.38,0:26:43.85,*CHS,290,0,0,0,,都已经十四年了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.68,0:26:48.88,*CHS,291,0,0,0,,但我还是每天想念着你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.56,0:26:56.22,*CHS,292,0,0,0,,你真的认为会有战争吗，小天狼星？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.89,0:27:01.92,*CHS,293,0,0,0,,这个感觉跟上次一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.17,0:27:07.97,*CHS,294,0,0,0,,留着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.44,0:27:12.84,*CHS,295,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 你现在是年轻的救世主了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.04,0:27:16.88,*CHS,296,0,0,0,,火车上见
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.05,0:27:19.07,*CHS,297,0,0,0,,再见，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.98,0:27:21.45,*CHS,298,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:24.21,*CHS,299,0,0,0,,牵住我的手，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.49,0:27:26.75,*CHS,300,0,0,0,,他们在那儿 他们在那边的车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.92,0:27:28.22,*CHS,301,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.43,0:28:13.37,*CHS,302,0,0,0,,真奇怪，魔法部竟然还让你 自由自在的到处跑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:15.00,*CHS,303,0,0,0,,趁现在好好享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.17,0:28:18.47,*CHS,304,0,0,0,,阿兹卡班那可是有个牢房在等着你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.08,0:28:25.04,*CHS,305,0,0,0,,- 我跟你说什么来着？十足的疯子 - 最好离我远点！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.25,0:28:28.08,*CHS,306,0,0,0,,只不过是马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.92,0:28:30.75,*CHS,307,0,0,0,,有什么好计较的？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.74,0:28:51.90,*CHS,308,0,0,0,,嗨，大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.07,0:28:53.74,*CHS,309,0,0,0,,- 嗨，纳威 - 嗨，纳威
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.79,0:29:08.31,*CHS,310,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.49,0:29:13.76,*CHS,311,0,0,0,,- 什么什么？ - 那个，在拉车的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:16.89,*CHS,312,0,0,0,,没有东西在拉车，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.53,0:29:19.76,*CHS,313,0,0,0,,它们一向都是自己动的 像以前一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.38,0:29:35.61,*CHS,314,0,0,0,,你没发疯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.19,0:29:40.42,*CHS,315,0,0,0,,我也看得到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.69,0:29:44.28,*CHS,316,0,0,0,,你跟我一样正常
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.10,0:29:51.16,*CHS,317,0,0,0,,各位，这是卢娜·洛夫...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.97,0:29:55.87,*CHS,318,0,0,0,,卢娜·洛夫古德
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:02.14,*CHS,319,0,0,0,,很有趣的项链
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.68,0:30:04.84,*CHS,320,0,0,0,,其实是个魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.22,0:30:07.81,*CHS,321,0,0,0,,用来避蝻钩的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.59,0:30:13.08,*CHS,322,0,0,0,,我饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:15.72,*CHS,323,0,0,0,,希望有布丁吃
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.73,0:30:20.32,*CHS,324,0,0,0,,- 蝻钩是什么？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.04,0:30:34.63,*CHS,325,0,0,0,,晚上好，孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.94,0:30:38.67,*CHS,326,0,0,0,,这个学年，教员安排上有两个变化
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.85,0:30:41.87,*CHS,327,0,0,0,,大家欢迎格拉普兰教授回来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.05,0:30:44.61,*CHS,328,0,0,0,,她将负责神奇生物的课程
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.79,0:30:48.24,*CHS,329,0,0,0,,而海格教授将和大家 短暂的分开一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.09,0:30:53.08,*CHS,330,0,0,0,,同时我们也要欢迎新的 黑魔法防御课老师
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.26,0:30:56.43,*CHS,331,0,0,0,,多洛雷斯·乌姆里奇教授
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.73,0:31:00.46,*CHS,332,0,0,0,,我相信大家都会和我一起祝愿她好运
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.27,0:31:06.26,*CHS,333,0,0,0,,和往常一样，我们的监管师费尔齐先生 交代我提醒你们...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.35,0:31:20.08,*CHS,334,0,0,0,,她也参加了我的听证会 她是给福吉干活的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.26,0:31:25.96,*CHS,335,0,0,0,,谢谢，校长 感谢你的欢迎致词
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.33,0:31:30.99,*CHS,336,0,0,0,,看着你们欢乐明朗的笑脸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.17,0:31:34.00,*CHS,337,0,0,0,,我感到无比幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.37,0:31:39.57,*CHS,338,0,0,0,,我敢肯定 我们将成为非常要好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.74,0:31:41.97,*CHS,339,0,0,0,,- 才怪 - 才怪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.81,0:31:47.78,*CHS,340,0,0,0,,魔法部向来...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.95,0:31:53.55,*CHS,341,0,0,0,,对年轻巫师的教育工作给予高度重视
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.92,0:31:56.19,*CHS,342,0,0,0,,虽然每一任校长
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:32:01.19,*CHS,343,0,0,0,,为了这所历史悠久的学校的发展 都注入新鲜血液
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.76,0:32:08.90,*CHS,344,0,0,0,,但是这种做法并不值得提倡
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.64,0:32:13.47,*CHS,345,0,0,0,,让我们继承那些该继承的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.64,0:32:17.13,*CHS,346,0,0,0,,完善那些需要完善的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.31,0:32:23.91,*CHS,347,0,0,0,,并剪除那些应该被禁止的实践
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.99,0:32:35.09,*CHS,348,0,0,0,,谢谢你，乌姆里奇教授 你的讲话为我们带来很大的启发
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.26,0:32:39.63,*CHS,349,0,0,0,,- 启发？简直废话连篇 - 什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.37,0:32:42.53,*CHS,350,0,0,0,,走廊里禁止使用魔法...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:46.27,*CHS,351,0,0,0,,意思是说，魔法部将开始干涉霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.06,0:33:07.79,*CHS,352,0,0,0,,迪安，西莫
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.10,0:33:10.22,*CHS,353,0,0,0,,- 假期过得好么？ - 还行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.60,0:33:12.83,*CHS,354,0,0,0,,应该会比西莫的强
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.14,0:33:16.47,*CHS,355,0,0,0,,我妈妈今年不想让我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.64,0:33:19.94,*CHS,356,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 让我想想，是因为你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.38,0:33:23.74,*CHS,357,0,0,0,, 《预言家日报》上写了很多 关于你和邓布利多的事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.91,0:33:25.24,*CHS,358,0,0,0,,什么，你妈妈相信《预言家日报》？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.41,0:33:27.31,*CHS,359,0,0,0,,塞德里克死掉的那晚，没有别人在场啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.48,0:33:30.58,*CHS,360,0,0,0,,那你不如学你的蠢妈妈那样 看《预言家日报》好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.75,0:33:34.24,*CHS,361,0,0,0,,- 别侮辱我妈妈 - 说我是骗子的人，我都会跟他过不去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.42,0:33:36.91,*CHS,362,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事？ - 他疯了，就这事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.09,0:33:40.19,*CHS,363,0,0,0,,你信不信他所谓的神秘人的鬼话？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:41.99,*CHS,364,0,0,0,,是的，我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.03,0:33:44.97,*CHS,365,0,0,0,,还有谁对哈利有怀疑？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.41,0:33:56.81,*CHS,366,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.98,0:33:59.78,*CHS,367,0,0,0,,西莫满嘴胡话，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.35,0:34:04.11,*CHS,368,0,0,0,,- 他会知道真相的，我们等着好了 - 我说了我没事，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:12.19,*CHS,369,0,0,0,,好吧，让你跟你的想法一起呆着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.66,0:34:41.64,*CHS,370,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.11,0:34:59.27,*CHS,371,0,0,0,,拿过来，这边
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:03.04,*CHS,372,0,0,0,,哦，继续，西莫，快点，搞定它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.69,0:35:20.09,*CHS,373,0,0,0,,早上好，孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.13,0:35:27.26,*CHS,374,0,0,0,,中级巫师资格考试
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.44,0:35:30.03,*CHS,375,0,0,0,,O- W- Ls
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.21,0:35:34.77,*CHS,376,0,0,0,,通常也被叫做“OWLs”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.94,0:35:38.07,*CHS,377,0,0,0,,好好学习，你们就会通过
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.41,0:35:43.68,*CHS,378,0,0,0,,反之，后果就会很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.26,0:35:54.32,*CHS,379,0,0,0,,这门课先前的教科书 编写的参差不齐，让人不安
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.50,0:35:56.62,*CHS,380,0,0,0,,让人欣慰的是，从现在开始你们将..
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:36:00.29,*CHS,381,0,0,0,,采用一套经过精心安排的...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.47,0:36:03.16,*CHS,382,0,0,0,,经由魔法部批准的防御魔法课程
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.51,0:36:07.10,*CHS,383,0,0,0,,是否包括使用防御符咒的内容呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.28,0:36:08.80,*CHS,384,0,0,0,,使用符咒？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.98,0:36:12.44,*CHS,385,0,0,0,,在我的教室里还需要用符咒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.15,0:36:15.74,*CHS,386,0,0,0,,连魔法都不会用到？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.92,0:36:20.91,*CHS,387,0,0,0,,你们会在一种安全的 零风险的情况下学习防御符咒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.09,0:36:23.85,*CHS,388,0,0,0,,如果我们受到袭击就不能叫做零风险 那这个还有什么用？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.03,0:36:26.96,*CHS,389,0,0,0,,在我的教室里，应该先举手再发言
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.60,0:36:33.00,*CHS,390,0,0,0,,魔法部认为
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.17,0:36:35.93,*CHS,391,0,0,0,,理论知识的掌握
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.10,0:36:38.07,*CHS,392,0,0,0,,就足以让你们顺利通过考试
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.24,0:36:40.67,*CHS,393,0,0,0,,而这，正是学校的意义所在
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.84,0:36:43.64,*CHS,394,0,0,0,,可是我们如何用“理论知识” 来武装自己去面对危险？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.81,0:36:45.84,*CHS,395,0,0,0,,根本不存在什么危险，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.01,0:36:49.04,*CHS,396,0,0,0,,你认为会有谁来袭击 像你一样的孩子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.22,0:36:52.48,*CHS,397,0,0,0,,哦，我不知道，或许是伏地魔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.16,0:37:07.66,*CHS,398,0,0,0,,让我把这个问题说白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.20,0:37:09.67,*CHS,399,0,0,0,,有人告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.84,0:37:15.21,*CHS,400,0,0,0,,曾经有某个强大的黑暗巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.38,0:37:20.51,*CHS,401,0,0,0,,- 这是一个谎言 - 不是谎言，我看到他了，还跟他对抗过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.68,0:37:22.31,*CHS,402,0,0,0,,课后留下来，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.48,0:37:24.65,*CHS,403,0,0,0,,照你所说 塞德里克自己就这么死了？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.82,0:37:27.25,*CHS,404,0,0,0,,塞德里克·迪戈里的死是个悲惨的意外
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.42,0:37:29.58,*CHS,405,0,0,0,,他是被杀的，是伏地魔杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.76,0:37:31.23,*CHS,406,0,0,0,,够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.89,0:37:33.59,*CHS,407,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.76,0:37:38.06,*CHS,408,0,0,0,,一会儿来见我，波特先生 到我的办公室来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.82,0:38:04.02,*CHS,409,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.26,0:38:11.20,*CHS,410,0,0,0,,晚上好，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.83,0:38:13.10,*CHS,411,0,0,0,,坐
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.81,0:38:24.71,*CHS,412,0,0,0,,我打算让你做一些抄写，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.88,0:38:26.74,*CHS,413,0,0,0,,不，不是用你的鹅毛笔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.98,0:38:30.18,*CHS,414,0,0,0,,而是用我这个特制的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.32,0:38:36.72,*CHS,415,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.69,0:38:43.56,*CHS,416,0,0,0,,我要你写: “我不可以说谎”
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.63,0:38:47.53,*CHS,417,0,0,0,,多少遍？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.97,0:38:52.63,*CHS,418,0,0,0,,嗯，一直写到你明白它的含义为止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.64,0:38:56.30,*CHS,419,0,0,0,,你没有给我墨水
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.48,0:38:57.97,*CHS,420,0,0,0,,哦，你不需要墨水
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.23,0:39:50.72,*CHS,421,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.04,0:40:01.44,*CHS,422,0,0,0,,- 没什么 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.34,0:40:06.30,*CHS,423,0,0,0,,因为你心里深知
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.48,0:40:08.54,*CHS,424,0,0,0,,你应当受到惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.72,0:40:11.88,*CHS,425,0,0,0,,不是吗，波特先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.12,0:40:17.72,*CHS,426,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.77,0:40:29.03,*CHS,427,0,0,0,,- 切片零食 - 包得病糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.20,0:40:30.83,*CHS,428,0,0,0,,帮你逃出教室，任何时候
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.01,0:40:34.77,*CHS,429,0,0,0,,想玩多久就玩多久，不会觉得无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.78,0:40:37.11,*CHS,430,0,0,0,,要不要再来一个？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.28,0:40:39.80,*CHS,431,0,0,0,,- 又没让你帮我写全部 - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.98,0:40:42.95,*CHS,432,0,0,0,,我忙着准备这个该死的“OWLs”考试
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.42,0:40:45.22,*CHS,433,0,0,0,,我写序论好了，就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.39,0:40:49.15,*CHS,434,0,0,0,,赫敏，你真是我见过的最让人赞叹的人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:53.56,*CHS,435,0,0,0,,- 如果我再对你无礼... - 那说明你恢复正常了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.60,0:41:00.69,*CHS,436,0,0,0,,你的手怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.24,0:41:02.70,*CHS,437,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.97,0:41:05.87,*CHS,438,0,0,0,,另一只手
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.38,0:41:10.21,*CHS,439,0,0,0,,- 你得告诉邓布利多 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.38,0:41:12.57,*CHS,440,0,0,0,,邓布利多自己就有够多烦心的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.75,0:41:14.87,*CHS,441,0,0,0,,更何况，我不想让乌姆里奇得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.05,0:41:17.48,*CHS,442,0,0,0,,天哪，那个女人是在折磨你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.65,0:41:21.59,*CHS,443,0,0,0,,- 要是你的父母知道的话... - 我没有父母，不是吗，罗恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.39,0:41:26.86,*CHS,444,0,0,0,,哈利，你得把这个事情上报
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.03,0:41:30.56,*CHS,445,0,0,0,,- 这不是明摆着吗，你被... - 不，不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.73,0:41:33.57,*CHS,446,0,0,0,,赫敏，不论是什么，都不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.60,0:41:36.63,*CHS,447,0,0,0,,你们不会明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.24,0:41:41.17,*CHS,448,0,0,0,,那就让我们明白
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.89,0:41:57.76,*CHS,449,0,0,0,,亲爱的大脚板
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.29,0:42:00.02,*CHS,450,0,0,0,,希望你一切安好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:04.79,*CHS,451,0,0,0,,这里已经开始变冷 冬天就要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.44,0:42:12.17,*CHS,452,0,0,0,,虽然已经回到霍格沃茨 我却感到前所未有的孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.04,0:42:16.34,*CHS,453,0,0,0,,我知道只有你会了解这种心情
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.33,0:42:52.52,*CHS,454,0,0,0,,你好，哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.16,0:42:59.79,*CHS,455,0,0,0,,- 你的脚，不觉得冻吗？ - 有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.70,0:43:04.73,*CHS,456,0,0,0,,很不幸，我的鞋子都神秘失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.31,0:43:08.37,*CHS,457,0,0,0,,我怀疑是蝻钩干的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.72,0:43:18.35,*CHS,458,0,0,0,,- 他们是什么？ - 他们被叫做夜骐
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.02,0:43:24.08,*CHS,459,0,0,0,,其实他们很善良的，可是人们都避开它们 只是因为它们有些...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.03,0:43:28.66,*CHS,460,0,0,0,,不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.77,0:43:34.13,*CHS,461,0,0,0,,可是为什么别人看不到它们？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.30,0:43:37.83,*CHS,462,0,0,0,,只有见过死亡的人才会看到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.94,0:43:42.57,*CHS,463,0,0,0,,那么，你认识的人里面有人死了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.74,0:43:44.37,*CHS,464,0,0,0,,我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.91,0:43:49.82,*CHS,465,0,0,0,,她是个非凡的女巫 但是她很喜欢试验
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.98,0:43:53.28,*CHS,466,0,0,0,,有一天，她的符咒出了大差错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.45,0:43:55.85,*CHS,467,0,0,0,,- 我那时9岁 - 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.42,0:43:58.62,*CHS,468,0,0,0,,是的，的确很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.79,0:44:04.13,*CHS,469,0,0,0,,有时候我感到悲伤 不过我还有爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.37,0:44:09.00,*CHS,470,0,0,0,,其实我们都相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.07,0:44:15.07,*CHS,471,0,0,0,,那个连名字都不能提的人又回来了 而你跟他争斗过
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.24,0:44:18.34,*CHS,472,0,0,0,,魔法部和《日报》 就合谋陷害你和邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.51,0:44:22.88,*CHS,473,0,0,0,,谢谢，我想你是唯一一个相信我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.05,0:44:24.38,*CHS,474,0,0,0,,我不这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.75,0:44:29.88,*CHS,475,0,0,0,,但是我猜那正是他想要的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.06,0:44:31.82,*CHS,476,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.46,0:44:34.33,*CHS,477,0,0,0,,嗯，如果我是神秘人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.80,0:44:38.36,*CHS,478,0,0,0,,我也会让你觉得被所有人孤立
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.53,0:44:41.26,*CHS,479,0,0,0,,因为如果只有你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.10,0:44:44.44,*CHS,480,0,0,0,,就构不成什么威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.09,0:45:06.82,*CHS,481,0,0,0,,- 你就没有不吃的时候？ - 什么？我很饿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.20,0:45:11.26,*CHS,482,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.10,0:45:14.33,*CHS,483,0,0,0,,我可以坐下来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.24,0:45:19.37,*CHS,484,0,0,0,,对不起，教授 你到底想要试探什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.54,0:45:22.30,*CHS,485,0,0,0,,我只是希望你在对待学生的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.48,0:45:26.74,*CHS,486,0,0,0,,遵照学校现有的规定
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.91,0:45:28.58,*CHS,487,0,0,0,,恕我愚钝
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.75,0:45:32.88,*CHS,488,0,0,0,,不过听起来似乎你正在置疑 我在我自己的课堂所行使的权利
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.05,0:45:34.39,*CHS,489,0,0,0,,米勒娃
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.56,0:45:39.02,*CHS,490,0,0,0,,完全不是，多洛雷斯 只不过是你古旧的教学方法
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.29,0:45:41.76,*CHS,491,0,0,0,,很抱歉，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.93,0:45:45.26,*CHS,492,0,0,0,,置疑我的教学方法等同于置疑魔法部
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:48.56,*CHS,493,0,0,0,,甚至是置疑部长他本人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.74,0:45:50.33,*CHS,494,0,0,0,,我是一个宽容的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.51,0:45:55.57,*CHS,495,0,0,0,,可是有一样事情是我所无法容忍的 就是不忠不信
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.35,0:45:59.11,*CHS,496,0,0,0,,不忠不信
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.85,0:46:04.81,*CHS,497,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨存在的问题 比我预先所担心的要严重的多
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.99,0:46:08.44,*CHS,498,0,0,0,,康奈利将会立即采取行动
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.99,0:46:17.44,*CHS,499,0,0,0,,(多洛雷斯·乌姆里奇已被任命为 霍格沃茨最高监察官)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.87,0:46:21.77,*CHS,500,0,0,0,,邓布利多怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.94,0:46:24.50,*CHS,501,0,0,0,,黑魔法防御课的教学
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.67,0:46:27.33,*CHS,502,0,0,0,,进行了革命性的变革
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.01,0:46:32.47,*CHS,503,0,0,0,,多洛雷斯·乌姆里奇将代表最高权利
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.98,0:46:39.15,*CHS,504,0,0,0,,来治理日益衰退的霍格沃茨学校
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.93,0:46:49.09,*CHS,505,0,0,0,,我只想问一个问题，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.26,0:46:53.46,*CHS,506,0,0,0,,你在这个职位上到底多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.27,0:47:05.37,*CHS,507,0,0,0,,你最先申请的是 黑魔法防御课教师一职？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.55,0:47:07.54,*CHS,508,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.95,0:47:10.58,*CHS,509,0,0,0,,不过失败了？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.79,0:47:14.22,*CHS,510,0,0,0,,显然
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.99,0:47:39.72,*CHS,511,0,0,0,,(学习期间不准放音乐  所有韦斯莱产品立即禁止使用  要时刻保持衣冠得体和礼貌的举止)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.55,0:47:49.99,*CHS,512,0,0,0,,你为我预言一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.73,0:47:52.92,*CHS,513,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.17,0:48:00.36,*CHS,514,0,0,0,,嘴张大些
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.51,0:48:09.60,*CHS,515,0,0,0,,哪怕是一丁点的预言？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.48,0:48:16.92,*CHS,516,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.49,0:48:19.89,*CHS,517,0,0,0,,不，不，等等 我想我的确看到了一些...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.05,0:48:22.25,*CHS,518,0,0,0,,对，是黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.52,0:48:27.05,*CHS,519,0,0,0,,你正在受到死亡的威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.53,0:48:30.26,*CHS,520,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.44,0:48:42.60,*CHS,521,0,0,0,,秋，发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.78,0:48:45.11,*CHS,522,0,0,0,,是特里劳妮教授
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.94,0:49:18.43,*CHS,523,0,0,0,,我在这里教了16年
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.61,0:49:21.55,*CHS,524,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨就是我的家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.45,0:49:25.35,*CHS,525,0,0,0,,你不能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.79,0:49:29.05,*CHS,526,0,0,0,,实际上，我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.93,0:49:39.30,*CHS,527,0,0,0,,你有话想说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.47,0:49:42.13,*CHS,528,0,0,0,,哦，有些事情我要说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.70,0:49:44.26,*CHS,529,0,0,0,,有些...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.19,0:50:02.85,*CHS,530,0,0,0,,麦格教授 能请你将特里劳妮教授护送进去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.16,0:50:06.63,*CHS,531,0,0,0,,亲爱的西比尔，这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.79,0:50:08.28,*CHS,532,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.46,0:50:13.49,*CHS,533,0,0,0,,邓布利多，我想提醒你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.67,0:50:16.93,*CHS,534,0,0,0,,按照魔法部长执行的教育法令第二十三条
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.10,0:50:20.27,*CHS,535,0,0,0,,你有权开除我的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.44,0:50:24.00,*CHS,536,0,0,0,,但是你无权驱逐他们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.18,0:50:27.20,*CHS,537,0,0,0,,这个权力是属于校长的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.22,0:50:30.48,*CHS,538,0,0,0,,目前为止
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.92,0:50:38.92,*CHS,539,0,0,0,,你们没功课做了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.09,0:50:40.25,*CHS,540,0,0,0,,教授
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:43.19,*CHS,541,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.66,0:50:46.46,*CHS,542,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授，教授！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.63,0:50:48.76,*CHS,543,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.45,0:51:01.54,*CHS,544,0,0,0,,污秽邪恶的老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.08,0:51:07.11,*CHS,545,0,0,0,,我们根本不在学习如何保护自己 也不是学习如何通过“OWLS”考试
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.49,0:51:09.51,*CHS,546,0,0,0,,现在整个学校都在她手上了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.69,0:51:14.35,*CHS,547,0,0,0,,安全问题现在是魔法部的首要任务
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.53,0:51:17.36,*CHS,548,0,0,0,,此外 我们已经掌握到有力证据
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.53,0:51:20.40,*CHS,549,0,0,0,,这些失踪事件是由臭名昭著的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.57,0:51:23.97,*CHS,550,0,0,0,,杀人惯犯小天狼星·布莱克所作
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.71,0:51:26.26,*CHS,551,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.51,0:51:28.20,*CHS,552,0,0,0,,小天狼星
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.94,0:51:31.64,*CHS,553,0,0,0,,- 你在这儿干嘛？ - 回复你的信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.81,0:51:34.71,*CHS,554,0,0,0,,你说你很担心乌姆里奇 她在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.88,0:51:36.82,*CHS,555,0,0,0,,训练你猎杀杂种？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.98,0:51:39.95,*CHS,556,0,0,0,,- 她不让我们学习任何魔法 - 我一点也不感到惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.32,0:51:44.38,*CHS,557,0,0,0,,最新的情报是 福吉不想让你们接受战斗训练
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.56,0:51:45.55,*CHS,558,0,0,0,,战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.06,0:51:48.96,*CHS,559,0,0,0,,他什么意思？ 以为我们在建立“巫师军团”？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.13,0:51:50.53,*CHS,560,0,0,0,,这正是他的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.70,0:51:54.63,*CHS,561,0,0,0,,邓布利多正私下建立军团，以对抗魔法部
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.17,0:51:58.47,*CHS,562,0,0,0,,他的妄想症越发严重了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.84,0:52:02.30,*CHS,563,0,0,0,,其他人不会告诉你这个，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.84,0:52:05.68,*CHS,564,0,0,0,,但是凤凰社里的事情不太妙
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.85,0:52:08.47,*CHS,565,0,0,0,,福吉正在封锁消息
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.65,0:52:12.64,*CHS,566,0,0,0,,之前的每次 也都是从失踪事件开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.45,0:52:16.79,*CHS,567,0,0,0,,伏地魔已经开始行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.19,0:52:18.59,*CHS,568,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.19,0:52:20.63,*CHS,569,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.80,0:52:22.99,*CHS,570,0,0,0,,很抱歉我帮不了你太多
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.16,0:52:28.16,*CHS,571,0,0,0,,不过至少 现在看来你得孤军奋战了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.71,0:52:42.05,*CHS,572,0,0,0,,他就在外面，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.88,0:52:46.55,*CHS,573,0,0,0,,我们一定要学会保护自己
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.12,0:52:50.89,*CHS,574,0,0,0,,如果乌姆里奇不肯教我们 我们就得找个愿意教的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:10.07,*CHS,575,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.65,0:53:22.02,*CHS,576,0,0,0,,这简直是发疯，谁会让我教啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.19,0:53:23.42,*CHS,577,0,0,0,,我是个疯子，记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.59,0:53:28.09,*CHS,578,0,0,0,,乐观点，你总不至于比那老巫婆还差劲
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.33,0:53:31.79,*CHS,579,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你，罗恩 - 我会坚决支持你，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.30,0:53:34.63,*CHS,580,0,0,0,,都有谁来？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.80,0:53:36.93,*CHS,581,0,0,0,,只有几个人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.94,0:53:43.38,*CHS,582,0,0,0,,这地方不错
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.08,0:53:49.21,*CHS,583,0,0,0,,总比暴露行踪安全些
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.38,0:53:51.54,*CHS,584,0,0,0,,美蒂，回来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.99,0:54:01.15,*CHS,585,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.56,0:54:04.46,*CHS,586,0,0,0,,你们都知道我们为什么在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.63,0:54:05.86,*CHS,587,0,0,0,,我们需要一个老师
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.57,0:54:09.73,*CHS,588,0,0,0,,一个真正意义上的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.04,0:54:13.20,*CHS,589,0,0,0,,这个人需要具有对抗黑魔法的经验
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.37,0:54:15.14,*CHS,590,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.31,0:54:17.37,*CHS,591,0,0,0,,因为神秘人又回来了，你个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.55,0:54:19.10,*CHS,592,0,0,0,,- 因为他这么说 - 邓布利多也这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.28,0:54:21.41,*CHS,593,0,0,0,,邓布利多这么说是因为他这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.58,0:54:23.98,*CHS,594,0,0,0,,问题是，证据在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.35,0:54:28.38,*CHS,595,0,0,0,,哈利可以告诉我们 究竟迪戈里是怎么死的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.49,0:54:35.26,*CHS,596,0,0,0,,我不想再多谈塞德里克 如果你们是为了这个而来，请出去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.43,0:54:38.87,*CHS,597,0,0,0,,我们走吧，赫敏 他们来这儿是因为觉得我是个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.03,0:54:41.66,*CHS,598,0,0,0,,你真的会守护神魔咒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.97,0:54:46.41,*CHS,599,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.88,0:54:49.31,*CHS,600,0,0,0,,我见过
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.48,0:54:51.60,*CHS,601,0,0,0,,天哪，哈利 我不知道你会这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.28,0:54:56.41,*CHS,602,0,0,0,,他还在邓布利多的办公室里 用剑杀死了蛇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.58,0:54:57.81,*CHS,603,0,0,0,,这是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.99,0:55:00.75,*CHS,604,0,0,0,,三年级时，他独自跟几百个摄魂怪斗过
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.06,0:55:04.85,*CHS,605,0,0,0,,去年，他的确在电光石火之间 跟神秘人交战过
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.03,0:55:06.32,*CHS,606,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.03,0:55:11.56,*CHS,607,0,0,0,,你们这样说听起来真的很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.73,0:55:15.29,*CHS,608,0,0,0,,可事实是，多数情况我都是靠运气而已
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.57,0:55:19.30,*CHS,609,0,0,0,,半数时候我都手足无措 而且总有贵人相助
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.47,0:55:22.97,*CHS,610,0,0,0,,- 他是自谦 - 不，赫敏，我不是自谦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.55,0:55:30.21,*CHS,611,0,0,0,,在现实生活中面对这些鬼怪 跟在学校里学习完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.25,0:55:34.69,*CHS,612,0,0,0,,在学校，如果你做错了 你可以明天重来一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.86,0:55:36.35,*CHS,613,0,0,0,,可是现实中
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.96,0:55:40.26,*CHS,614,0,0,0,,当死亡近在咫尺的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.43,0:55:44.12,*CHS,615,0,0,0,,或者眼睁睁的看着你朋友被杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.90,0:55:48.70,*CHS,616,0,0,0,,你们不了解那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.48,0:56:00.38,*CHS,617,0,0,0,,你说得对，哈利，我们不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.15,0:56:03.24,*CHS,618,0,0,0,,所以我们需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.42,0:56:06.32,*CHS,619,0,0,0,,因为也许总有一天 我们得面对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.52,0:56:09.68,*CHS,620,0,0,0,,伏地魔
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.13,0:56:14.86,*CHS,621,0,0,0,,他真的回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.18,0:56:38.97,*CHS,622,0,0,0,,对，首先我们得找个乌姆里奇
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.02,0:56:40.42,*CHS,623,0,0,0,,找不到的地方练习魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.59,0:56:42.75,*CHS,624,0,0,0,,- 尖叫棚屋 - 那里太小
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.92,0:56:45.89,*CHS,625,0,0,0,,- 禁林呢？ - 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.06,0:56:48.15,*CHS,626,0,0,0,,哈利，如果乌姆里奇发现了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.33,0:56:49.49,*CHS,627,0,0,0,,管她呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:54.97,*CHS,628,0,0,0,,我是说，这个很刺激，违反校规
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.14,0:56:57.40,*CHS,629,0,0,0,,你是谁？你把赫敏怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.11,0:57:01.77,*CHS,630,0,0,0,,无论如何，今天有件好事值得一提
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.94,0:57:03.24,*CHS,631,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.98,0:57:07.64,*CHS,632,0,0,0,,秋的视线一直跟着你转，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.38,0:57:13.44,*CHS,633,0,0,0,,好吧，接下来的几天
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.62,0:57:16.45,*CHS,634,0,0,0,,我们分头找可以用来练习的场地
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.62,0:57:20.46,*CHS,635,0,0,0,,最重要的是确保她找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.63,0:57:22.46,*CHS,636,0,0,0,,会找到的，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.21,0:57:35.34,*CHS,637,0,0,0,,所有学生组织立即解散
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.51,0:57:39.10,*CHS,638,0,0,0,,违令者，开除
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.31,0:57:41.78,*CHS,639,0,0,0,,哪里去，隆巴顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.48,0:58:21.75,*CHS,640,0,0,0,,你成功了，纳威 你找到了“有求必应屋”
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.92,0:58:23.05,*CHS,641,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.22,0:58:25.62,*CHS,642,0,0,0,,这房间时有时无
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.79,0:58:29.23,*CHS,643,0,0,0,,但只出现在真正有需要的人面前
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.40,0:58:32.06,*CHS,644,0,0,0,,而且根据需要准备齐全
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.23,0:58:35.96,*CHS,645,0,0,0,,比方说我需要厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.14,0:58:41.97,*CHS,646,0,0,0,,可爱的罗恩 不错，基本就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.14,0:58:47.01,*CHS,647,0,0,0,,绝好的主意 就好像霍格沃茨要我们反击
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.06,0:58:59.55,*CHS,648,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.70,0:59:06.10,*CHS,649,0,0,0,,我没指望了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.27,0:59:10.03,*CHS,650,0,0,0,,你只是甩棒太狠，这样试试 除你武器
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.41,0:59:17.43,*CHS,651,0,0,0,,你们要抄写核准的课文四遍
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.61,0:59:20.60,*CHS,652,0,0,0,,以确保注意力集中
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.98,0:59:24.68,*CHS,653,0,0,0,,- 你们不必讲话 - 其实是不必思考吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.85,0:59:26.88,*CHS,654,0,0,0,,- 除你武器 - 放下魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.83,0:59:42.89,*CHS,655,0,0,0,,昏倒术是你武器库里最有用的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.07,0:59:45.30,*CHS,656,0,0,0,,是魔法师们最常用的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.47,0:59:49.03,*CHS,657,0,0,0,,来吧，奈吉尔，尽你全力试试
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.55,0:59:56.95,*CHS,658,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.86,1:00:06.29,*CHS,659,0,0,0,,很好，不错 奈吉尔，做得好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.67,1:00:13.76,*CHS,660,0,0,0,,别担心，我们放点水
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.13,1:00:16.13,*CHS,661,0,0,0,,谢谢，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.81,1:00:21.00,*CHS,662,0,0,0,,- 加油，罗恩 - 加油，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.18,1:00:24.04,*CHS,663,0,0,0,,- 你能做到 - 加油，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.58,1:00:26.60,*CHS,664,0,0,0,,- 一颗包得病糖果 - 跟你赌了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.65,1:00:35.02,*CHS,665,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.69,1:00:42.66,*CHS,666,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.06,1:00:47.66,*CHS,667,0,0,0,,是我让她的，要有礼貌，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.90,1:00:52.43,*CHS,668,0,0,0,,完全是有意的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.70,1:01:16.83,*CHS,669,0,0,0,,(第82条学规: 全体学生必须 接受非法行为嫌疑的讯问)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.07,1:01:21.00,*CHS,670,0,0,0,,你上来 想来杯茶吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.30,1:01:27.26,*CHS,671,0,0,0,,现在注意力集中一点 再试一次
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.84,1:01:29.81,*CHS,672,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.38,1:01:33.94,*CHS,673,0,0,0,,很好，保持注意力
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.05,1:01:37.54,*CHS,674,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.82,1:01:40.41,*CHS,675,0,0,0,,再高一点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.90,1:01:51.73,*CHS,676,0,0,0,,我还好，我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.75,1:02:12.38,*CHS,677,0,0,0,,- 昏昏倒地 - 昏昏倒地
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.95,1:02:17.32,*CHS,678,0,0,0,,有志于进入审判班学习的 作为额外奖励
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.49,1:02:20.36,*CHS,679,0,0,0,,可以与高级检查官办公室签约
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.53,1:02:22.15,*CHS,680,0,0,0,,缩小咒
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.07,1:02:32.37,*CHS,681,0,0,0,,努力学习很重要 有些事情更重要
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.54,1:02:34.73,*CHS,682,0,0,0,,那就是: 相信你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.91,1:02:37.04,*CHS,683,0,0,0,,- 除你武器 - 倒挂金钟，成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.21,1:02:38.77,*CHS,684,0,0,0,,相信你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.95,1:02:42.94,*CHS,685,0,0,0,,所有历史上伟大的魔法师
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.28,1:02:47.19,*CHS,686,0,0,0,,起步时并不比我们强，都是学生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.35,1:02:50.29,*CHS,687,0,0,0,,如果他们能做到，为什么我们不能？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.43,1:03:02.23,*CHS,688,0,0,0,,- 昏昏倒地 - 除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.40,1:03:05.77,*CHS,689,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.48,1:03:09.97,*CHS,690,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.52,1:03:16.81,*CHS,691,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.33,1:03:33.32,*CHS,692,0,0,0,,- 除你武器 - 除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.50,1:03:35.87,*CHS,693,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.77,1:03:41.83,*CHS,694,0,0,0,,除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.68,1:03:49.08,*CHS,695,0,0,0,,完美，纳威 做得好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.72,1:03:52.84,*CHS,696,0,0,0,,课程要告一段落了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.02,1:03:56.42,*CHS,697,0,0,0,,我们假期后再见
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.82,1:03:59.85,*CHS,698,0,0,0,,所以尽你们所能练习
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.03,1:04:03.39,*CHS,699,0,0,0,,大家做得非常好 出色，非常非常出色
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.20,1:04:09.63,*CHS,700,0,0,0,,做得好，伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.80,1:04:11.24,*CHS,701,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.91,1:04:19.28,*CHS,702,0,0,0,,圣诞节后见
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.72,1:04:30.78,*CHS,703,0,0,0,,大厅见，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.19,1:04:34.89,*CHS,704,0,0,0,,- 多谢了，哈利 - 别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.66,1:04:39.03,*CHS,705,0,0,0,,- 太感谢了 - 不客气，圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.50,1:04:41.87,*CHS,706,0,0,0,,- 谢谢，哈利 - 谢谢，圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.04,1:04:43.90,*CHS,707,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐 - 圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.07,1:04:46.66,*CHS,708,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐，露娜 - 我们在想
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.84,1:04:49.24,*CHS,709,0,0,0,,我们可以给乌姆里奇的 点心里来点呕吐片
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.41,1:04:52.07,*CHS,710,0,0,0,,或者是发烧的福吉 他们让你受那么多苦...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.25,1:04:54.77,*CHS,711,0,0,0,,听来不错，伙计们 能借过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.73,1:05:10.46,*CHS,712,0,0,0,,你还好吗？ 我听说乌姆里奇对你很严苛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.63,1:05:13.00,*CHS,713,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.70,1:05:16.50,*CHS,714,0,0,0,,不管怎样，值得
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.84,1:05:25.01,*CHS,715,0,0,0,,只是，只是学着这些
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.81,1:05:29.25,*CHS,716,0,0,0,,让我想起，不知道他是否知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:32.15,*CHS,717,0,0,0,,塞德里克，塞德里克知道这些的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.72,1:05:35.12,*CHS,718,0,0,0,,他非常厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.76,1:05:38.49,*CHS,719,0,0,0,,只是伏地魔更厉害一点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.03,1:05:44.83,*CHS,720,0,0,0,,你真是个好老师，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.10,1:05:49.00,*CHS,721,0,0,0,,我以前从来没有 击倒过任何东西
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.14,1:05:59.81,*CHS,722,0,0,0,,槲寄生（情人草）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.32,1:06:05.25,*CHS,723,0,0,0,,这可能也是蝻钩干的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.32,1:06:08.01,*CHS,724,0,0,0,,蝻钩是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.72,1:06:10.45,*CHS,725,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.48,1:06:34.67,*CHS,726,0,0,0,,感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.45,1:06:37.21,*CHS,727,0,0,0,,湿乎乎
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.62,1:06:39.38,*CHS,728,0,0,0,,我的意思是她好像在哭
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.75,1:06:41.72,*CHS,729,0,0,0,,你水平不是那么差吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.89,1:06:44.62,*CHS,730,0,0,0,,哈利的吻肯定是很令人满意的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.46,1:06:49.62,*CHS,731,0,0,0,,只不过是因为她这些日子经常哭
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.80,1:06:52.06,*CHS,732,0,0,0,,亲亲她能让她高兴起来？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.53,1:06:56.40,*CHS,733,0,0,0,,你得明白她心里的感受
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.81,1:07:04.27,*CHS,734,0,0,0,,显然，她为塞德里克难过
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.44,1:07:07.50,*CHS,735,0,0,0,,迷茫于对哈利的爱 又因为吻了哈利而内疚
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.68,1:07:10.91,*CHS,736,0,0,0,,两种想法并存而矛盾冲突 害怕别人对她的看法
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.08,1:07:14.82,*CHS,737,0,0,0,,她又因为自己心事太多 害怕自己的OWLS考试可能会通不过
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.76,1:07:20.32,*CHS,738,0,0,0,,一个人有那么多感情会爆炸的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.49,1:07:23.72,*CHS,739,0,0,0,,就因为你的情感 能力跟茶勺差不多？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.58,1:07:41.20,*CHS,740,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.99,1:07:53.05,*CHS,741,0,0,0,,伏地魔可能在搜寻什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.73,1:07:56.72,*CHS,742,0,0,0,,他上次没有拿到的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.56,1:07:58.82,*CHS,743,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.47,1:08:01.73,*CHS,744,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.83,1:08:36.23,*CHS,745,0,0,0,,在梦里，你是否站在受害者身边？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.40,1:08:37.89,*CHS,746,0,0,0,,还是俯视着现场？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.37,1:08:41.34,*CHS,747,0,0,0,,都不是…就好象是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.91,1:08:44.00,*CHS,748,0,0,0,,教授，请告诉我是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.18,1:08:46.51,*CHS,749,0,0,0,,埃弗拉，阿瑟今晚当班
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.68,1:08:49.08,*CHS,750,0,0,0,,快去找人救他
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.25,1:08:50.81,*CHS,751,0,0,0,,- 先生！ - 菲尼亚斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.98,1:08:53.28,*CHS,752,0,0,0,,你要去格里莫广场的画像
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.45,1:08:56.08,*CHS,753,0,0,0,,告诉他们阿瑟·韦斯莱严重受伤
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.25,1:09:00.42,*CHS,754,0,0,0,,孩子们很快会通过门钥匙过去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.59,1:09:03.65,*CHS,755,0,0,0,,他们找到了他 他差一点就完了，不过会好起来的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.83,1:09:06.35,*CHS,756,0,0,0,,还有，黑魔头没拿到东西
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.53,1:09:08.43,*CHS,757,0,0,0,,哦，太好了，下面我们要…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.60,1:09:09.79,*CHS,758,0,0,0,,看着我！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.31,1:09:18.54,*CHS,759,0,0,0,,我是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.42,1:09:28.28,*CHS,760,0,0,0,,你要见我，校长大人？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.45,1:09:33.36,*CHS,761,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯，恐怕我们不能等了 连天亮不能等
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.76,1:09:36.66,*CHS,762,0,0,0,,否则我们就危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.43,1:09:43.03,*CHS,763,0,0,0,,看来黑魔头的意识
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.20,1:09:45.53,*CHS,764,0,0,0,,跟你的是连在一起的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.70,1:09:49.87,*CHS,765,0,0,0,,不过他是否了解这种联系 还是未定之数
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.24,1:09:53.27,*CHS,766,0,0,0,,希望他还没有发觉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.45,1:09:56.71,*CHS,767,0,0,0,,你是说，如果他知道的话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.18,1:10:01.59,*CHS,768,0,0,0,,- 他可以读取我的心灵？ - 读取、控制
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.75,1:10:03.62,*CHS,769,0,0,0,,误导
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.79,1:10:07.16,*CHS,770,0,0,0,,黑魔头过去很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.33,1:10:09.56,*CHS,771,0,0,0,,侵入受害者的心灵
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.73,1:10:13.32,*CHS,772,0,0,0,,炮制幻觉来折磨他们 把他们逼疯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.47,1:10:19.27,*CHS,773,0,0,0,,直到榨干他们最后一丝痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.44,1:10:23.70,*CHS,774,0,0,0,,让他们苦求一死
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.88,1:10:25.10,*CHS,775,0,0,0,,然后才杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.08,1:10:28.51,*CHS,776,0,0,0,,如果使用得当，锁心术
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.68,1:10:32.17,*CHS,777,0,0,0,,可令你的心不受窥探或操控
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.35,1:10:37.12,*CHS,778,0,0,0,,在课程里 我将要试图渗透你的心灵
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.69,1:10:40.78,*CHS,779,0,0,0,,你要尝试抵抗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.06,1:10:42.53,*CHS,780,0,0,0,,准备好！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.26,1:10:46.49,*CHS,781,0,0,0,,摄神取念！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.61,1:10:58.20,*CHS,782,0,0,0,,集中精力，波特，集中精力
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.10,1:11:25.73,*CHS,783,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.94,1:11:29.60,*CHS,784,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.77,1:11:31.94,*CHS,785,0,0,0,,爸爸回家了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.11,1:11:38.74,*CHS,786,0,0,0,,坐下，大家坐下 现在发礼物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.92,1:11:43.29,*CHS,787,0,0,0,,- 给罗恩的礼物 - 给你一个大家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.09,1:11:48.29,*CHS,788,0,0,0,,哦，拿着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.46,1:11:50.76,*CHS,789,0,0,0,,- 打开吧，我要看看你们的表情 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.93,1:11:53.33,*CHS,790,0,0,0,,- 穿上试试 - 谢谢妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.50,1:11:57.80,*CHS,791,0,0,0,,- 哦！完美！就是他想要的 - 呵呵，是的，谢谢妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.97,1:12:00.84,*CHS,792,0,0,0,,大家过来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.01,1:12:03.03,*CHS,793,0,0,0,,哦，哈利，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.21,1:12:05.11,*CHS,794,0,0,0,,你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.11,1:12:07.94,*CHS,795,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.51,1:12:10.38,*CHS,796,0,0,0,,- 欢迎加入我们 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.55,1:12:12.52,*CHS,797,0,0,0,,给爸爸的，传给爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.68,1:12:14.41,*CHS,798,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 大家都拿到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.59,1:12:15.95,*CHS,799,0,0,0,,弗雷德？乔治？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.12,1:12:18.65,*CHS,800,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 为圣诞干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.82,1:12:20.69,*CHS,801,0,0,0,,致哈利·波特先生
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.73,1:12:24.56,*CHS,802,0,0,0,,没有他，我今天也不能在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.13,1:12:30.46,*CHS,803,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.64,1:12:31.86,*CHS,804,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.87,1:12:35.46,*CHS,805,0,0,0,,噢，那个很好吃 给我再来点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.64,1:12:38.01,*CHS,806,0,0,0,,爸爸，少吃点 别像上个圣诞节那样
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.94,1:12:41.67,*CHS,807,0,0,0,,我不明白你为什么不愿穿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.15,1:12:44.98,*CHS,808,0,0,0,,我穿了会像个傻子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.15,1:12:46.98,*CHS,809,0,0,0,,不会的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.19,1:12:49.02,*CHS,810,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.03,1:12:59.62,*CHS,811,0,0,0,,肮脏的英国人厚颜地站在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.80,1:13:04.53,*CHS,812,0,0,0,,哈利·波特 阻止了黑魔头的男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.70,1:13:07.69,*CHS,813,0,0,0,,泥巴种跟叛种者的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.14,1:13:10.73,*CHS,814,0,0,0,,- 如果我可怜的小姐… - 克利切！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.91,1:13:13.74,*CHS,815,0,0,0,,你说的够多了 走开！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.91,1:13:15.90,*CHS,816,0,0,0,,当然，主人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.08,1:13:20.78,*CHS,817,0,0,0,,精灵活着就是为布莱克家族服务的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.09,1:13:24.99,*CHS,818,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.56,1:13:29.22,*CHS,819,0,0,0,,他从来就不让人舒服 我小时就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.56,1:13:31.65,*CHS,820,0,0,0,,至少不会让我舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.50,1:13:34.43,*CHS,821,0,0,0,,怎么，你，你在这里长大
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.60,1:13:36.86,*CHS,822,0,0,0,,这是我父母的房子
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.20,1:13:41.04,*CHS,823,0,0,0,,我把它捐给邓布利多 作为凤凰社的总部
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.17,1:13:45.44,*CHS,824,0,0,0,,我只能做到这样了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.84,1:13:49.21,*CHS,825,0,0,0,,这是布莱克家族的家谱
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.11,1:13:52.24,*CHS,826,0,0,0,,我精神错乱的堂姐（贝拉特克里斯）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.42,1:13:55.15,*CHS,827,0,0,0,,我恨他们很多人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.32,1:14:00.02,*CHS,828,0,0,0,,我的父母对血统的纯正性很狂热
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.23,1:14:07.03,*CHS,829,0,0,0,,我出走以后我妈妈干的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.37,1:14:11.23,*CHS,830,0,0,0,,厉害的女人吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.50,1:14:14.13,*CHS,831,0,0,0,,我那时16岁
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.97,1:14:16.41,*CHS,832,0,0,0,,你去了哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.48,1:14:19.74,*CHS,833,0,0,0,,去你父亲那里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.25,1:14:23.77,*CHS,834,0,0,0,,我总是在跟波特家的人工作
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.68,1:14:27.41,*CHS,835,0,0,0,,我经常在你身上看到你父亲的影子，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.05,1:14:30.25,*CHS,836,0,0,0,,你跟你父亲非常像
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.19,1:14:33.16,*CHS,837,0,0,0,,我不敢确定
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.23,1:14:35.66,*CHS,838,0,0,0,,小天狼星，当我…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.50,1:14:43.02,*CHS,839,0,0,0,,当我看到韦斯莱先生遇袭时 我不只是看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.17,1:14:45.69,*CHS,840,0,0,0,,我就是那条蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.54,1:14:49.47,*CHS,841,0,0,0,,后来在邓布利多的办公室
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.64,1:14:53.84,*CHS,842,0,0,0,,有那么一刹那，我想要，想要…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.98,1:15:01.85,*CHS,843,0,0,0,,我跟伏地魔之间的联系
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.52,1:15:06.12,*CHS,844,0,0,0,,不管原因如何 我变得像他了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.46,1:15:12.36,*CHS,845,0,0,0,,我时常感到愤怒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.53,1:15:17.09,*CHS,846,0,0,0,,而且… 我经历了这么多事情
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.27,1:15:20.83,*CHS,847,0,0,0,,要是我内心出了岔子，怎么办？ 要是我变坏了，怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.47,1:15:26.71,*CHS,848,0,0,0,,认真听我说，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.91,1:15:30.88,*CHS,849,0,0,0,,你不是一个坏人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.72,1:15:36.09,*CHS,850,0,0,0,,你是一个好人 只是遭遇了不幸而已
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.69,1:15:37.81,*CHS,851,0,0,0,,你明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.92,1:15:44.95,*CHS,852,0,0,0,,世界不是分为好人和坏人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.13,1:15:49.59,*CHS,853,0,0,0,,每个人内心都有光明和黑暗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.33,1:15:53.60,*CHS,854,0,0,0,,真正重要的是我们如何选择
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.54,1:15:57.84,*CHS,855,0,0,0,,知道我们究竟是什么人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.58,1:16:03.34,*CHS,856,0,0,0,,哈利，该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.12,1:16:09.38,*CHS,857,0,0,0,,等这一切结束 我们会成为一家人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.55,1:16:11.15,*CHS,858,0,0,0,,到时候你就知道 我是不是正确的了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.29,1:16:13.66,*CHS,859,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.10,1:16:52.26,*CHS,860,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.43,1:16:55.06,*CHS,861,0,0,0,,哈利！哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.23,1:16:57.17,*CHS,862,0,0,0,,海格回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.10,1:17:01.94,*CHS,863,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.15,1:17:19.32,*CHS,864,0,0,0,,我说最后一次
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.62,1:17:21.99,*CHS,865,0,0,0,,我命令你告诉我 你去了那里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.16,1:17:25.19,*CHS,866,0,0,0,,我告诉过你了 我是因为健康理由离开
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.53,1:17:29.69,*CHS,867,0,0,0,,- 你的健康？ - 是，一点新鲜空气，你知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.87,1:17:34.70,*CHS,868,0,0,0,,哦，是啊，作为护林人 很难得到新鲜空气
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.74,1:17:39.23,*CHS,869,0,0,0,,如果我是你，我就不会想着回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.41,1:17:42.68,*CHS,870,0,0,0,,可能连收拾都不需要
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.63,1:18:04.73,*CHS,871,0,0,0,,这是最高机密，对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.64,1:18:08.00,*CHS,872,0,0,0,,邓布利多派我去跟巨人接触
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.17,1:18:09.66,*CHS,873,0,0,0,,巨人？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.91,1:18:11.90,*CHS,874,0,0,0,,你找到他们了？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.08,1:18:15.98,*CHS,875,0,0,0,,说真的，巨人不是很难找 他们那么大
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.85,1:18:19.87,*CHS,876,0,0,0,,我试图劝说他们加入我们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.05,1:18:22.75,*CHS,877,0,0,0,,但游说的不只是我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.45,1:18:25.35,*CHS,878,0,0,0,,- 食死徒 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.82,1:18:29.16,*CHS,879,0,0,0,,试图撺掇他们加入神秘人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.66,1:18:32.03,*CHS,880,0,0,0,,- 他们同意了？ - 我给了他们邓布利多的口信
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.20,1:18:36.29,*CHS,881,0,0,0,,想让他们之中能有人记得 邓布利多一直很善待他们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.90,1:18:41.20,*CHS,882,0,0,0,,他们就是这样回答你的？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.91,1:18:43.67,*CHS,883,0,0,0,,不完全对
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.18,1:18:48.08,*CHS,884,0,0,0,,啊，好吧好吧，给你 你个馋嘴的狗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.06,1:19:04.19,*CHS,885,0,0,0,,外面正在发生变化
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.63,1:19:06.19,*CHS,886,0,0,0,,就像上次一样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.67,1:19:09.29,*CHS,887,0,0,0,,风暴要来了，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.03,1:19:13.09,*CHS,888,0,0,0,,等它来时我们最好做好准备
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.11,1:19:53.13,*CHS,889,0,0,0,,我们已经证实
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.31,1:19:56.14,*CHS,890,0,0,0,,昨天晚上有十名重犯逃脱
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.31,1:19:59.98,*CHS,891,0,0,0,,魔法部长对此种危险深感警觉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.15,1:20:02.24,*CHS,892,0,0,0,,我们强烈地怀疑
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.09,1:20:05.08,*CHS,893,0,0,0,,此次越狱
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.26,1:20:09.45,*CHS,894,0,0,0,,是由有从阿兹卡班 逃脱经验的人主持
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.63,1:20:13.86,*CHS,895,0,0,0,,即小天狼星·布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.30,1:20:19.67,*CHS,896,0,0,0,,逃脱的囚犯包括 贝拉特克里斯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.98,1:20:32.28,*CHS,897,0,0,0,,邓布利多警告过他们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.45,1:20:35.61,*CHS,898,0,0,0,,他们不肯接受事实 会害的我们都送命的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.79,1:20:36.91,*CHS,899,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.62,1:20:42.62,*CHS,900,0,0,0,,我想要道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.23,1:20:47.39,*CHS,901,0,0,0,,现在连我老妈都说 预言家日报的预言不再可信了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.57,1:20:53.47,*CHS,902,0,0,0,,我其实想说的是 我相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.41,1:21:02.00,*CHS,903,0,0,0,,纳威？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.59,1:21:16.72,*CHS,904,0,0,0,,14年前
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.89,1:21:21.16,*CHS,905,0,0,0,,一个叫贝拉特里克斯 莱斯特兰奇的食死徒
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.33,1:21:24.53,*CHS,906,0,0,0,,在我父母身上用了钻心咒
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.10,1:21:29.06,*CHS,907,0,0,0,,她想尽办法折磨他们 想获得信息
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.24,1:21:31.40,*CHS,908,0,0,0,,但他们从未屈服
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.08,1:21:35.57,*CHS,909,0,0,0,,我为是他们的儿子感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.55,1:21:40.42,*CHS,910,0,0,0,,但是我不确定 我有没有准备好让别人知道这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.36,1:21:50.49,*CHS,911,0,0,0,,我们会让他们骄傲的，我保证
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.73,1:21:58.43,*CHS,912,0,0,0,,把它变成强大的记忆 最使你开心的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.60,1:22:02.04,*CHS,913,0,0,0,,让它充满你 试试看，西莫
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.21,1:22:03.61,*CHS,914,0,0,0,,乔治，该你了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.98,1:22:07.27,*CHS,915,0,0,0,,守护神咒！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.21,1:22:11.65,*CHS,916,0,0,0,,完整的守护神是最难做的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.82,1:22:15.65,*CHS,917,0,0,0,,但不完整的也可以 有效对付很多敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.82,1:22:17.05,*CHS,918,0,0,0,,哇哦，不错
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.76,1:22:19.31,*CHS,919,0,0,0,,很棒啊！金妮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.49,1:22:23.52,*CHS,920,0,0,0,,记住，守护神只有 在你专心致志时才有用
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.69,1:22:25.99,*CHS,921,0,0,0,,专心，露娜
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.70,1:22:31.40,*CHS,922,0,0,0,,想你最开心的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.57,1:22:33.54,*CHS,923,0,0,0,,守护神咒！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.70,1:22:36.57,*CHS,924,0,0,0,,- 我在试 - 嗯，别着急，再试试
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.74,1:22:41.01,*CHS,925,0,0,0,,这个真的是很高深的魔法 你们都做的很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.75,1:22:44.15,*CHS,926,0,0,0,,守护神咒！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.99,1:23:28.52,*CHS,927,0,0,0,,我来一次搞定
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.86,1:23:31.85,*CHS,928,0,0,0,,强力爆破咒
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.15,1:23:51.51,*CHS,929,0,0,0,,把他们给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.95,1:23:53.42,*CHS,930,0,0,0,,我用了数周
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.58,1:23:55.52,*CHS,931,0,0,0,,搜寻邓布利多的军队
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.95,1:23:59.65,*CHS,932,0,0,0,,康奈利，这证明了我 一开始就告诉你的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.03,1:24:03.08,*CHS,933,0,0,0,,你对神秘人的恐惧从不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.26,1:24:04.78,*CHS,934,0,0,0,,从来也没有骗到过我们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.96,1:24:07.02,*CHS,935,0,0,0,,我们看穿了你的谎言
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.20,1:24:11.03,*CHS,936,0,0,0,,不过是你阴谋控制魔法部的烟雾而已
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.20,1:24:12.19,*CHS,937,0,0,0,,显然的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.37,1:24:14.89,*CHS,938,0,0,0,,不，教授，这事跟他无关，都是我做的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.07,1:24:18.74,*CHS,939,0,0,0,,哈利你试图掩护我 这是很高尚的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.91,1:24:23.74,*CHS,940,0,0,0,,但正如部长所言，明明是邓布利多的军队 而不是波特的军队
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.91,1:24:26.54,*CHS,941,0,0,0,,我指示哈利成立该组织
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.72,1:24:30.18,*CHS,942,0,0,0,,我，只有我要为此负责
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.35,1:24:32.19,*CHS,943,0,0,0,,向预言家日报发出消息
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.36,1:24:34.88,*CHS,944,0,0,0,,如果我们快点的话 还能赶上晨版
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.06,1:24:39.86,*CHS,945,0,0,0,,多利士、沙克尔 你们带邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.03,1:24:41.46,*CHS,946,0,0,0,,去阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.70,1:24:47.87,*CHS,947,0,0,0,,准备以阴谋和教唆罪受审
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.04,1:24:50.97,*CHS,948,0,0,0,,啊，我想过这个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.14,1:24:55.58,*CHS,949,0,0,0,,你好像以为我会
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.15,1:24:57.58,*CHS,950,0,0,0,,怎么说来着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.75,1:24:59.34,*CHS,951,0,0,0,,束手就擒
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.52,1:25:01.21,*CHS,952,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.65,1:25:03.95,*CHS,953,0,0,0,,我没打算去阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.12,1:25:05.38,*CHS,954,0,0,0,,够了！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.89,1:25:06.98,*CHS,955,0,0,0,,抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.84,1:25:24.21,*CHS,956,0,0,0,,你可能不喜欢他，部长大人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.38,1:25:26.50,*CHS,957,0,0,0,,但是你不能否认
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.04,1:25:29.77,*CHS,958,0,0,0,,邓布利多很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.34,1:25:52.77,*CHS,959,0,0,0,,(多洛雷斯·珍妮·乌姆里奇取代邓布利多成为霍格沃茨校长)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.87,1:25:58.50,*CHS,960,0,0,0,,男生和女生不得 互相接近至8英寸以内
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.68,1:26:02.11,*CHS,961,0,0,0,,加入审讯小组的学生
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.28,1:26:07.31,*CHS,962,0,0,0,,将会针对所有违反纪律的行为进行询问
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.48,1:26:11.78,*CHS,963,0,0,0,,不服从的学生将会立刻被开除
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.20,1:27:24.79,*CHS,964,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.74,1:27:35.14,*CHS,965,0,0,0,,你尽力了 但是那个老巫婆实在是太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.31,1:27:37.68,*CHS,966,0,0,0,,就算邓布利多也没预见到
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.58,1:27:40.74,*CHS,967,0,0,0,,哈利，如果说这是谁的错的话 那也应该是我们的错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.92,1:27:43.01,*CHS,968,0,0,0,,是啊，我们拉你下水的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.19,1:27:45.16,*CHS,969,0,0,0,,但我同意了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.72,1:27:49.85,*CHS,970,0,0,0,,我很努力想要帮忙 但总是把事情弄的更糟
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.90,1:27:54.33,*CHS,971,0,0,0,,现在也没所谓了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.40,1:27:59.60,*CHS,972,0,0,0,,我不想再继续下去了 越继续下去，我就关心的越深
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.77,1:28:02.43,*CHS,973,0,0,0,,关心的越深 则失去的越多
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.61,1:28:05.77,*CHS,974,0,0,0,,- 也许我该… - 该怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.01,1:28:09.95,*CHS,975,0,0,0,,单干
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.29,1:28:17.95,*CHS,976,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.69,1:28:24.13,*CHS,977,0,0,0,,他要带我们到哪里去啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.29,1:28:27.35,*CHS,978,0,0,0,,海格，为什么你不能 直接告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.67,1:28:38.33,*CHS,979,0,0,0,,我从没见半人马们如此狂暴
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.51,1:28:41.07,*CHS,980,0,0,0,,不要靠近他们，他们现在很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.01,1:28:44.34,*CHS,981,0,0,0,,魔法部大大限制了他们的领地
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.52,1:28:46.71,*CHS,982,0,0,0,,他们很快要有暴动了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.88,1:28:48.55,*CHS,983,0,0,0,,海格，到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.72,1:28:50.95,*CHS,984,0,0,0,,真抱歉我这么神秘，三位
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.12,1:28:56.08,*CHS,985,0,0,0,,我本来不想麻烦你们 可是邓布利多离开了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.73,1:28:59.89,*CHS,986,0,0,0,,看样子我也快要滚蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.06,1:29:03.56,*CHS,987,0,0,0,,我在走之前必须要告诉别人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.77,1:29:09.40,*CHS,988,0,0,0,,格洛普
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.81,1:29:13.90,*CHS,989,0,0,0,,在这边，大傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.25,1:29:21.95,*CHS,990,0,0,0,,格洛普
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.72,1:29:24.41,*CHS,991,0,0,0,,我给你带了几个朋友来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.77,1:29:39.03,*CHS,992,0,0,0,,我不能就这么离开他，因为
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.20,1:29:40.93,*CHS,993,0,0,0,,因为他是我兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.10,1:29:42.23,*CHS,994,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.41,1:29:44.43,*CHS,995,0,0,0,,其实是同母异父兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.61,1:29:49.88,*CHS,996,0,0,0,,他很友善的，正如我说的一样 不过他还在学习
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.02,1:29:54.35,*CHS,997,0,0,0,,- 格洛普，礼貌点 - 海格，快想点办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.52,1:29:56.92,*CHS,998,0,0,0,,我们说过这个的 你不抓人的，对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.09,1:29:59.35,*CHS,999,0,0,0,,他们是你的朋友，格洛普！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.52,1:30:00.82,*CHS,1000,0,0,0,,格洛普！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.13,1:30:06.32,*CHS,1001,0,0,0,,格洛普！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.37,1:30:11.43,*CHS,1002,0,0,0,,把我放下
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.11,1:30:16.66,*CHS,1003,0,0,0,,马上！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.82,1:30:29.91,*CHS,1004,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.22,1:30:32.88,*CHS,1005,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.29,1:30:35.59,*CHS,1006,0,0,0,,就是要坚定一点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.76,1:30:38.16,*CHS,1007,0,0,0,,你好像有个崇拜者了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.66,1:30:42.83,*CHS,1008,0,0,0,,你不要靠近她，好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.96,1:31:15.69,*CHS,1009,0,0,0,,他会自己找食物
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.97,1:31:20.03,*CHS,1010,0,0,0,,我离开后他需要有人陪着他
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.37,1:31:23.60,*CHS,1011,0,0,0,,你们会帮我照顾他的，对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.11,1:31:26.80,*CHS,1012,0,0,0,,我是他唯一的亲人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.39,1:31:42.26,*CHS,1013,0,0,0,,多愁善感起来了？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.53,1:31:49.36,*CHS,1014,0,0,0,,- 那是隐私 - 对我来说不是
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.67,1:31:53.16,*CHS,1015,0,0,0,,如果你不努力一点的话 对黑魔头也不是
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.61,1:31:58.77,*CHS,1016,0,0,0,,你任何的记忆 他都可以用作武器来对付你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.94,1:32:03.07,*CHS,1017,0,0,0,,如果他侵入你的心灵 你连两秒钟都坚持不了的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.25,1:32:06.51,*CHS,1018,0,0,0,,你就像你的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.68,1:32:08.48,*CHS,1019,0,0,0,,懒惰、自负
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.65,1:32:10.88,*CHS,1020,0,0,0,,- 不许说我爸爸的坏话！ - 软弱
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.05,1:32:13.22,*CHS,1021,0,0,0,,- 我不软弱！ - 那么证明自己
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.86,1:32:15.79,*CHS,1022,0,0,0,,控制你的情绪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.96,1:32:18.89,*CHS,1023,0,0,0,,克制你的心灵
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.73,1:32:22.93,*CHS,1024,0,0,0,,摄神取念！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.14,1:32:31.23,*CHS,1025,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.41,1:32:33.14,*CHS,1026,0,0,0,,小天狼星
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.81,1:32:35.14,*CHS,1027,0,0,0,,我想吐了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.45,1:32:36.47,*CHS,1028,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.61,1:32:39.91,*CHS,1029,0,0,0,,你管这个叫控制？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.42,1:32:43.48,*CHS,1030,0,0,0,,我们练习几小时了 我需要休息
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.65,1:32:47.05,*CHS,1031,0,0,0,,黑魔头没有休息
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.69,1:32:50.59,*CHS,1032,0,0,0,,你和黑魔头，你们两个的意识混在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.76,1:32:54.72,*CHS,1033,0,0,0,,你这个令人失望的多愁善感的小子 只会苦涩地抱怨生活如何的不公平
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.90,1:32:58.27,*CHS,1034,0,0,0,,你可能没有注意到 生活本来就是不公平的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.44,1:33:02.39,*CHS,1035,0,0,0,,你的父亲知道 实际上他经常炮制不公
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.57,1:33:05.60,*CHS,1036,0,0,0,,- 我父亲是个伟大的人 - 你父亲是头猪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.64,1:33:08.13,*CHS,1037,0,0,0,,- 摄神… - 守护神！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.72,1:33:15.24,*CHS,1038,0,0,0,,来吧，莉莉
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.42,1:33:17.48,*CHS,1039,0,0,0,,斯内普! 除你武器
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.65,1:33:19.49,*CHS,1040,0,0,0,,干得好，詹姆
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.86,1:33:22.15,*CHS,1041,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 障碍咒
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.33,1:33:24.32,*CHS,1042,0,0,0,,斯内普，斯内普，斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.49,1:33:27.16,*CHS,1043,0,0,0,,好了，谁想看我脱掉斯内普的裤子？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.33,1:33:29.59,*CHS,1044,0,0,0,,斯内普，斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.77,1:33:30.96,*CHS,1045,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.94,1:33:34.53,*CHS,1046,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.05,1:33:45.64,*CHS,1047,0,0,0,,你的课程结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.82,1:33:46.94,*CHS,1048,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.12,1:33:50.38,*CHS,1049,0,0,0,,滚出去
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.60,1:34:09.77,*CHS,1050,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字？ - 麦克尔
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.94,1:34:11.84,*CHS,1051,0,0,0,,你的手会好的，麦克尔
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.01,1:34:15.03,*CHS,1052,0,0,0,,没看上去那么糟吧，你看
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.21,1:34:17.24,*CHS,1053,0,0,0,,疤痕已经开始消了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.41,1:34:22.15,*CHS,1054,0,0,0,,几乎看不到疤了 过会儿就不疼了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.53,1:34:32.26,*CHS,1055,0,0,0,,就像我之前和你说的，波特
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.43,1:34:36.20,*CHS,1056,0,0,0,,必须惩罚调皮的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.27,1:34:40.60,*CHS,1057,0,0,0,,知道吗，乔治
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.77,1:34:44.43,*CHS,1058,0,0,0,,我总觉得世上不只是读书而已
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.61,1:34:49.17,*CHS,1059,0,0,0,,弗雷德，我和你不谋而合
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.61,1:34:54.17,*CHS,1060,0,0,0,,(安静  OWL考试  只准使用572号马力诺墨水)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.12,1:36:02.78,*CHS,1061,0,0,0,,哦，教授，你好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.56,1:36:13.32,*CHS,1062,0,0,0,,给你看个好东西
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.29,1:36:40.12,*CHS,1063,0,0,0,,我准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.88,1:38:09.14,*CHS,1064,0,0,0,,我需要那个预言球
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.31,1:38:11.11,*CHS,1065,0,0,0,,那你不如杀了我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.98,1:38:16.54,*CHS,1066,0,0,0,,我会的，但你必须先帮我拿到它
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.72,1:38:18.42,*CHS,1067,0,0,0,,钻心咒！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.96,1:38:22.72,*CHS,1068,0,0,0,,钻心咒！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.10,1:38:35.57,*CHS,1069,0,0,0,,小天狼星
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.74,1:38:36.73,*CHS,1070,0,0,0,,哈利，你确定？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.91,1:38:39.37,*CHS,1071,0,0,0,,我亲眼看见的 就和上次看到韦斯莱一样
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.54,1:38:41.41,*CHS,1072,0,0,0,,和我几个月来梦到的门一样
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.58,1:38:43.64,*CHS,1073,0,0,0,,可我就是想不起来在哪儿见过
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.81,1:38:45.75,*CHS,1074,0,0,0,,小天狼星说过 伏地魔在找一样东西
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.92,1:38:49.21,*CHS,1075,0,0,0,,一个上次没有得到的东西 其实就在神秘事务司
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.39,1:38:51.32,*CHS,1076,0,0,0,,哈利，你听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.82,1:38:54.81,*CHS,1077,0,0,0,,万一这是伏地魔故意让你看到的幻影呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.13,1:38:59.25,*CHS,1078,0,0,0,,他伤害小天狼星的唯一目的是想逼你现身
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.43,1:39:02.92,*CHS,1079,0,0,0,,那万一这是真的呢？ 我就这么袖手旁观？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.10,1:39:06.59,*CHS,1080,0,0,0,,赫敏，他是我唯一的亲人了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.21,1:39:10.19,*CHS,1081,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.61,1:39:13.24,*CHS,1082,0,0,0,,我们得用壁炉通道网络
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.41,1:39:15.47,*CHS,1083,0,0,0,,邓布利多说烟囱都被监视了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.65,1:39:17.20,*CHS,1084,0,0,0,,有一个没有
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.02,1:39:21.35,*CHS,1085,0,0,0,,开门咒
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.60,1:39:34.29,*CHS,1086,0,0,0,,你们想办法警告凤凰社
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.46,1:39:38.03,*CHS,1087,0,0,0,,- 你疯了？我们要跟你一起去！ - 那太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.20,1:39:41.83,*CHS,1088,0,0,0,,你脑子里都在想什么？ 这是我们大家的事
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.01,1:39:45.24,*CHS,1089,0,0,0,,说得没错
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.41,1:39:48.28,*CHS,1090,0,0,0,,他们在帮他的忙
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.28,1:39:55.38,*CHS,1091,0,0,0,,你们要去找邓布利多，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.55,1:39:57.58,*CHS,1092,0,0,0,,- 不是的 - 撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.75,1:40:00.59,*CHS,1093,0,0,0,,- 你叫我，乌姆里奇教授？ - 斯内普，是的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.76,1:40:04.22,*CHS,1094,0,0,0,,该让他们说实话了 不管他们愿不愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.66,1:40:06.19,*CHS,1095,0,0,0,,你把坦白剂带来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.36,1:40:09.26,*CHS,1096,0,0,0,,很遗憾你审讯学生时全用光了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.43,1:40:12.56,*CHS,1097,0,0,0,,最后一份用在了张小姐身上
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.64,1:40:18.11,*CHS,1098,0,0,0,,除非你想对他下毒
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.27,1:40:22.71,*CHS,1099,0,0,0,,如果你真要下的话 我表示真挚的同情
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.31,1:40:25.25,*CHS,1100,0,0,0,,但我帮不了你
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.68,1:40:29.38,*CHS,1101,0,0,0,,大脚板在他手上
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.42,1:40:33.91,*CHS,1102,0,0,0,,大脚板被抓去他藏身的地方了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.39,1:40:36.52,*CHS,1103,0,0,0,,大脚板？大脚板是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.69,1:40:38.22,*CHS,1104,0,0,0,,他在说什么，斯内普？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.90,1:40:46.89,*CHS,1105,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.41,1:40:52.97,*CHS,1106,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.98,1:40:56.31,*CHS,1107,0,0,0,,算了，这是你逼我的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.68,1:40:59.65,*CHS,1108,0,0,0,,这事关魔法部安全守则
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.82,1:41:01.88,*CHS,1109,0,0,0,,你逼得我
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.62,1:41:04.59,*CHS,1110,0,0,0,,别无选择
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.39,1:41:07.58,*CHS,1111,0,0,0,,克里斯塔咒应该能让你张口
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.76,1:41:08.75,*CHS,1112,0,0,0,,那是违法的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.93,1:41:12.29,*CHS,1113,0,0,0,,只要康奈利不知道就行
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.80,1:41:21.33,*CHS,1114,0,0,0,,告诉他，哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.84,1:41:24.27,*CHS,1115,0,0,0,,告诉我什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.48,1:41:27.47,*CHS,1116,0,0,0,,你不告诉她那东西的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.14,1:41:29.91,*CHS,1117,0,0,0,,我会的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.55,1:41:33.35,*CHS,1118,0,0,0,,什么东西？在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.55,1:41:36.85,*CHS,1119,0,0,0,,邓布利多的秘密武器
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.86,1:41:43.38,*CHS,1120,0,0,0,,还有多远？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.56,1:41:45.22,*CHS,1121,0,0,0,,就快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.23,1:41:50.93,*CHS,1122,0,0,0,,必须藏在学生不容易找到的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.27,1:41:56.74,*CHS,1123,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.91,1:41:58.70,*CHS,1124,0,0,0,,随机应变
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.22,1:42:08.81,*CHS,1125,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.12,1:42:12.25,*CHS,1126,0,0,0,,武器在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.16,1:42:19.42,*CHS,1127,0,0,0,,根本就没有这东西，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.20,1:42:24.36,*CHS,1128,0,0,0,,你们在唬弄我
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.57,1:42:30.13,*CHS,1129,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.54,1:42:33.57,*CHS,1130,0,0,0,,我真的很讨厌孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.16,1:42:53.60,*CHS,1131,0,0,0,,这不管你们的事，人头马 这是魔法部的事务
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.27,1:42:57.93,*CHS,1132,0,0,0,,放下武器！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.10,1:43:03.63,*CHS,1133,0,0,0,,我警告你们 在法律上，具有近似人类智力的生物…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.81,1:43:05.03,*CHS,1134,0,0,0,,守护神！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.31,1:43:06.43,*CHS,1135,0,0,0,,放肆！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.08,1:43:08.60,*CHS,1136,0,0,0,,肮脏的杂种！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.38,1:43:10.37,*CHS,1137,0,0,0,,禁锢咒！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.59,1:43:26.19,*CHS,1138,0,0,0,,求你了，快住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.36,1:43:31.03,*CHS,1139,0,0,0,,不够！我要建立秩序！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.88,1:43:42.44,*CHS,1140,0,0,0,,肮脏的畜牲！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.61,1:43:45.58,*CHS,1141,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.75,1:43:48.58,*CHS,1142,0,0,0,,放过他！不是他的错！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.75,1:43:50.62,*CHS,1143,0,0,0,,不要，他不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.29,1:44:01.75,*CHS,1144,0,0,0,,波特，想想办法，告诉他们 我对他们没恶意
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.93,1:44:03.87,*CHS,1145,0,0,0,,对不起，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.03,1:44:05.83,*CHS,1146,0,0,0,,我不可以说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.00,1:44:06.99,*CHS,1147,0,0,0,,你们干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.17,1:44:11.00,*CHS,1148,0,0,0,,我是魔法部资深副部长 多洛雷斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.47,1:44:13.67,*CHS,1149,0,0,0,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.35,1:44:18.14,*CHS,1150,0,0,0,,谢谢你，格洛普
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.31,1:44:21.81,*CHS,1151,0,0,0,,赫敏，赫敏，小天狼星！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.09,1:44:33.65,*CHS,1152,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么逃出来的？ - 呕吐糖果，不好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.83,1:44:35.95,*CHS,1153,0,0,0,,我说我饿了，想吃点甜点
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.13,1:44:38.69,*CHS,1154,0,0,0,,当然他们抢走了糖盒 然后就全吃下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.53,1:44:41.02,*CHS,1155,0,0,0,,你太聪明了，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.87,1:44:44.36,*CHS,1156,0,0,0,,- 我知道肯定是那样 - 简直是天才
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.54,1:44:46.34,*CHS,1157,0,0,0,,好了，我们要怎么去伦敦？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.71,1:44:51.23,*CHS,1158,0,0,0,,听着，我不是不感谢 大家为我做的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.08,1:44:54.77,*CHS,1159,0,0,0,,但…我已经给大家惹了够多麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.95,1:44:57.92,*CHS,1160,0,0,0,,邓布利多军团不是徒有虚名吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.25,1:45:00.38,*CHS,1161,0,0,0,,还是你觉得我们很没用？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.26,1:45:05.45,*CHS,1162,0,0,0,,或许这次不用自己一个人去做了，伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.36,1:45:12.52,*CHS,1163,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么去伦敦？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.93,1:45:16.16,*CHS,1164,0,0,0,,当然是飞过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.22,1:46:09.38,*CHS,1165,0,0,0,,神秘事务司
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.23,1:46:19.93,*CHS,1166,0,0,0,,就是这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.92,1:47:15.25,*CHS,1167,0,0,0,,Ninety-two, Ninety-three.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.96,1:47:18.32,*CHS,1168,0,0,0,,Ninety-four.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.59,1:47:20.62,*CHS,1169,0,0,0,,Ninety-five.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.17,1:47:35.94,*CHS,1170,0,0,0,,- 他应该在这里 - 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.65,1:47:39.94,*CHS,1171,0,0,0,,这上面有你的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.14,1:48:09.51,*CHS,1172,0,0,0,,拥有征服黑魔头能量的人走近了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.34,1:48:12.78,*CHS,1173,0,0,0,,黑魔头标记他为其劲敌
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.95,1:48:15.74,*CHS,1174,0,0,0,,但是他拥有黑魔头所不了解的能量
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.39,1:48:26.76,*CHS,1175,0,0,0,,只有一个能生存下来
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.26,1:48:30.35,*CHS,1176,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.84,1:48:42.33,*CHS,1177,0,0,0,,小天狼星在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.51,1:48:47.61,*CHS,1178,0,0,0,,呃，你真的应该学会 去区别梦境
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.52,1:48:52.68,*CHS,1179,0,0,0,,和现实
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.95,1:48:58.89,*CHS,1180,0,0,0,,你只能看见黑魔头想让你看见的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.59,1:49:01.08,*CHS,1181,0,0,0,,把预言球交出来
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.26,1:49:03.35,*CHS,1182,0,0,0,,你敢动我们，我就砸碎预言球
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.13,1:49:08.69,*CHS,1183,0,0,0,,他还挺机灵的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.87,1:49:12.67,*CHS,1184,0,0,0,,漂亮可爱的娃娃
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.84,1:49:14.07,*CHS,1185,0,0,0,,波特
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.61,1:49:16.51,*CHS,1186,0,0,0,,贝拉特里克斯·莱斯特兰奇
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.68,1:49:19.61,*CHS,1187,0,0,0,,纳威·隆巴顿？ 你父母怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.78,1:49:21.64,*CHS,1188,0,0,0,,很好，因为马上就可以为他们报仇了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.48,1:49:29.29,*CHS,1189,0,0,0,,让我们大家冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.76,1:49:31.25,*CHS,1190,0,0,0,,好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.42,1:49:33.89,*CHS,1191,0,0,0,,我们只想要那个预言球
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.06,1:49:36.26,*CHS,1192,0,0,0,,为什么伏地魔要 我自己来这里拿这东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.43,1:49:38.06,*CHS,1193,0,0,0,,你竟敢直呼他的名字？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.60,1:49:41.19,*CHS,1194,0,0,0,,你这肮脏的杂种
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.37,1:49:43.96,*CHS,1195,0,0,0,,算了，他只是个好奇的孩子罢了 是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.91,1:49:51.37,*CHS,1196,0,0,0,,只有应时而生的人 才能找到预言球
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.54,1:49:54.27,*CHS,1197,0,0,0,,你是在太幸运了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.05,1:49:59.99,*CHS,1198,0,0,0,,你难道一直没想过
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.49,1:50:05.69,*CHS,1199,0,0,0,,为什么你会与黑魔头产生如此强烈的共鸣？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.43,1:50:08.92,*CHS,1200,0,0,0,,为什么他
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.10,1:50:11.62,*CHS,1201,0,0,0,,没有在你还是婴儿的时候杀了你？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.00,1:50:17.80,*CHS,1202,0,0,0,,你不想知道那伤疤的秘密吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.74,1:50:23.14,*CHS,1203,0,0,0,,答案全在那里 波特，在你手里
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.34,1:50:26.34,*CHS,1204,0,0,0,,你只要
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.91,1:50:28.85,*CHS,1205,0,0,0,,把它给我就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.15,1:50:32.45,*CHS,1206,0,0,0,,我会把一切都告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.19,1:50:42.99,*CHS,1207,0,0,0,,我等了14年
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.60,1:50:44.89,*CHS,1208,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.20,1:50:49.13,*CHS,1209,0,0,0,,我想我再等一阵子也无所谓，攻击！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.30,1:50:50.74,*CHS,1210,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.89,1:51:07.88,*CHS,1211,0,0,0,,倒挂金钟！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.43,1:51:16.45,*CHS,1212,0,0,0,,统统石化！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.63,1:51:18.43,*CHS,1213,0,0,0,,干得好，纳威
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.87,1:51:28.43,*CHS,1214,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.18,1:51:31.40,*CHS,1215,0,0,0,,- 昏昏倒地！ - 昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.56,1:51:44.46,*CHS,1216,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.00,1:51:54.30,*CHS,1217,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.32,1:52:12.41,*CHS,1218,0,0,0,,回出口！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.72,1:52:52.21,*CHS,1219,0,0,0,,神秘事务司 看来我们还真找对地方了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.43,1:52:59.33,*CHS,1220,0,0,0,,那声音
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.90,1:53:01.92,*CHS,1221,0,0,0,,能听见在说什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.60,1:53:05.76,*CHS,1222,0,0,0,,这里哪里有什么声音
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.51,1:53:08.27,*CHS,1223,0,0,0,,我们快点离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.44,1:53:10.03,*CHS,1224,0,0,0,,我也听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.15,1:53:15.77,*CHS,1225,0,0,0,,哈利，那只是扇空的拱门
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.55,1:53:19.95,*CHS,1226,0,0,0,,快点，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.72,1:53:22.59,*CHS,1227,0,0,0,,到我身后来！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.14,1:54:11.83,*CHS,1228,0,0,0,,你真的相信…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.00,1:54:16.60,*CHS,1229,0,0,0,,还是你单纯的以为
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.21,1:54:22.34,*CHS,1230,0,0,0,,你们这群孩子能打赢我们？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.85,1:54:29.58,*CHS,1231,0,0,0,,我还是开门见山吧，波特
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.29,1:54:36.63,*CHS,1232,0,0,0,,交出预言球
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.80,1:54:40.79,*CHS,1233,0,0,0,,不然就看着你的朋友们死去
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.71,1:54:55.11,*CHS,1234,0,0,0,,别给他，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.41,1:55:24.17,*CHS,1235,0,0,0,,离我的孩子远一点
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.27,1:55:56.87,*CHS,1236,0,0,0,,听我说，我要你带你的朋友们离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.21,1:55:59.04,*CHS,1237,0,0,0,,什么？不，我要和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.21,1:56:02.05,*CHS,1238,0,0,0,,你已经干得很好了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.68,1:56:04.34,*CHS,1239,0,0,0,,剩下的就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.52,1:56:05.51,*CHS,1240,0,0,0,,布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.68,1:56:34.01,*CHS,1241,0,0,0,,除你武器！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.18,1:56:35.51,*CHS,1242,0,0,0,,干得好，詹姆
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.76,1:56:44.22,*CHS,1243,0,0,0,,索命咒
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.44,1:57:06.74,*CHS,1244,0,0,0,,不！不！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.70,1:57:33.37,*CHS,1245,0,0,0,,我杀了小天狼星·布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.34,1:57:36.31,*CHS,1246,0,0,0,,- 你来追我啊 - 钻心咒
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.65,1:57:51.78,*CHS,1247,0,0,0,,你必须杀了她，哈利，你要下定决心
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.96,1:57:55.72,*CHS,1248,0,0,0,,她杀了他，她活该
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.57,1:58:02.76,*CHS,1249,0,0,0,,你会用那个咒语的，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.31,1:58:15.94,*CHS,1250,0,0,0,,杀了她！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.62,1:58:26.59,*CHS,1251,0,0,0,,太懦弱了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.37,1:58:36.56,*CHS,1252,0,0,0,,我就猜到你今晚会出现，汤姆
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.74,1:58:38.47,*CHS,1253,0,0,0,,凤凰社的人就快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.64,1:58:42.84,*CHS,1254,0,0,0,,届时我早就走了，而你
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.38,1:58:46.47,*CHS,1255,0,0,0,,也活不成
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.78,2:01:02.68,*CHS,1256,0,0,0,,你输了，老骨头
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.84,2:01:23.82,*CHS,1257,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.97,2:01:29.46,*CHS,1258,0,0,0,,没用
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.98,2:01:32.21,*CHS,1259,0,0,0,,脆弱
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.52,2:01:37.50,*CHS,1260,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.05,2:01:44.28,*CHS,1261,0,0,0,,哈利，你跟他是否相像并不重要
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.46,2:01:46.95,*CHS,1262,0,0,0,,你跟他的不同才重要
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.90,2:01:53.39,*CHS,1263,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.80,2:02:27.27,*CHS,1264,0,0,0,,你才是懦弱的人
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.87,2:02:32.00,*CHS,1265,0,0,0,,你从来不懂得爱 不懂得友情
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.41,2:02:38.31,*CHS,1266,0,0,0,,我可怜你
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.37,2:03:04.83,*CHS,1267,0,0,0,,你错了，哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.77,2:03:10.90,*CHS,1268,0,0,0,,你会失去一切的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.86,2:03:27.52,*CHS,1269,0,0,0,,他回来了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.46,2:03:40.42,*CHS,1270,0,0,0,,(邓布利多，波特被澄清)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.46,2:03:42.42,*CHS,1271,0,0,0,,(魔法部长将辞职？)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.46,2:03:49.46,*CHS,1272,0,0,0,,(乌姆里奇停职 准备接受调查)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.46,2:03:54.46,*CHS,1273,0,0,0,,(神秘人归来)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.46,2:03:58.46,*CHS,1274,0,0,0,,(霍格沃茨校长复职)
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.26,2:04:36.92,*CHS,1275,0,0,0,,我知道你的感受，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.10,2:04:38.69,*CHS,1276,0,0,0,,不，你不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.34,2:04:45.74,*CHS,1277,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.90,2:04:49.17,*CHS,1278,0,0,0,,不，是我的失职
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.18,2:04:51.94,*CHS,1279,0,0,0,,我明知你和伏地魔产生共鸣
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.11,2:04:55.17,*CHS,1280,0,0,0,,是早晚的事
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.98,2:05:00.25,*CHS,1281,0,0,0,,我以为疏远你，他就不会这么快下手
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.42,2:05:05.65,*CHS,1282,0,0,0,,那样就能保护你
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.46,2:05:11.79,*CHS,1283,0,0,0,,预言球说
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.40,2:05:16.36,*CHS,1284,0,0,0,,“只有一个生存下来”
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.70,2:05:23.77,*CHS,1285,0,0,0,,是不是，我和他最终一定要杀死对方？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.78,2:05:27.34,*CHS,1286,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.81,2:05:29.37,*CHS,1287,0,0,0,,你为什么不早告诉我？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.55,2:05:33.14,*CHS,1288,0,0,0,,和你救小天狼星是一个理由
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.32,2:05:35.75,*CHS,1289,0,0,0,,还有你朋友救你的理由也是一样的
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.59,2:05:40.12,*CHS,1290,0,0,0,,你吃了这么多年的苦
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.29,2:05:43.19,*CHS,1291,0,0,0,,我不想再让你痛苦了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.66,2:05:46.79,*CHS,1292,0,0,0,,我太在乎你了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.66,2:06:13.96,*CHS,1293,0,0,0,,你怎么没去参加离校宴会
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.13,2:06:18.69,*CHS,1294,0,0,0,,我的东西都丢了 好像有人把它们藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.86,2:06:19.85,*CHS,1295,0,0,0,,那太糟了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.03,2:06:21.93,*CHS,1296,0,0,0,,不，没事的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.10,2:06:25.56,*CHS,1297,0,0,0,,不过今晚是学期结束，我要打包 我得把他们都找回来
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.74,2:06:28.10,*CHS,1298,0,0,0,,要帮忙一起找吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.01,2:06:34.21,*CHS,1299,0,0,0,,我为小天狼星的过世感到遗憾
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.25,2:06:43.31,*CHS,1300,0,0,0,,你确定你不需要帮忙？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.49,2:06:45.15,*CHS,1301,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.32,2:06:47.49,*CHS,1302,0,0,0,,再说，我妈以前经常说
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.66,2:06:51.53,*CHS,1303,0,0,0,,失去的东西总会找到方法回来的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.77,2:06:58.03,*CHS,1304,0,0,0,,虽然回来的方式和我们想象的总有些出入
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.54,2:07:02.23,*CHS,1305,0,0,0,,我想我还是先去吃点布丁
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.91,2:07:40.81,*CHS,1306,0,0,0,,我一直在想邓布利多对我说过的话
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.98,2:07:42.67,*CHS,1307,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.28,2:07:46.05,*CHS,1308,0,0,0,,虽然有一场艰苦的战斗等着我们
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.22,2:07:49.31,*CHS,1309,0,0,0,,但我们有一样伏地魔没有的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.49,2:07:50.98,*CHS,1310,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.89,2:07:55.26,*CHS,1311,0,0,0,,一样值得战斗的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.46,2:08:12.33,*CHS,1312,0,0,0,,
